(1322881, 169903, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful watches in a interesting setting. The teardrop watch, to me, should be the center of focus because it is the lightest of the three and the lightest part of a picture draws the eyes first when it''s surrounded with dark. It would have been nice to have all the watches have the same time on them. That would imply that they were still working. Personally, I might have used a sepia toning.</td>', 'Beautiful watches in a interesting setting. The teardrop watch, to me, should be the center of focus because it is the lightest of the three and the lightest part of a picture draws the eyes first when it''s surrounded with dark. It would have been nice to have all the watches have the same time on them. That would imply that they were still working. Personally, I might have used a sepia toning.', '2005-04-25 08:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
