(1323065, 168507, 34114, '<td valign="top">looks like a real ad.</td>', 'looks like a real ad.', '2005-04-25 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323075, 170074, 34114, '<td valign="top">clever idea.</td>', 'clever idea.', '2005-04-25 10:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323081, 169349, 34041, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, good focus, good Dof. The only negative I see is IMO, I would have reversed this image, so that the twelve as on the left. That way it would seem like the watch was point up, instead of down.</td>', 'Nice colour, good focus, good Dof. The only negative I see is IMO, I would have reversed this image, so that the twelve as on the left. That way it would seem like the watch was point up, instead of down.', '2005-04-25 10:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323083, 168960, 34114, '<td valign="top">great close up.</td>', 'great close up.', '2005-04-25 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323090, 170340, 34041, '<td valign="top">IMO, the font distracts from this image, it does not looks "classy" enough I think.  Also, I would have tried to get more life and shine into the gems, they look rather dead. perhaps a slightly more "head on" angle to the gems would have helped, instead of looking down on them.</td>', 'IMO, the font distracts from this image, it does not looks "classy" enough I think.  Also, I would have tried to get more life and shine into the gems, they look rather dead. perhaps a slightly more "head on" angle to the gems would have helped, instead of looking down on them.', '2005-04-25 10:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323096, 170182, 34041, '<td valign="top">just a bit too dark for my taste.</td>', 'just a bit too dark for my taste.', '2005-04-25 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323102, 170263, 34041, '<td valign="top">great colours. I love the red in the background, really makes the blue pop.  The only suggestions I have is to remove the overblown highlights opn the one central gem.  It seems just a bit too much. Also,  the DoF could have been slightly deeper, to avoid the lack of focus in the the bottom left - very nice overall - 7</td>', 'great colours. I love the red in the background, really makes the blue pop.  The only suggestions I have is to remove the overblown highlights opn the one central gem.  It seems just a bit too much. Also,  the DoF could have been slightly deeper, to avoid the lack of focus in the the bottom left - very nice overall - 7', '2005-04-25 10:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323103, 169472, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture overall. However, eyes are attracted by the women''s face since all the jewelry are out of focus.</td>', 'Very nice picture overall. However, eyes are attracted by the women''s face since all the jewelry are out of focus.', '2005-04-25 10:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323107, 170065, 30605, '<td valign="top">Should have tried to remove the shadow casted by the wrist band on the upper elst of the dial. Also, a bit anoying green reflection on the left side.</td>', 'Should have tried to remove the shadow casted by the wrist band on the upper elst of the dial. Also, a bit anoying green reflection on the left side.', '2005-04-25 10:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323110, 169903, 34041, '<td valign="top">the text color was not a great choice for this image.  White or black would have been better I think.  A slightly deeper DoF to get the right hand watch in sharp focus would also have helped.  Very nice, though.- 7</td>', 'the text color was not a great choice for this image.  White or black would have been better I think.  A slightly deeper DoF to get the right hand watch in sharp focus would also have helped.  Very nice, though.- 7', '2005-04-25 10:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323114, 170037, 34041, '<td valign="top">great concept.  The stryofoam peanuts don''t do it for me however. Perhaps if you had used polished river rocks of about the same size, black ones perhaps, to contrast witht he pearls?</td>', 'great concept.  The stryofoam peanuts don''t do it for me however. Perhaps if you had used polished river rocks of about the same size, black ones perhaps, to contrast witht he pearls?', '2005-04-25 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323124, 169302, 34041, '<td valign="top">cute concept. good lighting - one of the few diamonds that actually shine.  A suggestion - I don''t think the pink background works in this. Perhaps a flat black, and avoiding a seam ? fold? in the foreground.</td>', 'cute concept. good lighting - one of the few diamonds that actually shine.  A suggestion - I don''t think the pink background works in this. Perhaps a flat black, and avoiding a seam ? fold? in the foreground.', '2005-04-25 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323133, 169252, 34041, '<td valign="top">Outstanding - one of the top few, I think.  Also, one of the few where the text actually compliments the image. My only suggestions would be to get just a bit  more sparkle in the diamonds.</td>', 'Outstanding - one of the top few, I think.  Also, one of the few where the text actually compliments the image. My only suggestions would be to get just a bit  more sparkle in the diamonds.', '2005-04-25 10:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323138, 169741, 34041, '<td valign="top">great image, but I''m not sure if you are trying to advertise the ring, the watch or the stones?  seashells?</td>', 'great image, but I''m not sure if you are trying to advertise the ring, the watch or the stones?  seashells?', '2005-04-25 10:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323144, 169354, 34041, '<td valign="top">great lighting. Nice shine on the gems. I''d have perhaps cropped the top just slightly lower, 1/3 inch more or so, to really put the focus on the necklace.</td>', 'great lighting. Nice shine on the gems. I''d have perhaps cropped the top just slightly lower, 1/3 inch more or so, to really put the focus on the necklace.', '2005-04-25 10:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323147, 170081, 34041, '<td valign="top">Image looks a bit gray overall.</td>', 'Image looks a bit gray overall.', '2005-04-25 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323150, 170327, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s clean, definitely bright...wish there was someway to get some sparkle.  I like your choice of text.  The ''Forever'' is blocking out some of the reflection. 8</td>', 'It''s clean, definitely bright...wish there was someway to get some sparkle.  I like your choice of text.  The ''Forever'' is blocking out some of the reflection. 8', '2005-04-25 10:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323158, 169861, 28464, '<td valign="top">Awesome clear shot! And a Bentley tooo  :O</td>', 'Awesome clear shot! And a Bentley tooo  :O', '2005-04-25 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323160, 169472, 30049, '<td valign="top">Gutsy move - incorporating a person profile and jewelry in one.  In this case the person wins, the jewelry seems to be a minor subject.  If anything, this looks like a sunglasses advertisement.  Well done for that - but for jewelry it''s not quite right.  Nice photo however...</td>', 'Gutsy move - incorporating a person profile and jewelry in one.  In this case the person wins, the jewelry seems to be a minor subject.  If anything, this looks like a sunglasses advertisement.  Well done for that - but for jewelry it''s not quite right.  Nice photo however...', '2005-04-25 10:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323163, 168960, 34041, '<td valign="top">nice image - great focus. IMO, a bit more light on the diamonds would have helped, and perhaps given them the bit of sparkle they lack, and there is some slight haloing around some the edges  - eg the very tip of the the kiss and the bottom left and mid right of the kiss as well. Otherwise, great job. - 8</td>', 'nice image - great focus. IMO, a bit more light on the diamonds would have helped, and perhaps given them the bit of sparkle they lack, and there is some slight haloing around some the edges  - eg the very tip of the the kiss and the bottom left and mid right of the kiss as well. Otherwise, great job. - 8', '2005-04-25 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323164, 170156, 35804, '<td valign="top">The texture/tones of the blurred skin are a little blotcy/mottled, perhaps if it were smoother and not so diffuse this would be more effective?</td>', 'The texture/tones of the blurred skin are a little blotcy/mottled, perhaps if it were smoother and not so diffuse this would be more effective?', '2005-04-25 10:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323169, 170303, 34041, '<td valign="top">focus seems to be more on the tip of the table? in the foreground, and not on the gems.</td>', 'focus seems to be more on the tip of the table? in the foreground, and not on the gems.', '2005-04-25 10:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323172, 170158, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice text, nice choice of background (wood) and most importantly, good job of photographing the jewelry piece.  I like the lighting and the few hotspots.  Those hotspots would have been really neat with a star filter.  ;^)</td>', 'Nice text, nice choice of background (wood) and most importantly, good job of photographing the jewelry piece.  I like the lighting and the few hotspots.  Those hotspots would have been really neat with a star filter.  ;^)', '2005-04-25 10:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323177, 169758, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Lighting is lacking something.  Maybe it''s the background - it looks grey, where white (try black maybe?) may have been a better choice.  Good job.</td>', 'Great idea.  Lighting is lacking something.  Maybe it''s the background - it looks grey, where white (try black maybe?) may have been a better choice.  Good job.', '2005-04-25 10:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323180, 169396, 35804, '<td valign="top">"Elegant Bling" seems like an oxymoron to me in some way...I tend to equate "bling" with tacky and tasteless....that being said....this is a lovely picture, beautiful light and clarity...the text was just not necessary.</td>', '"Elegant Bling" seems like an oxymoron to me in some way...I tend to equate "bling" with tacky and tasteless....that being said....this is a lovely picture, beautiful light and clarity...the text was just not necessary.', '2005-04-25 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323182, 169970, 34041, '<td valign="top">your reflection inthe ring is a bit distracting. otherwise, great image, ecellent lighting and focus, good use of text , just the right choice in DoF. Good job - 8</td>', 'your reflection inthe ring is a bit distracting. otherwise, great image, ecellent lighting and focus, good use of text , just the right choice in DoF. Good job - 8', '2005-04-25 10:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323185, 170345, 35804, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but I think if we could see the ring a bit more, this image might be more effective?</td>', 'Neat idea, but I think if we could see the ring a bit more, this image might be more effective?', '2005-04-25 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323194, 169958, 30049, '<td valign="top">I take it the red cast is intentional?  I like the photo in general.  The off-centering of the watch I''m not so sure works in this case because there isn''t enough negative space to the left - it looks like a mistake.  Good lighting with the highlights and shadows.  Just noticed, something is reflecting in the watch glass face starting from just left of the date over to what would be the 1...</td>', 'I take it the red cast is intentional?  I like the photo in general.  The off-centering of the watch I''m not so sure works in this case because there isn''t enough negative space to the left - it looks like a mistake.  Good lighting with the highlights and shadows.  Just noticed, something is reflecting in the watch glass face starting from just left of the date over to what would be the 1...', '2005-04-25 10:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323197, 170234, 33379, '<td valign="top">great photo, i love the colors and the necklace..looks great</td>', 'great photo, i love the colors and the necklace..looks great', '2005-04-25 10:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323198, 170361, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very much like what you would see in a magazine...appropriate text/font usage...very nicely done</td>', 'Very much like what you would see in a magazine...appropriate text/font usage...very nicely done', '2005-04-25 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323202, 169950, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey - what''s so retro about that ring?!  It looks like mine and I''m not a grandparent yet!  ;^)  I like your choice of text.  The gold color cast to the image is appropriate.  the lighting and exposure is well done.  Good job!</td>', 'Hey - what''s so retro about that ring?!  It looks like mine and I''m not a grandparent yet!  ;^)  I like your choice of text.  The gold color cast to the image is appropriate.  the lighting and exposure is well done.  Good job!', '2005-04-25 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323208, 170320, 35804, '<td valign="top">A really nice and effective image a bit overwhelmed by text...maybe a different size/font/color may have helped.</td>', 'A really nice and effective image a bit overwhelmed by text...maybe a different size/font/color may have helped.', '2005-04-25 10:38:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1323214, 170086, 33379, '<td valign="top">nice ape lol</td>', 'nice ape lol', '2005-04-25 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323215, 169472, 35804, '<td valign="top">I think maybe the sunglasses seem to be the focal point/subject of this picture because they are one of the few things with nice sharp clarity...the jewels are just something in the background...a really nice image though</td>', 'I think maybe the sunglasses seem to be the focal point/subject of this picture because they are one of the few things with nice sharp clarity...the jewels are just something in the background...a really nice image though', '2005-04-25 10:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323216, 169822, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think this would have come off better with a different color background.  The green is distracting against the gold and whatever color the stone is supposed to be.  The photographers hand is also quite visible in the reflection of the top right loop.</td>', 'I think this would have come off better with a different color background.  The green is distracting against the gold and whatever color the stone is supposed to be.  The photographers hand is also quite visible in the reflection of the top right loop.', '2005-04-25 10:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323220, 169252, 33379, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-04-25 10:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323242, 169327, 35804, '<td valign="top">The overall image tone seems to be a little blue...very nice "sparkle" in the stones. The text is a little strange, mainly because of the stated price...seems a little exaggerated.</td>', 'The overall image tone seems to be a little blue...very nice "sparkle" in the stones. The text is a little strange, mainly because of the stated price...seems a little exaggerated.', '2005-04-25 10:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323248, 169349, 33379, '<td valign="top">off centered</td>', 'off centered', '2005-04-25 10:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323249, 170159, 11800, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential. The rich burgundy cloth contrasts nicely with the pearls. The pearls are exposed well. What I see as problems are the noise, the glare from the light and the reflection of the photographer in the glass. Oh. And the two gray x marks.  A suggestion for the light. Place it somewhat above and behind the glass and use a light reflector (poster board) in front the light up the pearls. Stand back and use the self timer on the camera.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential. The rich burgundy cloth contrasts nicely with the pearls. The pearls are exposed well. What I see as problems are the noise, the glare from the light and the reflection of the photographer in the glass. Oh. And the two gray x marks.  A suggestion for the light. Place it somewhat above and behind the glass and use a light reflector (poster board) in front the light up the pearls. Stand back and use the self timer on the camera.', '2005-04-25 10:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323255, 169869, 30605, '<td valign="top">You should have tried to remove the most obvious dust particles with an editing software. Member challenges allows spot editing.</td>', 'You should have tried to remove the most obvious dust particles with an editing software. Member challenges allows spot editing.', '2005-04-25 10:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323257, 169758, 35804, '<td valign="top">I have the second swatch from the top...cool! Really nice picture and proper text.</td>', 'I have the second swatch from the top...cool! Really nice picture and proper text.', '2005-04-25 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323267, 170305, 30605, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit uninteresting IMHO.</td>', 'Composition is a bit uninteresting IMHO.', '2005-04-25 10:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323268, 170340, 35804, '<td valign="top">The picture is beautiful...the text is another story...very jaggy and BIG...you have done a nice job with the gold, very warm and luminous.</td>', 'The picture is beautiful...the text is another story...very jaggy and BIG...you have done a nice job with the gold, very warm and luminous.', '2005-04-25 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323279, 170318, 36102, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the bracelet could have been a little brighter</td>', 'Nice photo, the bracelet could have been a little brighter', '2005-04-25 10:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323288, 169504, 36102, '<td valign="top">Good shot, doesn''t really say jewlery advertisement to me though</td>', 'Good shot, doesn''t really say jewlery advertisement to me though', '2005-04-25 10:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323290, 168355, 30605, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. I have a watche photograph in this challenge too and discover first hand how hard it is to prevent nasty reflections. Bravo.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. I have a watche photograph in this challenge too and discover first hand how hard it is to prevent nasty reflections. Bravo.', '2005-04-25 10:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323295, 169252, 35804, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture, you have captured the sparkle and clarity nicely...the text doesn''t enhace this for me...it''s a little confusing.</td>', 'Pretty picture, you have captured the sparkle and clarity nicely...the text doesn''t enhace this for me...it''s a little confusing.', '2005-04-25 10:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323301, 168939, 36102, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  My only suggestion would be to get the light pointed right at that top diamond to see it sparkle more.</td>', 'Very nice.  My only suggestion would be to get the light pointed right at that top diamond to see it sparkle more.', '2005-04-25 10:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323306, 170325, 36102, '<td valign="top">Very cute, jewlery seems a little more out of focus than the flower.</td>', 'Very cute, jewlery seems a little more out of focus than the flower.', '2005-04-25 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323311, 170149, 36102, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-04-25 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323314, 169970, 30605, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too much thing reflecting on the ring. I don''t know if it was what you wanted to achieve. Is this really the sky and a house showing on the ring?</td>', 'I think there''s too much thing reflecting on the ring. I don''t know if it was what you wanted to achieve. Is this really the sky and a house showing on the ring?', '2005-04-25 10:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323317, 169970, 36102, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  If there was a way to get this without you in the ring it would be perfect.</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  If there was a way to get this without you in the ring it would be perfect.', '2005-04-25 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323324, 169467, 36102, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-04-25 10:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
