(1323564, 169563, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The backlighting shows the color of the stone off almost perfectly. The lines add a visual interest.</td>', 'Interesting. The backlighting shows the color of the stone off almost perfectly. The lines add a visual interest.', '2005-04-25 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323565, 170165, 35739, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I would have used PS to elimanate the reflection of the drawing on the edge of the watch and perhaps some of the shadows.  But thats me.  Still a very good shot.</td>', 'Well done.  I would have used PS to elimanate the reflection of the drawing on the edge of the watch and perhaps some of the shadows.  But thats me.  Still a very good shot.', '2005-04-25 11:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323569, 170195, 35739, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Perhaps if the watch was sitting a little different on her wrist.  So you could see more of the watch.</td>', 'Very nice. Perhaps if the watch was sitting a little different on her wrist.  So you could see more of the watch.', '2005-04-25 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323570, 169554, 35098, '<td valign="top">I can see this in my Cosmo!  This is the best I''ve seen on here!</td>', 'I can see this in my Cosmo!  This is the best I''ve seen on here!', '2005-04-25 11:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323573, 168475, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Definitely sends a message and a good one at that.  Not sure that it''s "Jewelry Advertisement"...  I could see some non-profit or gov''t agency picking up on this one.  As a photo I like seeing the eyes in the background.  The composition with the ring placement is very good.  This must be a very shallow DOF, because the two primary knuckles are in great focus but the ring is just outside of being clear.  Good job overall.</td>', 'Interesting.  Definitely sends a message and a good one at that.  Not sure that it''s "Jewelry Advertisement"...  I could see some non-profit or gov''t agency picking up on this one.  As a photo I like seeing the eyes in the background.  The composition with the ring placement is very good.  This must be a very shallow DOF, because the two primary knuckles are in great focus but the ring is just outside of being clear.  Good job overall.', '2005-04-25 11:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323574, 168945, 35098, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2005-04-25 11:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323579, 169613, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice with the blue color cast.  This works well with the black and white on the watch.  Great use of lighting and the DOF is right on with it fading from bottom to the top third.  This should score high, but I think not having text will keep it out of the top three.  I know text isn''t required, but you know DPC voters...</td>', 'Very nice with the blue color cast.  This works well with the black and white on the watch.  Great use of lighting and the DOF is right on with it fading from bottom to the top third.  This should score high, but I think not having text will keep it out of the top three.  I know text isn''t required, but you know DPC voters...', '2005-04-25 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323580, 169472, 11800, '<td valign="top">With all those expensive looking diamonds hanging around, it seems to me a bit odd that the sunglasses are the featured item. Nary a diamond on them either. :) Nice picture otherwise.</td>', 'With all those expensive looking diamonds hanging around, it seems to me a bit odd that the sunglasses are the featured item. Nary a diamond on them either. :) Nice picture otherwise.', '2005-04-25 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323581, 170183, 36102, '<td valign="top">the second hand is blurry</td>', 'the second hand is blurry', '2005-04-25 11:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323583, 169444, 35098, '<td valign="top">Cute, but language probably won''t work to your advantage.</td>', 'Cute, but language probably won''t work to your advantage.', '2005-04-25 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323584, 170339, 36102, '<td valign="top">took me a minute to get it.</td>', 'took me a minute to get it.', '2005-04-25 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323589, 170094, 36102, '<td valign="top">the hand is blocking the smiths, other than that, perfect.</td>', 'the hand is blocking the smiths, other than that, perfect.', '2005-04-25 11:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323590, 170079, 9111, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excelletn!! <br/>Lighting:  very good!   woud like to see more of the bevels on the top, but realize how difficult that is <br/>Color: excellent!<br/>Clarity: Good! <br/>Lettering: None, but you left room for any kind of advertising wording</td>', 'Composition: Excelletn!! Lighting:  very good!   woud like to see more of the bevels on the top, but realize how difficult that is Color: excellent!Clarity: Good! Lettering: None, but you left room for any kind of advertising wording', '2005-04-25 11:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323591, 170195, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, not sure how it''s going to go with the majority of voters.  The focus object is small in relation to the photo.  As a jewelry advertisment challenge...hmmm, well good luck.  This might work for the ''Minimalism'' challenge.  ;^)  As a photo I think you did a great job with the lighting, considering you have some backlight with a white shirt - that can be challenging.  DOF fades just past the watch, keeping her face and the watch in focus with the hand blurring out - I like that.  Good job overall.</td>', 'Nice idea, not sure how it''s going to go with the majority of voters.  The focus object is small in relation to the photo.  As a jewelry advertisment challenge...hmmm, well good luck.  This might work for the ''Minimalism'' challenge.  ;^)  As a photo I think you did a great job with the lighting, considering you have some backlight with a white shirt - that can be challenging.  DOF fades just past the watch, keeping her face and the watch in focus with the hand blurring out - I like that.  Good job overall.', '2005-04-25 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323592, 169968, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice clear and well done photo.</td>', 'Nice clear and well done photo.', '2005-04-25 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323594, 170166, 35098, '<td valign="top">This looks very good.  Looks like something I''d see in a "real" ad.</td>', 'This looks very good.  Looks like something I''d see in a "real" ad.', '2005-04-25 11:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323595, 170271, 36102, '<td valign="top">I wish the model looked happier.</td>', 'I wish the model looked happier.', '2005-04-25 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323596, 168595, 11800, '<td valign="top">It looks like all the stamens(?) are looking at the  exotic beauty and that is fun. But the reflections on the gold are a distraction. I don''t have a clue how you could avoid it other than raising the piece up a bit and closing down the lens.</td>', 'It looks like all the stamens(?) are looking at the  exotic beauty and that is fun. But the reflections on the gold are a distraction. I don''t have a clue how you could avoid it other than raising the piece up a bit and closing down the lens.', '2005-04-25 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323597, 169757, 35098, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-04-25 11:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323599, 170234, 35098, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Just awesome!</td>', 'Love it!  Just awesome!', '2005-04-25 11:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323601, 169714, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like it.  Very interesting piece of jewelry.  Good choice of text, the composition and focus is very good. Only issue I have is the lighting.  I wish the light could have been difused some to eliminate the hot spot on the skull ring forehead.  Good job, and good luck.</td>', 'Nice.  I like it.  Very interesting piece of jewelry.  Good choice of text, the composition and focus is very good. Only issue I have is the lighting.  I wish the light could have been difused some to eliminate the hot spot on the skull ring forehead.  Good job, and good luck.', '2005-04-25 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323602, 170118, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very high quality photograph.  Very clean and crisp.  The only 10 I will give.</td>', 'Very high quality photograph.  Very clean and crisp.  The only 10 I will give.', '2005-04-25 11:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323604, 169543, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF and the text is just perfect.  I gave this a 9 but I would have liked to see a little more light on the pearls.  Good job.</td>', 'Love the DOF and the text is just perfect.  I gave this a 9 but I would have liked to see a little more light on the pearls.  Good job.', '2005-04-25 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323605, 169968, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and classic.  Simple designs but very well pulled off.  I gave it a 9 and not sure if I like the hard shadows.</td>', 'Very elegant and classic.  Simple designs but very well pulled off.  I gave it a 9 and not sure if I like the hard shadows.', '2005-04-25 11:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323607, 169861, 35098, '<td valign="top">This is so awesome!!  I can picture it in a Maxim!</td>', 'This is so awesome!!  I can picture it in a Maxim!', '2005-04-25 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323609, 169694, 36078, '<td valign="top">Loved the photograph overall.  Reminds me of a jewelry ad out of a magazine.  Would have liked to see a little color on the ring.  Still I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Loved the photograph overall.  Reminds me of a jewelry ad out of a magazine.  Would have liked to see a little color on the ring.  Still I gave it a 9.', '2005-04-25 11:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323611, 170327, 36078, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rings are in the center of the image.  Pulls your eyes directly to them.  Nice proportions.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I like the way the rings are in the center of the image.  Pulls your eyes directly to them.  Nice proportions.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 11:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323613, 170166, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great photo by itself.  Forget about Jewelry Advertisment for a minute.  Composition, lighting, focus...all the key elements are right on!  I''m mixed as to the value of this photo as an advertisement for jewelry - not much of the jewelry to see.  I guess it''s all a matter of taste.  When I''m buying a watch (which I''ve done numerous times) I want a little more detail.  That''s just me.  As a photo this should place high with DPC voters.  7 from me.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great photo by itself.  Forget about Jewelry Advertisment for a minute.  Composition, lighting, focus...all the key elements are right on!  I''m mixed as to the value of this photo as an advertisement for jewelry - not much of the jewelry to see.  I guess it''s all a matter of taste.  When I''m buying a watch (which I''ve done numerous times) I want a little more detail.  That''s just me.  As a photo this should place high with DPC voters.  7 from me.  Good luck.', '2005-04-25 11:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323614, 170080, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the overall design and the colors of the rocks.  Makes it much more classic for a mans watch.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Love the overall design and the colors of the rocks.  Makes it much more classic for a mans watch.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 11:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323615, 169541, 11800, '<td valign="top">So far this is one of the best. The composition, clarity, concept and lighting are good. The only thing I can see that bothers me is the cut off stone by the necklace. It seems like it should have been either in or out of the picture. Just as a fyi. When you work with sand, take a paintbrush to feather around where you worked.</td>', 'So far this is one of the best. The composition, clarity, concept and lighting are good. The only thing I can see that bothers me is the cut off stone by the necklace. It seems like it should have been either in or out of the picture. Just as a fyi. When you work with sand, take a paintbrush to feather around where you worked.', '2005-04-25 12:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323617, 169822, 36078, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt in the image.  I love the background colors but not sure if they work well with the peice.  I still gave it an 8.</td>', 'I like the tilt in the image.  I love the background colors but not sure if they work well with the peice.  I still gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323618, 170265, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. On the other hand, i find the colours way too strong, especially the orange/red of the flower, as it takes too much away from the jewel(Blue). Also the pic seems to be suffering from a little soft focusing. More sharpness would''ve been a good idea. The Text is almost non existant and hard to read. Writen on a black frame would''ve helped a lot. 6</td>', 'Very interesting composition. On the other hand, i find the colours way too strong, especially the orange/red of the flower, as it takes too much away from the jewel(Blue). Also the pic seems to be suffering from a little soft focusing. More sharpness would''ve been a good idea. The Text is almost non existant and hard to read. Writen on a black frame would''ve helped a lot. 6', '2005-04-25 12:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323619, 170300, 36078, '<td valign="top">Nicely done piece.  Would have liked to seen a strong shadow but that is just me personally.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nicely done piece.  Would have liked to seen a strong shadow but that is just me personally.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 12:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323621, 170263, 9111, '<td valign="top">Composition: good<br/>Lighting:  not to my tastes<br/>Color:  Sortry but I dopnt like the colors<br/>Clarity:  front necklace is clear at closest part but rest appears out of focus<br/>Lettering:  very nice! <br/> <br/>All around I woudlnt choose this to advertise the jewelry<br/> <br/></td>', 'Composition: goodLighting:  not to my tastesColor:  Sortry but I dopnt like the colorsClarity:  front necklace is clear at closest part but rest appears out of focusLettering:  very nice!  All around I woudlnt choose this to advertise the jewelry ', '2005-04-25 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323622, 168507, 36078, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF  Lovely colors and simple white background.  Not sure about the text but what do I know.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Nice DOF  Lovely colors and simple white background.  Not sure about the text but what do I know.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323623, 170086, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. The background doesn''t seem to work too well with the "model", unfortunatly. And although i understand the concept, the ''ad'' should be about the jewelry, which we don''t see very much in the picture. Text is also not very interesting. 5</td>', 'Cute idea. The background doesn''t seem to work too well with the "model", unfortunatly. And although i understand the concept, the ''ad'' should be about the jewelry, which we don''t see very much in the picture. Text is also not very interesting. 5', '2005-04-25 12:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323624, 170341, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful piece of art.  It doesn''t seem to be focused to me. Maybe it''s my monitor.</td>', 'Beautiful piece of art.  It doesn''t seem to be focused to me. Maybe it''s my monitor.', '2005-04-25 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323626, 169613, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the angle.  Very good detail in the image.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Love the angle.  Very good detail in the image.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323627, 168960, 36078, '<td valign="top">Lovely design and idea.  Very nicely pulled off.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Lovely design and idea.  Very nicely pulled off.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323628, 169829, 25571, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, unfortunatly the composition suffers greatly. Lower Left shows a bit of cloth which is bugging, especially since its so obvious with the text over it. The Focus is not sharp enough, not giving the jewel enought attention. Also the number of neckless is, although normal and ''natural'', doesn''t help the jewel to stand out. 5</td>', 'The idea is nice, unfortunatly the composition suffers greatly. Lower Left shows a bit of cloth which is bugging, especially since its so obvious with the text over it. The Focus is not sharp enough, not giving the jewel enought attention. Also the number of neckless is, although normal and ''natural'', doesn''t help the jewel to stand out. 5', '2005-04-25 12:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323629, 170305, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is "OK".  I think the DOF could be a bit deeper to include the winding button/dial on the right.  The shadow in the date window on the watch face is a bit distracting.  Otherwise, nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is "OK".  I think the DOF could be a bit deeper to include the winding button/dial on the right.  The shadow in the date window on the watch face is a bit distracting.  Otherwise, nice shot.  Good luck.', '2005-04-25 12:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323631, 169958, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the colors to the watch face.  Everything is in nice proportions.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Love the colors to the watch face.  Everything is in nice proportions.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323636, 169563, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very nice design.  Love the lighting effects.  Very simple and right to the point.  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Very nice design.  Love the lighting effects.  Very simple and right to the point.  I gave it a 9.', '2005-04-25 12:05:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1323642, 170230, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, so close!  Great concept and composition.  It''s just too overexposed around the top edge of the rings - they get lost in the water reflections.</td>', 'Oh, so close!  Great concept and composition.  It''s just too overexposed around the top edge of the rings - they get lost in the water reflections.', '2005-04-25 12:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323643, 170183, 25571, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, would do good on a billboard. The picture could''ve used a slighty better focus, the sharpness is lacking a little. I find the ''black'' background to be distracting as it doesn''t split the image in a good way with the watch, taking away the bracelet. Also, there is this big reflection in the lens (goldish white) which doesn''t help. Dig what the watch is resting on tho. 6</td>', 'interesting composition, would do good on a billboard. The picture could''ve used a slighty better focus, the sharpness is lacking a little. I find the ''black'' background to be distracting as it doesn''t split the image in a good way with the watch, taking away the bracelet. Also, there is this big reflection in the lens (goldish white) which doesn''t help. Dig what the watch is resting on tho. 6', '2005-04-25 12:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323646, 169950, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like the tilt on the rings.  Not sure about the skinny text but just a personal opinon.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like the tilt on the rings.  Not sure about the skinny text but just a personal opinon.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 12:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323649, 168804, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.  Very simple looking watch but photo aken very nicely.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Love the colors.  Very simple looking watch but photo aken very nicely.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323652, 170165, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea! I like the text and slogan as well! The watch is in superb focus sharpness. Lighting is very good as well. I like the background detail as well, giving more ''power'' to the watch, following the ''Accuracy'' theme! Very nice. One thing that bugs me is the Reflection. It drags away the image and breaks the ''accuracy''. 8</td>', 'Very cool idea! I like the text and slogan as well! The watch is in superb focus sharpness. Lighting is very good as well. I like the background detail as well, giving more ''power'' to the watch, following the ''Accuracy'' theme! Very nice. One thing that bugs me is the Reflection. It drags away the image and breaks the ''accuracy''. 8', '2005-04-25 12:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323655, 170230, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  Me personally I would have liked to see the water a little more clearly.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Love the idea.  Me personally I would have liked to see the water a little more clearly.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-04-25 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323658, 169579, 21714, '<td valign="top">Skillfully done and presented image. There''s little specs on the jewellery, which I think takes a bit away from the clean image. Well done.</td>', 'Skillfully done and presented image. There''s little specs on the jewellery, which I think takes a bit away from the clean image. Well done.', '2005-04-25 12:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323663, 170046, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very well controlled, beautiful lighting. Bit unsure about the balance of the presentation, but it''s not like I have brilliant ideas :) Well done.</td>', 'Very well controlled, beautiful lighting. Bit unsure about the balance of the presentation, but it''s not like I have brilliant ideas :) Well done.', '2005-04-25 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323667, 170183, 11800, '<td valign="top">Gosh, hope you can understand my post. Fine watch with a good supporting setting. I like the hand sweep. Nitpic, the fade off in the background seems, to me, to be to abrupt. That''s the transition between gray and black.</td>', 'Gosh, hope you can understand my post. Fine watch with a good supporting setting. I like the hand sweep. Nitpic, the fade off in the background seems, to me, to be to abrupt. That''s the transition between gray and black.', '2005-04-25 12:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323669, 169829, 19672, '<td valign="top">If the pendent was just a little more in focus I''d score this an extra point higher.</td>', 'If the pendent was just a little more in focus I''d score this an extra point higher.', '2005-04-25 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323671, 169861, 19672, '<td valign="top">Extremely clear</td>', 'Extremely clear', '2005-04-25 12:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323677, 168945, 19672, '<td valign="top">I think you got hit by the same problem I did. Bet you composed this on an LCD monitor.  But on CRT it''s real dark and hard to read. So you''ll probably lose a point or two for that.. But great composition...nicely done</td>', 'I think you got hit by the same problem I did. Bet you composed this on an LCD monitor.  But on CRT it''s real dark and hard to read. So you''ll probably lose a point or two for that.. But great composition...nicely done', '2005-04-25 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323680, 170362, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, nice shot.  The shadows of the background used are a bit distracting.  It would be nice if there was one major reflection on the top of the pearl.  The lighting and focus on the gold is good.  For this challenge you may take a minor hit for not having any text, especially with all the negative space available.  I know, text was not required for this challenge, but I think most voters are going to be looking for some with a photo such as yours.  Overall, good job.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok, nice shot.  The shadows of the background used are a bit distracting.  It would be nice if there was one major reflection on the top of the pearl.  The lighting and focus on the gold is good.  For this challenge you may take a minor hit for not having any text, especially with all the negative space available.  I know, text was not required for this challenge, but I think most voters are going to be looking for some with a photo such as yours.  Overall, good job.  Good luck.', '2005-04-25 12:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323688, 169968, 11800, '<td valign="top">Neat. At first I didn''t like the double reflections but considering the maker of the earrings, I think they are an added interest. Good job.</td>', 'Neat. At first I didn''t like the double reflections but considering the maker of the earrings, I think they are an added interest. Good job.', '2005-04-25 12:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323689, 170318, 36078, '<td valign="top">very nice concept.  Love the silhouette.  I gave it and 8.</td>', 'very nice concept.  Love the silhouette.  I gave it and 8.', '2005-04-25 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323693, 169877, 36078, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF but their appears to be banding on the graident on the braclet holder.  Not sure if they was because of the small file size req.  I still gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like the DOF but their appears to be banding on the graident on the braclet holder.  Not sure if they was because of the small file size req.  I still gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323695, 168575, 30049, '<td valign="top">It looks like you were trying to imitate a flower with the jewelry on the artificial flower.  Why not use a real flower?  That would have been pretty cool.  The "flower" in this case is distracting because of the cloth pattern.  The lighting to the left is a bit hot, and you have some lens flare on the upper right of the flower it looks like.  Neat concept.  Good luck.</td>', 'It looks like you were trying to imitate a flower with the jewelry on the artificial flower.  Why not use a real flower?  That would have been pretty cool.  The "flower" in this case is distracting because of the cloth pattern.  The lighting to the left is a bit hot, and you have some lens flare on the upper right of the flower it looks like.  Neat concept.  Good luck.', '2005-04-25 12:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323696, 169491, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  Not sure how many people will get it.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Love the idea.  Not sure how many people will get it.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 12:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323697, 170203, 36078, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors.   I would have liked to seen a border and some text.  Not that it was req. but I thought it would have added to an "ad" feel.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Lovely colors.   I would have liked to seen a border and some text.  Not that it was req. but I thought it would have added to an "ad" feel.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 12:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323698, 170183, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very good detail in the watch.  Love the mat orwhatever it is the watch is on.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Very good detail in the watch.  Love the mat orwhatever it is the watch is on.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
