(1323751, 169829, 11800, '<td valign="top">The softness is alright for this one. It does seem asthe focus is missing the mark but it adds a romantic feel to the picture. Would have been a higher score without the chin or more of the face. Either one would seem more purposeful to me.</td>', 'The softness is alright for this one. It does seem asthe focus is missing the mark but it adds a romantic feel to the picture. Would have been a higher score without the chin or more of the face. Either one would seem more purposeful to me.', '2005-04-25 12:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
