(1323843, 169010, 9111, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Good<br/>Lighting:  looks very nice<br/>Color: very nice<br/>Clarity: extremely<br/>Lettering: the two different fonts are distracting.  I like the use of the swiss army + in the wording.</td>', 'Composition:  GoodLighting:  looks very niceColor: very niceClarity: extremelyLettering: the two different fonts are distracting.  I like the use of the swiss army + in the wording.', '2005-04-25 13:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
