(1323903, 169295, 18197, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, no jewelry advertising in the world would link jewelry (a symbol of love) with divorce. It would be bad advertising and would, again in my opinion, depress sales. So from my viewpoint, this is bad advertising at best and fails to meet the challenge at worst. Now to the photo. The ring is beautifully focused and clear which is not so easy. It is well lit and I like the reflections. The blurred text looks like it was done with gausian blur, rather than DOF. It therefore looks a bit artificial. With DOF blur, the letters further away would be blurred more. As it is, all the letters are blurred more or less equally.</td>', 'In my opinion, no jewelry advertising in the world would link jewelry (a symbol of love) with divorce. It would be bad advertising and would, again in my opinion, depress sales. So from my viewpoint, this is bad advertising at best and fails to meet the challenge at worst. Now to the photo. The ring is beautifully focused and clear which is not so easy. It is well lit and I like the reflections. The blurred text looks like it was done with gausian blur, rather than DOF. It therefore looks a bit artificial. With DOF blur, the letters further away would be blurred more. As it is, all the letters are blurred more or less equally.', '2005-04-25 13:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323906, 169822, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice background. The DOF is way too shallow for my liking, but I like the muted colors and the composition. 6</td>', 'Nice background. The DOF is way too shallow for my liking, but I like the muted colors and the composition. 6', '2005-04-25 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323913, 168939, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Well executed. Text over powers the subject in my opinion. Perhaps a smaller font and with less space between the lines would help. Fewer words would also limit the impact. How about "Light the way into her heart with the elegance of our new two-tone jewelry?"</td>', 'Nice photo. Well executed. Text over powers the subject in my opinion. Perhaps a smaller font and with less space between the lines would help. Fewer words would also limit the impact. How about "Light the way into her heart with the elegance of our new two-tone jewelry?"', '2005-04-25 13:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323914, 170309, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like: the concept, composition, colors, slogan,  and font. Perhaps a slighter deeper DOF would be good.<br/>I don''t like seeing waterdrops but no fish. 6</td>', 'I like: the concept, composition, colors, slogan,  and font. Perhaps a slighter deeper DOF would be good.I don''t like seeing waterdrops but no fish. 6', '2005-04-25 13:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1323915, 170240, 22734, '<td valign="top">very good presentation fro  a compositional point of view. However, the focus here is left wanting.  These angles present or add to the difficulty of getting the most from your dof. At this distance it is shallow and the angle extends the problem. The way to achieve optimum dof is to reduce the aperture say to f22 and then shoot it in as many seconds as you need, provided you stop the watch. Anayway, you get full credit for superb composition. Bumping up to 6</td>', 'very good presentation fro  a compositional point of view. However, the focus here is left wanting.  These angles present or add to the difficulty of getting the most from your dof. At this distance it is shallow and the angle extends the problem. The way to achieve optimum dof is to reduce the aperture say to f22 and then shoot it in as many seconds as you need, provided you stop the watch. Anayway, you get full credit for superb composition. Bumping up to 6', '2005-04-25 13:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
