(1324797, 170276, 22479, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of this entry. I think the lighting and DOF is fantastic. A bit of a crecent shadow on the face of the watch which distracts a bit but not much. 8</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of this entry. I think the lighting and DOF is fantastic. A bit of a crecent shadow on the face of the watch which distracts a bit but not much. 8', '2005-04-25 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
