(1324807, 168945, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. Excellent DOF! The overall lighting on the necklace stones is too subdued and contrasty however. Overall excellent. 7</td>', 'Love the composition. Excellent DOF! The overall lighting on the necklace stones is too subdued and contrasty however. Overall excellent. 7', '2005-04-25 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
