(1324842, 169968, 19708, '<td valign="top">The high contrast B&amp;W look works well here.<br/>Composition &amp; double shadows add a nice touch.</td>', 'The high contrast B&W look works well here.Composition & double shadows add a nice touch.', '2005-04-25 17:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
