(1324846, 170230, 19708, '<td valign="top">Composition has a lot of potential here, but the background simply is far too bright &amp; busy and washes out the image overall in my opinion.<br/>Still a decent shot regardless.</td>', 'Composition has a lot of potential here, but the background simply is far too bright & busy and washes out the image overall in my opinion.Still a decent shot regardless.', '2005-04-25 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
