(1324863, 169569, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like this entry and I think it''s definitely deserves a place high up in the rankings.<br/> <br/>The subdued backdrop contrasts quite nicely with the string of pearls in the foreground. The lighting is just a bit too harsh and the reflections off the individual beads are blown a bit. Other than that, it''s a great entry. 7</td>', 'I like this entry and I think it''s definitely deserves a place high up in the rankings. The subdued backdrop contrasts quite nicely with the string of pearls in the foreground. The lighting is just a bit too harsh and the reflections off the individual beads are blown a bit. Other than that, it''s a great entry. 7', '2005-04-25 17:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1324864, 169734, 35751, '<td valign="top">I like the colors created here and the lighting is better than i''ve seen in some of the other photos.  i like that is is not so dark. good job.</td>', 'I like the colors created here and the lighting is better than i''ve seen in some of the other photos.  i like that is is not so dark. good job.', '2005-04-25 17:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
