(1325021, 170339, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the humor in this entry. I would like to suggest the following: selectively highlight the chain and desaturate the blues and reds to eliminate the colored highlights off those links.</td>', 'Love the humor in this entry. I would like to suggest the following: selectively highlight the chain and desaturate the blues and reds to eliminate the colored highlights off those links.', '2005-04-25 17:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
