(1325087, 170183, 3102, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what that says, but I''ll assume it''s something elegant!  :)  Nice job with photographing the watch -- excellent exposure and sharpness.</td>', 'I have no idea what that says, but I''ll assume it''s something elegant!  :)  Nice job with photographing the watch -- excellent exposure and sharpness.', '2005-04-25 17:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
