(1325304, 169579, 4564, '<td valign="top">nice use of DOF. Good try with the lighting to set a mood.  I think lighting could have use more modeling on the background to give a more dramatic effect, but maybe it''s just me.  The center composition is throwing me off a bit...  Fonts could be a darker shade of grey to give back some forcus to the jewels.    Good job overal! Cheers!</td>', 'nice use of DOF. Good try with the lighting to set a mood.  I think lighting could have use more modeling on the background to give a more dramatic effect, but maybe it''s just me.  The center composition is throwing me off a bit...  Fonts could be a darker shade of grey to give back some forcus to the jewels.    Good job overal! Cheers!', '2005-04-25 18:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
