(1325347, 170184, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Unfortunatly, we don''t really see the item. Its probably Elegant, but the hand is not (no offense to the model). Lighting is a bit harsh for something ''that'' elegant as well. A tighter crop would''ve helped i think. 5</td>', 'Interesting shot. Unfortunatly, we don''t really see the item. Its probably Elegant, but the hand is not (no offense to the model). Lighting is a bit harsh for something ''that'' elegant as well. A tighter crop would''ve helped i think. 5', '2005-04-25 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325353, 169491, 19708, '<td valign="top">* Chuckle *<br/>Quite the unique approach to this challenge.<br/>Design &amp; layout are good, as is the lighting &amp; detail</td>', '* Chuckle *Quite the unique approach to this challenge.Design & layout are good, as is the lighting & detail', '2005-04-25 18:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325356, 169541, 35804, '<td valign="top">To me it seems the picture was taken to frame the text,  i think this may have worked better without the generic looking text.</td>', 'To me it seems the picture was taken to frame the text,  i think this may have worked better without the generic looking text.', '2005-04-25 18:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325358, 170166, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice Ad! Composition is appealing and strong. I can feel the energy and attitude of the ''trekker'' as he moves away. Nice look on his face as well. Lighting is cool, if only a tiny bit too directional. The choice of grey background is a good idea as it gives the watch more power as well. I''d wished for a slightly ''closer'' shot since we don''t see the watch that much. The writing on the wrist is another great touch, as well as the  - Watch - beneath it. Great work! 9</td>', 'Very nice Ad! Composition is appealing and strong. I can feel the energy and attitude of the ''trekker'' as he moves away. Nice look on his face as well. Lighting is cool, if only a tiny bit too directional. The choice of grey background is a good idea as it gives the watch more power as well. I''d wished for a slightly ''closer'' shot since we don''t see the watch that much. The writing on the wrist is another great touch, as well as the  - Watch - beneath it. Great work! 9', '2005-04-25 18:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325363, 170241, 25571, '<td valign="top">Slightly wierd composition here. the DOF could''ve been better as well, since even tho the portrait is nice, its a bit out of focus in the middle of the face. Colours could be punched some more and the item displayed could use lots more sharpness and contrast. 5</td>', 'Slightly wierd composition here. the DOF could''ve been better as well, since even tho the portrait is nice, its a bit out of focus in the middle of the face. Colours could be punched some more and the item displayed could use lots more sharpness and contrast. 5', '2005-04-25 19:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325366, 170156, 19708, '<td valign="top">Skin that blurry gives an unnatural feeling to this image.<br/>Composition is too much on the botom of the shot vs. the focal point on the top in my opinion. (or was the intent to draw the focal point to the cleavage?)<br/>Detail &amp; lighting on the necklace are good.</td>', 'Skin that blurry gives an unnatural feeling to this image.Composition is too much on the botom of the shot vs. the focal point on the top in my opinion. (or was the intent to draw the focal point to the cleavage?)Detail & lighting on the necklace are good.', '2005-04-25 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325371, 168679, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, unfortunatly very splashed by lighting which is not very good. (Angle and force). The composition is somewhat stale and not very interesting to look at and we don,t really see what those things are for... 4</td>', 'Nice colours, unfortunatly very splashed by lighting which is not very good. (Angle and force). The composition is somewhat stale and not very interesting to look at and we don,t really see what those things are for... 4', '2005-04-25 19:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325410, 170234, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice desat.  I think for a Jewelry Advertisement I would have come in closer for more emphasis on the necklace.  Good job on controlling the hot backlighting.</td>', 'Nice desat.  I think for a Jewelry Advertisement I would have come in closer for more emphasis on the necklace.  Good job on controlling the hot backlighting.', '2005-04-25 19:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325445, 169286, 35739, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Looks like a ad to me.</td>', 'Very well done.  Looks like a ad to me.', '2005-04-25 19:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325446, 169433, 22479, '<td valign="top">I can easily see this as an advertisement. Makes for a great ad copy. Have you considered shooting against black? I think gemstones appear much more flattering against black. 7</td>', 'I can easily see this as an advertisement. Makes for a great ad copy. Have you considered shooting against black? I think gemstones appear much more flattering against black. 7', '2005-04-25 19:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325452, 170366, 25571, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Touchups are awful, unfortunatly. I can see all the work done in the left ring and on the left side of the picture. Which also brings me to believe there is ''over''paint, which is against the advanced rules. Lighting is good, if only a little overdone, which splashs the items a bit too much (did you use a soft box?). Also the Font used is nice, but the colour is way too strong for the items (using the colour picker tool could''ve helped in selecting a colour more interesting and closer to the rings). Composition could also be a lot tighter with this shot. 4</td>', 'Composition is good. Touchups are awful, unfortunatly. I can see all the work done in the left ring and on the left side of the picture. Which also brings me to believe there is ''over''paint, which is against the advanced rules. Lighting is good, if only a little overdone, which splashs the items a bit too much (did you use a soft box?). Also the Font used is nice, but the colour is way too strong for the items (using the colour picker tool could''ve helped in selecting a colour more interesting and closer to the rings). Composition could also be a lot tighter with this shot. 4', '2005-04-25 19:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325459, 170323, 35746, '<td valign="top">this is cool the way it feels like its falling....i just dont get the feeling from this shot i would be inspired to purchase this watch....</td>', 'this is cool the way it feels like its falling....i just dont get the feeling from this shot i would be inspired to purchase this watch....', '2005-04-25 19:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325460, 170158, 35739, '<td valign="top">What is this?  This looks like a good photo for a ad.<br/>I like it.</td>', 'What is this?  This looks like a good photo for a ad.I like it.', '2005-04-25 19:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325463, 169286, 25571, '<td valign="top">Wierd suggestion of composition. I feel overwhelmed with information which in an advertisement picture, isn''t too good (leave that for the part where there is actual text in a magazine for exemple). Lighting is a little stale, but works with the contrast work. LOts of touchups could''ve avoid all the little grains and grey spots all around the item.  The change in colours of the text is not very appealing either. 5</td>', 'Wierd suggestion of composition. I feel overwhelmed with information which in an advertisement picture, isn''t too good (leave that for the part where there is actual text in a magazine for exemple). Lighting is a little stale, but works with the contrast work. LOts of touchups could''ve avoid all the little grains and grey spots all around the item.  The change in colours of the text is not very appealing either. 5', '2005-04-25 19:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325465, 169970, 35746, '<td valign="top">this set up or display is beautifully thought out....a great add however once i caught your reflection in the ring i lost concentration on the product....good luck</td>', 'this set up or display is beautifully thought out....a great add however once i caught your reflection in the ring i lost concentration on the product....good luck', '2005-04-25 19:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325468, 169862, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice and sharp eyes. The idea of the eyes and earing to be the only ''sharp'' parts of the picture very interesting, unfortunatly i do not feel it works very well, as most of the subject of the picture isn''t the jewel. A tighter crop of perharps only one side of the face and the earing could''ve worked as much. Frame is nice and classic, which makes the picture work more. 5</td>', 'Very nice and sharp eyes. The idea of the eyes and earing to be the only ''sharp'' parts of the picture very interesting, unfortunatly i do not feel it works very well, as most of the subject of the picture isn''t the jewel. A tighter crop of perharps only one side of the face and the earing could''ve worked as much. Frame is nice and classic, which makes the picture work more. 5', '2005-04-25 19:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325471, 169227, 14763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  9</td>', 'Beautiful color.  9', '2005-04-25 19:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325473, 170265, 14763, '<td valign="top">The Orange set off the blue in the stone,   Nice Lighting 9</td>', 'The Orange set off the blue in the stone,   Nice Lighting 9', '2005-04-25 19:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325474, 169963, 35746, '<td valign="top">cute idea....but the display of the piece is a bit haphazzard for me ...good luck</td>', 'cute idea....but the display of the piece is a bit haphazzard for me ...good luck', '2005-04-25 19:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325475, 169954, 25571, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, unfortunatly, the DOF is awful and the ring is largely blurry and/or out of focus. The Lighting is too strong and washs the ring considerably. With a better sharpening, the reflection on the diamond would''ve been very nice. The Red colour is very nice and would''ve done wonders if a better DOF and focus was used. Keep at it! 4</td>', 'I like the idea, unfortunatly, the DOF is awful and the ring is largely blurry and/or out of focus. The Lighting is too strong and washs the ring considerably. With a better sharpening, the reflection on the diamond would''ve been very nice. The Red colour is very nice and would''ve done wonders if a better DOF and focus was used. Keep at it! 4', '2005-04-25 19:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325476, 169970, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like this and I feel it would make a good ad. The lighting is soft and flattering and the picture was processed very cleanly and without artifactual distractions. The reflection does not conjure images of heaven for me, and perhaps you could have incorporated this theme into your advertisement writing rather than in the title.<br/> <br/>Not saying this would work better, but I would suggest "Heavenly gifts for your love", and to further direct the voter, leave the title as-is.<br/> <br/>Alternatively you could have chosen a more difficult route and shoot for a cleaner reflection (i.e. without those odd lights points or perhaps without that vaguely house-like structure?).<br/> <br/>Good luck. 7</td>', 'I like this and I feel it would make a good ad. The lighting is soft and flattering and the picture was processed very cleanly and without artifactual distractions. The reflection does not conjure images of heaven for me, and perhaps you could have incorporated this theme into your advertisement writing rather than in the title. Not saying this would work better, but I would suggest "Heavenly gifts for your love", and to further direct the voter, leave the title as-is. Alternatively you could have chosen a more difficult route and shoot for a cleaner reflection (i.e. without those odd lights points or perhaps without that vaguely house-like structure?). Good luck. 7', '2005-04-25 19:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325477, 170343, 35746, '<td valign="top">i dont kow if kids can get any cuter than this....it just doesnt do it for me as an ad for jewelry....too many pieces not enough detail on any of them</td>', 'i dont kow if kids can get any cuter than this....it just doesnt do it for me as an ad for jewelry....too many pieces not enough detail on any of them', '2005-04-25 19:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325478, 170194, 25571, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure i understand the slogan of this shot. Composition is however very intriguing; goes well with the text and item. I''d wish for a better focus on the item, i believe better lighting could''ve helped in that department. Perharps a colored lighting effect could''ve helped slightly as well (blue?). Keep at it! 5</td>', 'I''m not sure i understand the slogan of this shot. Composition is however very intriguing; goes well with the text and item. I''d wish for a better focus on the item, i believe better lighting could''ve helped in that department. Perharps a colored lighting effect could''ve helped slightly as well (blue?). Keep at it! 5', '2005-04-25 19:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325480, 170318, 21714, '<td valign="top">Unique and very artistic shot. I like what you done here.</td>', 'Unique and very artistic shot. I like what you done here.', '2005-04-25 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325481, 169714, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Sort of creapy with the Rose, but definatly intriging. The frame and composition are very good, but the lighting is a bit off. Too strong on the ring, too soft on the rose. I''m not too keen on the ''set'' either, with the brown part of fabric. On an even set, this would''ve done better. Some water sparkles on the rose trick could''ve done some good results on this shot. Font is good and not too invasive. Feels like a ''tatoo-shop'' picture. 6</td>', 'Nice idea. Sort of creapy with the Rose, but definatly intriging. The frame and composition are very good, but the lighting is a bit off. Too strong on the ring, too soft on the rose. I''m not too keen on the ''set'' either, with the brown part of fabric. On an even set, this would''ve done better. Some water sparkles on the rose trick could''ve done some good results on this shot. Font is good and not too invasive. Feels like a ''tatoo-shop'' picture. 6', '2005-04-25 19:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325482, 170276, 21714, '<td valign="top">The stars work nicely on this one. There''s a nice balance in the image and the lighting works well for the subject. Well done.</td>', 'The stars work nicely on this one. There''s a nice balance in the image and the lighting works well for the subject. Well done.', '2005-04-25 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325485, 168507, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed. I find it very interesting.</td>', 'Beautifully photographed. I find it very interesting.', '2005-04-25 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325486, 169361, 25571, '<td valign="top">not quite sure what to say about this shot. Lighting is stale, composition is off, DOF is not strong enought for the effect you want to give. Blue background doesn''t compliment the colours of the jewel at all. The wood on the other hand is very cool, but could''ve used a lot more contrast and some colour adjustments to the whole picture could''ve punched this pic some. Sorry. 4</td>', 'not quite sure what to say about this shot. Lighting is stale, composition is off, DOF is not strong enought for the effect you want to give. Blue background doesn''t compliment the colours of the jewel at all. The wood on the other hand is very cool, but could''ve used a lot more contrast and some colour adjustments to the whole picture could''ve punched this pic some. Sorry. 4', '2005-04-25 19:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325488, 170074, 22479, '<td valign="top">Yikes!!!!<br/> <br/>It may be just me, but that candle and eerie red glow is rather frightening. Otherwise, I think your concept is good, just fails to deliver the right feel. The image is sharp, detailed, and processed cleanly without artifactual distractions. Good luck.</td>', 'Yikes!!!! It may be just me, but that candle and eerie red glow is rather frightening. Otherwise, I think your concept is good, just fails to deliver the right feel. The image is sharp, detailed, and processed cleanly without artifactual distractions. Good luck.', '2005-04-25 19:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325490, 169694, 21714, '<td valign="top">This image sticks out from the crowd. There''s something about how you have captured the model that makes me want to see it again and again. Great job.</td>', 'This image sticks out from the crowd. There''s something about how you have captured the model that makes me want to see it again and again. Great job.', '2005-04-25 19:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325492, 170357, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice ring! I have scotish blood, and this makes me feel right at home! Of course i,d wished for a ''shinner'' ring, with less scratchs, but i understand the difficulty in finding something nice to shoot. Lighting is nice, if perharps slightly too strong on the reflections. I think i''d want to see a little more of the set on which the ring is resting. Text is simple and efficient which is very nice and quite rare in this challenge. Frame works perfect as well. Very classic and to the point. 7</td>', 'Nice ring! I have scotish blood, and this makes me feel right at home! Of course i,d wished for a ''shinner'' ring, with less scratchs, but i understand the difficulty in finding something nice to shoot. Lighting is nice, if perharps slightly too strong on the reflections. I think i''d want to see a little more of the set on which the ring is resting. Text is simple and efficient which is very nice and quite rare in this challenge. Frame works perfect as well. Very classic and to the point. 7', '2005-04-25 19:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325494, 169822, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very wierd and unique DOF and composition. I''m not sure which part is in focus and which is not, or what the shape of this item is. I like the colors and the Very strong DOF helps a lot on the wierd focus. Unfortunatly, i do not feel this sells the item a lot and so goes slightly against the challenge''s theme (advertisement). Very nice tho. 7</td>', 'Very wierd and unique DOF and composition. I''m not sure which part is in focus and which is not, or what the shape of this item is. I like the colors and the Very strong DOF helps a lot on the wierd focus. Unfortunatly, i do not feel this sells the item a lot and so goes slightly against the challenge''s theme (advertisement). Very nice tho. 7', '2005-04-25 19:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325499, 170158, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece of jewely. I''ve seen similar objects in the past. Composition is interesting, reminds me of those insect shots we see. Unfortunatly, the lighting is a bit off and doesn''t give enought credits to the object. I can''t decide if there is a chain or something holding the neckless either. The wood texture is cool and is the strong point of the lighting, but doesn''t complement the jewel too much, unfortunatly. text is nice and simple, but i can''t seem to see it as very appealing for some reason. keep at it! 6</td>', 'Interesting piece of jewely. I''ve seen similar objects in the past. Composition is interesting, reminds me of those insect shots we see. Unfortunatly, the lighting is a bit off and doesn''t give enought credits to the object. I can''t decide if there is a chain or something holding the neckless either. The wood texture is cool and is the strong point of the lighting, but doesn''t complement the jewel too much, unfortunatly. text is nice and simple, but i can''t seem to see it as very appealing for some reason. keep at it! 6', '2005-04-25 19:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325500, 170080, 22479, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Love the lighting here. Very sharp, clean, and detailed. I think you did an admirable job in controlling the reflections. I would suggest resetting the hands to the classic 10/2/8 positions as you have already stopped them with the crown pulled. 8</td>', 'Fantastic. Love the lighting here. Very sharp, clean, and detailed. I think you did an admirable job in controlling the reflections. I would suggest resetting the hands to the classic 10/2/8 positions as you have already stopped them with the crown pulled. 8', '2005-04-25 19:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325502, 169762, 25571, '<td valign="top">Odd composition and lighting. Focus is somewhat wrong and kills the sharpness required for so many jewels. Lighting is interesting, but the mix in colours doesn''t really work to give this shot the appealing factor it needs to ''sell''. text is dull and not attractive either. 5</td>', 'Odd composition and lighting. Focus is somewhat wrong and kills the sharpness required for so many jewels. Lighting is interesting, but the mix in colours doesn''t really work to give this shot the appealing factor it needs to ''sell''. text is dull and not attractive either. 5', '2005-04-25 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325503, 169563, 21714, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice effect you have achieved here. It has created a beautiful flow.</td>', 'Pretty nice effect you have achieved here. It has created a beautiful flow.', '2005-04-25 19:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325506, 169010, 25571, '<td valign="top">Quite unique idea i must say. It feels wierd because i''ve done some test shots of exactly the same idea, but decided against it. My main concern in this shot is the fact that we don,t actually see the product. Its like if you are selling the wrist band instead of the actual watch(?!). Lighting is very good and simply ad i like the DOF. (what''s on the right??) Text is interesting. Because of the band''s angle, i feel like the whole picture goes sideways, which is a bit disturbing. 6</td>', 'Quite unique idea i must say. It feels wierd because i''ve done some test shots of exactly the same idea, but decided against it. My main concern in this shot is the fact that we don,t actually see the product. Its like if you are selling the wrist band instead of the actual watch(?!). Lighting is very good and simply ad i like the DOF. (what''s on the right??) Text is interesting. Because of the band''s angle, i feel like the whole picture goes sideways, which is a bit disturbing. 6', '2005-04-25 19:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325509, 170234, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool jewel! Very unique and intriging. I''d wished for tighter crop to see the item better. don''t need to see the model''s shirt. Since this is threated as a portrait, a better focus on the model as well as the item coudl''ve been appreciated and some sharpening as well. more light as well on the item. ncie work tho. 6</td>', 'Cool jewel! Very unique and intriging. I''d wished for tighter crop to see the item better. don''t need to see the model''s shirt. Since this is threated as a portrait, a better focus on the model as well as the item coudl''ve been appreciated and some sharpening as well. more light as well on the item. ncie work tho. 6', '2005-04-25 19:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325510, 170327, 35746, '<td valign="top">the layout here is very nice...it just feels a bit washed out on that backroiund for me...good luck</td>', 'the layout here is very nice...it just feels a bit washed out on that backroiund for me...good luck', '2005-04-25 19:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
