(1325515, 169025, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really like this ring and how you have composed this shot. I think the lighting is a bit harsh to bring out the true beauty of the subject.</td>', 'I really like this ring and how you have composed this shot. I think the lighting is a bit harsh to bring out the true beauty of the subject.', '2005-04-25 19:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325517, 170201, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Lovely composition. Just one suggestion: the lettering could be more centered between the top border and the top edge of the ring if you had positioned it a little lower. 8</td>', 'Excellent. Lovely composition. Just one suggestion: the lettering could be more centered between the top border and the top edge of the ring if you had positioned it a little lower. 8', '2005-04-25 19:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325523, 170166, 21714, '<td valign="top">There''s something really cool about this shot. It works well by using all the elemets in the image. I think they all are in the right places, if I can put it that way. Also,  you have presented it nicely.</td>', 'There''s something really cool about this shot. It works well by using all the elemets in the image. I think they all are in the right places, if I can put it that way. Also,  you have presented it nicely.', '2005-04-25 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325532, 169579, 22479, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity and DOF. Lighting is even and reflections very well controlled. Processing is very sharp, clean, without distracting artifacts. <br/> <br/>The lettering is just fine, but it can be improved upon. I suggest a sans serif font, perhaps in all caps, minus punctuation, sized a few points larger. <br/> <br/>Overall a fantastic entry and I can easily see this as an advertisement. 8</td>', 'Lovely clarity and DOF. Lighting is even and reflections very well controlled. Processing is very sharp, clean, without distracting artifacts.  The lettering is just fine, but it can be improved upon. I suggest a sans serif font, perhaps in all caps, minus punctuation, sized a few points larger.  Overall a fantastic entry and I can easily see this as an advertisement. 8', '2005-04-25 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
