(1325559, 170166, 32754, '<td valign="top">This belongs in GQ magazine!  Great composition, movement, good shadow use and I like the way you used the logo on wrist and variations of the grey and black  tones; they contrast nicely with the skin of model ....9</td>', 'This belongs in GQ magazine!  Great composition, movement, good shadow use and I like the way you used the logo on wrist and variations of the grey and black  tones; they contrast nicely with the skin of model ....9', '2005-04-25 19:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
