(1325571, 169563, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot..the swirling light seems to add to the composition and create interest in the gold by reflecting the curves..</td>', 'I like this a lot..the swirling light seems to add to the composition and create interest in the gold by reflecting the curves..', '2005-04-25 19:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
