(1325609, 168960, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very professional lighting! Great photography. The processing left a slight halo around the kiss and rings which is slightly distracting, which considering this is supposed to be an ad, may be more of a factor than in other challenges. This is clearly one of the stronger entries though. 8</td>', 'Very professional lighting! Great photography. The processing left a slight halo around the kiss and rings which is slightly distracting, which considering this is supposed to be an ad, may be more of a factor than in other challenges. This is clearly one of the stronger entries though. 8', '2005-04-25 20:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1325612, 170318, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot..the top bracelet is lovely with the silhouette, but the bottom one just seems to disappear..is it a reflection?  I''m not certain if it''s the same or another bracelet on two hands...maybe i''m just confused tonight.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot..the top bracelet is lovely with the silhouette, but the bottom one just seems to disappear..is it a reflection?  I''m not certain if it''s the same or another bracelet on two hands...maybe i''m just confused tonight.', '2005-04-25 20:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
