(1325621, 169579, 32754, '<td valign="top">Good idea with the wine glass and bottle in background and dof set only to cufflinks in foreground..it adds a sophistication to the picture; as do the flowers add a sense of romance.</td>', 'Good idea with the wine glass and bottle in background and dof set only to cufflinks in foreground..it adds a sophistication to the picture; as do the flowers add a sense of romance.', '2005-04-25 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
