(1325672, 169869, 327, '<td valign="top">Focus is just a bit off here. I also see some dust on your lens. I do however like the background and you did well with the light.</td>', 'Focus is just a bit off here. I also see some dust on your lens. I do however like the background and you did well with the light.', '2005-04-25 20:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
