(1325687, 170339, 19708, '<td valign="top">The red in the border is a bit of overkill in my opinion.<br/>Perhaps had this been edited with another layer, desaturate the reds, and then brush them back in on the ring only may have worked better (remving the red from the chain only).</td>', 'The red in the border is a bit of overkill in my opinion.Perhaps had this been edited with another layer, desaturate the reds, and then brush them back in on the ring only may have worked better (remving the red from the chain only).', '2005-04-25 20:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
