(1326241, 169769, 4493, '<td valign="top">While the post processing is extreme, I understand that was probably on purpose to give it an edgie feel.... the problem I see is the composition. I find it difficult to understand what I''m looking at and in what context it''s worn or used.</td>', 'While the post processing is extreme, I understand that was probably on purpose to give it an edgie feel.... the problem I see is the composition. I find it difficult to understand what I''m looking at and in what context it''s worn or used.', '2005-04-25 22:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326244, 170234, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desaturation</td>', 'Nice selective desaturation', '2005-04-25 22:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326247, 169861, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Very advertisement worthy.</td>', 'Nice detail. Very advertisement worthy.', '2005-04-25 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326248, 170174, 4493, '<td valign="top">While I appreciate your creative design on this shot, the onboard flash, kills this shot. This image requires a diffused lighting situation. This would work well with lighting from a window with a sheer curtain over it. The focus should also be sharpest on the ring. This is what you are trying to sell, without a sharp clear ring your viewer will likely look elsewhere for their ring.</td>', 'While I appreciate your creative design on this shot, the onboard flash, kills this shot. This image requires a diffused lighting situation. This would work well with lighting from a window with a sheer curtain over it. The focus should also be sharpest on the ring. This is what you are trying to sell, without a sharp clear ring your viewer will likely look elsewhere for their ring.', '2005-04-25 22:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326252, 168355, 6179, '<td valign="top">Looks like a magazine article. Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a magazine article. Very nice.', '2005-04-25 22:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326259, 169968, 9747, '<td valign="top">Wow, very professional! I like the double shadows, they work so well without being too distracting. I''m not sure about the borders... I think one simple white border would be sufficent. I would''ve liked to see some more highlights, but that''s just me. The plain background helps make the whole composition very effective. Kudos on a great set-up!</td>', 'Wow, very professional! I like the double shadows, they work so well without being too distracting. I''m not sure about the borders... I think one simple white border would be sufficent. I would''ve liked to see some more highlights, but that''s just me. The plain background helps make the whole composition very effective. Kudos on a great set-up!', '2005-04-25 22:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326266, 169734, 6179, '<td valign="top">Love it. Really looks like a jewelry advertisement.</td>', 'Love it. Really looks like a jewelry advertisement.', '2005-04-25 23:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326271, 170363, 33672, '<td valign="top">The loose diamonds are a little too much.  The ring would of been plenty. The hand''s tone changes too much. Great Idea.</td>', 'The loose diamonds are a little too much.  The ring would of been plenty. The hand''s tone changes too much. Great Idea.', '2005-04-25 23:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326273, 170182, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. There could have been a little more lighting on the jewelry.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. There could have been a little more lighting on the jewelry.', '2005-04-25 23:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326274, 169903, 33672, '<td valign="top">The watches need to stand out more.  Nice composition.</td>', 'The watches need to stand out more.  Nice composition.', '2005-04-25 23:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326275, 170252, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desaturation.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desaturation.', '2005-04-25 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326282, 169757, 6179, '<td valign="top">Could have used a little sharper focus.</td>', 'Could have used a little sharper focus.', '2005-04-25 23:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326291, 168965, 35739, '<td valign="top">The only issue is the bracelet in the shadow .  This photo is nice and well done.</td>', 'The only issue is the bracelet in the shadow .  This photo is nice and well done.', '2005-04-25 23:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326301, 170158, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love the comp, however, I''m not sure this portrays that it is an ad for jewelery.</td>', 'I love the comp, however, I''m not sure this portrays that it is an ad for jewelery.', '2005-04-25 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326306, 170183, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice Comp. I wish I knew what it said.</td>', 'Very nice Comp. I wish I knew what it said.', '2005-04-25 23:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326329, 170345, 36078, '<td valign="top">I like what you tried to do here.  But I personally did not like the shadows.  Looked a bit to muddy for my taste but I still gave you a 6.</td>', 'I like what you tried to do here.  But I personally did not like the shadows.  Looked a bit to muddy for my taste but I still gave you a 6.', '2005-04-25 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326337, 170201, 36078, '<td valign="top">Like the overall presentation.  Nice sized font and widescreen type of setting that fit very well.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Like the overall presentation.  Nice sized font and widescreen type of setting that fit very well.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-25 23:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326342, 169954, 19708, '<td valign="top">Composition is there, but perhaps was cropped in too tight or at 118K, the image was compressed a bit too much. (try and make use of the full 150K when possible, as the image will always look better the less it''s compressed) Detail/sharpness is a bit off too.<br/>Not too bad regardless.</td>', 'Composition is there, but perhaps was cropped in too tight or at 118K, the image was compressed a bit too much. (try and make use of the full 150K when possible, as the image will always look better the less it''s compressed) Detail/sharpness is a bit off too.Not too bad regardless.', '2005-04-25 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326344, 170332, 27894, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but the reflection and soft shadow are a little distracting.<br/></td>', 'nice photo, but the reflection and soft shadow are a little distracting.', '2005-04-25 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326349, 170148, 33672, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is pro jewelery. I like the comp and depth.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is pro jewelery. I like the comp and depth.', '2005-04-25 23:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326350, 168960, 27894, '<td valign="top">great photo! nice and sharp. Contrast over the kiss is great.. and a sense of humor :)</td>', 'great photo! nice and sharp. Contrast over the kiss is great.. and a sense of humor :)', '2005-04-25 23:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326355, 170224, 19708, '<td valign="top">Reflections on the gold is always tough to control and the red reflections kind of distract a bit. Can''t say as I care much for the text/font used.<br/>Still met the challenge and composition was not as static as it could have been (not boring)</td>', 'Reflections on the gold is always tough to control and the red reflections kind of distract a bit. Can''t say as I care much for the text/font used.Still met the challenge and composition was not as static as it could have been (not boring)', '2005-04-25 23:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326360, 169563, 27894, '<td valign="top">love the lighting, nice over all photo.</td>', 'love the lighting, nice over all photo.', '2005-04-25 23:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326367, 169302, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is such a great Idea. Its to bad you couldn''t feature the ring more without losing the idea of the glove and catch.</td>', 'This is such a great Idea. Its to bad you couldn''t feature the ring more without losing the idea of the glove and catch.', '2005-04-25 23:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326370, 169873, 19708, '<td valign="top">Can''t put my finger on it, but something isn''t "doing it" for me here.<br/>Perhaps it''s too centered &amp; symmetrical. Lighting was pretty decent here<br/> I can only assume the softness was done in post-processing and may have had better results if the ring had an incline/tilt to it giving it more dimension.</td>', 'Can''t put my finger on it, but something isn''t "doing it" for me here.Perhaps it''s too centered & symmetrical. Lighting was pretty decent here I can only assume the softness was done in post-processing and may have had better results if the ring had an incline/tilt to it giving it more dimension.', '2005-04-25 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326371, 170276, 27894, '<td valign="top">nice photo. like how the chain leads you to the main piece. hopefully this does well</td>', 'nice photo. like how the chain leads you to the main piece. hopefully this does well', '2005-04-25 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326376, 168965, 33672, '<td valign="top">The art on the pottery takes attention away from the beautiful jewelery.  More contrast is needed to show the detail. Very nice comp.</td>', 'The art on the pottery takes attention away from the beautiful jewelery.  More contrast is needed to show the detail. Very nice comp.', '2005-04-25 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326381, 169010, 27894, '<td valign="top">Nice approach of shooting the logo. nice lighting. don''t know what those lines are to the right a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice approach of shooting the logo. nice lighting. don''t know what those lines are to the right a little distracting.', '2005-04-25 23:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326391, 169148, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice overall - possibly improved by not including the ends of the chain.....</td>', 'Nice overall - possibly improved by not including the ends of the chain.....', '2005-04-25 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326394, 169286, 33672, '<td valign="top">You''ve done this before.  very, very nice.  Nice comp, nice font, nice colors. I would of liked to see the complete pieces that seemed a little cropped. (Is this a real event?)</td>', 'You''ve done this before.  very, very nice.  Nice comp, nice font, nice colors. I would of liked to see the complete pieces that seemed a little cropped. (Is this a real event?)', '2005-04-25 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326397, 170349, 27894, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.. nice hard light it works. looks like a smudge in the top middle of the photo didn''t mark you down because of that just something that caught my eye.</td>', 'Nice photo.. nice hard light it works. looks like a smudge in the top middle of the photo didn''t mark you down because of that just something that caught my eye.', '2005-04-25 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326402, 170184, 27894, '<td valign="top">nice photo just a little hard to see. nice and sharp photo. gj</td>', 'nice photo just a little hard to see. nice and sharp photo. gj', '2005-04-25 23:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326410, 170201, 27894, '<td valign="top">good photo, lighting is great. gl</td>', 'good photo, lighting is great. gl', '2005-04-25 23:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326414, 170165, 27894, '<td valign="top">great photo, not sure it really needed the blueprint background. could have done great by itself. overall gj. didn''t lower my vote because of the BG.</td>', 'great photo, not sure it really needed the blueprint background. could have done great by itself. overall gj. didn''t lower my vote because of the BG.', '2005-04-25 23:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326417, 170341, 25571, '<td valign="top">Not much i can say about this. First it doesn''t really look like a jewel. Lighting is all wrong and the focus is not very sharp. Angle of foto is rather odd and makes the composition off. Strange colours on the ''wall'' or background. 3</td>', 'Not much i can say about this. First it doesn''t really look like a jewel. Lighting is all wrong and the focus is not very sharp. Angle of foto is rather odd and makes the composition off. Strange colours on the ''wall'' or background. 3', '2005-04-25 23:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326423, 170037, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. I like the bowl, unfortunatly the composition makes it off to the left. Lighting is weak and doesn''t give enought energy to the shot. Also, the jewel and neckless are too far away. This is not something that would appear in an advertisement magazine. Carefull in the crops, as we can see impurities like on the lower left corner. 4</td>', 'Cute idea. I like the bowl, unfortunatly the composition makes it off to the left. Lighting is weak and doesn''t give enought energy to the shot. Also, the jewel and neckless are too far away. This is not something that would appear in an advertisement magazine. Carefull in the crops, as we can see impurities like on the lower left corner. 4', '2005-04-25 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326435, 169227, 27894, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of the jewelry over the rose. soft focus looks good. nice and sharp. gl</td>', 'nice contrast of the jewelry over the rose. soft focus looks good. nice and sharp. gl', '2005-04-25 23:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326436, 169869, 25571, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a nice looking ring. Very hard to make out since the focus is off, there is no sharpness either. The lighting is odd, doesn''t work very well with the background. There are a lot of impurities in this picture. If you shot in RAW, it would''ve been possible to save this picture with some good tweakings. Also some HUE and Saturation modifications would''ve helped greatly. 3</td>', 'Seems to be a nice looking ring. Very hard to make out since the focus is off, there is no sharpness either. The lighting is odd, doesn''t work very well with the background. There are a lot of impurities in this picture. If you shot in RAW, it would''ve been possible to save this picture with some good tweakings. Also some HUE and Saturation modifications would''ve helped greatly. 3', '2005-04-25 23:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326444, 169539, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I''m a bit worried that the jewel of the picture is not or does not appear to be the ''primary'' item in the pic, making it hard to see the item properly. Lighting is good tho. Be careful in the reflections of the item as well. Dig the font used for the "sales Event". What is it? 6</td>', 'Nice composition. I''m a bit worried that the jewel of the picture is not or does not appear to be the ''primary'' item in the pic, making it hard to see the item properly. Lighting is good tho. Be careful in the reflections of the item as well. Dig the font used for the "sales Event". What is it? 6', '2005-04-25 23:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326450, 170195, 25571, '<td valign="top">DOF is quite nice, could''ve used a little more lighting and i''m not sure about the composition too much. Model didn''t seem to enjoy herself too much either. 5</td>', 'DOF is quite nice, could''ve used a little more lighting and i''m not sure about the composition too much. Model didn''t seem to enjoy herself too much either. 5', '2005-04-25 23:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326452, 168507, 27894, '<td valign="top">great photo. nice and sharp the soft lighting is very nice. the only distracting thing is the white triangle on the jewel not sure what is it. GL.</td>', 'great photo. nice and sharp the soft lighting is very nice. the only distracting thing is the white triangle on the jewel not sure what is it. GL.', '2005-04-25 23:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326456, 170148, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking ring. Setup is nice, unfortunate that the background was so close to the items, as they drop shadows which ruins the effect. Text is rather poor and doesn''t bring anything to the picture. 5</td>', 'Interesting looking ring. Setup is nice, unfortunate that the background was so close to the items, as they drop shadows which ruins the effect. Text is rather poor and doesn''t bring anything to the picture. 5', '2005-04-25 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326468, 169472, 35739, '<td valign="top">The jewelry is not in focus., and is it not what we are tring to sell.    The model is hot.  But the glass is what we are tring to sell.</td>', 'The jewelry is not in focus., and is it not what we are tring to sell.    The model is hot.  But the glass is what we are tring to sell.', '2005-04-25 23:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326479, 168507, 25571, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting mastery. Composition is very good. Text is very nice and brings lots of synergy to the shot. Masterful. One thing i don''t like is the big reflection on the jewel. Its very subjective, but its a bit too big for me. Either way, i suspect this is gonna make it first place. 9</td>', 'Superb lighting mastery. Composition is very good. Text is very nice and brings lots of synergy to the shot. Masterful. One thing i don''t like is the big reflection on the jewel. Its very subjective, but its a bit too big for me. Either way, i suspect this is gonna make it first place. 9', '2005-04-25 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326498, 170156, 25571, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure what to say about this shot. Lighting is poor and what seems like a very off focus doesn''t help. Not enought lighting on the neckless makes this pic a not very good seller in a magazine. 3</td>', 'I''m not too sure what to say about this shot. Lighting is poor and what seems like a very off focus doesn''t help. Not enought lighting on the neckless makes this pic a not very good seller in a magazine. 3', '2005-04-25 23:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326541, 169252, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is great, one of the first I''ve seen that the text accents the picture nicely instead of distracting from it, nicely done! 10</td>', 'This is great, one of the first I''ve seen that the text accents the picture nicely instead of distracting from it, nicely done! 10', '2005-04-26 00:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326570, 169877, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice, I love whatever it is that you used as a background that gives the dark red/burgundy color, and the lighting on the diamonds is quite nice too.  Well done!</td>', 'This is quite nice, I love whatever it is that you used as a background that gives the dark red/burgundy color, and the lighting on the diamonds is quite nice too.  Well done!', '2005-04-26 00:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326590, 169543, 33672, '<td valign="top">I really like the comp here. A deeper DOF and more contrast is needed to make the piece stand out. I like the text placement,</td>', 'I really like the comp here. A deeper DOF and more contrast is needed to make the piece stand out. I like the text placement,', '2005-04-26 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326593, 167997, 6668, '<td valign="top">Although this is a cute capture, to me the young girl wearing the diamonds would not work as an actual advertisement.</td>', 'Although this is a cute capture, to me the young girl wearing the diamonds would not work as an actual advertisement.', '2005-04-26 00:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326604, 170166, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great!  Love the whole feel of the model''s look, dress, and the way you put the name on his hand.   I really like this one a lot!   Good luck!</td>', 'This is great!  Love the whole feel of the model''s look, dress, and the way you put the name on his hand.   I really like this one a lot!   Good luck!', '2005-04-26 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326605, 169970, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-04-26 00:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326606, 169758, 33672, '<td valign="top">Incredible composition!  Too tight a crop on the left and the need for more contrast are the only holdbacks from being a great ad.  Very nice.</td>', 'Incredible composition!  Too tight a crop on the left and the need for more contrast are the only holdbacks from being a great ad.  Very nice.', '2005-04-26 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326610, 169327, 6668, '<td valign="top">I love the sparkles on the diomands and having the neclace on the rose petals adds a touch of softness, nicely done!</td>', 'I love the sparkles on the diomands and having the neclace on the rose petals adds a touch of softness, nicely done!', '2005-04-26 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326611, 170361, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking.   What a great job you did with the brown tones on everything but the jewelry.   the jewelry really stands out.</td>', 'Very professional looking.   What a great job you did with the brown tones on everything but the jewelry.   the jewelry really stands out.', '2005-04-26 00:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326612, 169821, 33672, '<td valign="top">Excellent comp and clarity. Good colors and space for text and logo. Outstanding job.</td>', 'Excellent comp and clarity. Good colors and space for text and logo. Outstanding job.', '2005-04-26 00:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326624, 169396, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.   Weird crop and text placement.</td>', 'Nice photo.   Weird crop and text placement.', '2005-04-26 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326626, 169286, 6668, '<td valign="top">Too much text in my opinion, nice image though.</td>', 'Too much text in my opinion, nice image though.', '2005-04-26 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326640, 170201, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. It really catches your eye. The centering of ring seems off but that could be me. Border''s a nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice job. It really catches your eye. The centering of ring seems off but that could be me. Border''s a nice touch.', '2005-04-26 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326646, 170363, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, though I''m not sure I understand the placement of the two diamonds on the back of the hand? To me they seem out of place. Also, to me the text does not work well on the hand, I think it would have worked better in a black area of the photo, but these are all just my opinions, so please take them as that.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, though I''m not sure I understand the placement of the two diamonds on the back of the hand? To me they seem out of place. Also, to me the text does not work well on the hand, I think it would have worked better in a black area of the photo, but these are all just my opinions, so please take them as that.', '2005-04-26 00:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326650, 170318, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of the best compositions in the contest, but the jewelery doesn''t catch my eye quickly enough. Maybe more contrast or exposure?I''d recommend a Different font too. (Thicker.)</td>', 'One of the best compositions in the contest, but the jewelery doesn''t catch my eye quickly enough. Maybe more contrast or exposure?I''d recommend a Different font too. (Thicker.)', '2005-04-26 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326659, 170320, 6668, '<td valign="top">The large polka dots in the background are very distracting in my opinion.</td>', 'The large polka dots in the background are very distracting in my opinion.', '2005-04-26 00:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326665, 169694, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I could definately see this as an advertisement.  Nicely done! 10</td>', 'Very nice, I could definately see this as an advertisement.  Nicely done! 10', '2005-04-26 00:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326676, 169714, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot, though the glare of the forehead of the skull distracts from the rest of the image in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot, though the glare of the forehead of the skull distracts from the rest of the image in my opinion.', '2005-04-26 00:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326682, 170355, 6668, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit soft to me.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit soft to me.', '2005-04-26 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326694, 169965, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is excellent. The DOF could be a hair wider (and consequently the necklace a bit sharper at the ends) and the lighting could be a bit softer to reduce that prominent shadow. The reflection, though, is a very nice touch.</td>', 'Wow, this is excellent. The DOF could be a hair wider (and consequently the necklace a bit sharper at the ends) and the lighting could be a bit softer to reduce that prominent shadow. The reflection, though, is a very nice touch.', '2005-04-26 00:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326702, 168769, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great arrangement. Not sure the lettering does much for this shot but it doesn''t distract, either. Good lighting too. <br/> <br/>I recommend either shooting against a more uniformly black background, or adjusting the background in post processing to remove the texture and/or flecks of lint. 7</td>', 'Great arrangement. Not sure the lettering does much for this shot but it doesn''t distract, either. Good lighting too.  I recommend either shooting against a more uniformly black background, or adjusting the background in post processing to remove the texture and/or flecks of lint. 7', '2005-04-26 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326716, 170194, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like this concept and the composition overall. The lighting unfortunately is quite lacking given the harsh, contrasty glare off the jewelry piece which is quite unflattering. I recommend diffusing the flash to soften it up and you could also forego the flash altogether and use available lighting (assuming you fired a flash). Good luck.</td>', 'I like this concept and the composition overall. The lighting unfortunately is quite lacking given the harsh, contrasty glare off the jewelry piece which is quite unflattering. I recommend diffusing the flash to soften it up and you could also forego the flash altogether and use available lighting (assuming you fired a flash). Good luck.', '2005-04-26 00:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326726, 169444, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL I love this, photo is good and it gave me a good chuckle! 10</td>', 'LOL I love this, photo is good and it gave me a good chuckle! 10', '2005-04-26 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326738, 169903, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the way the watches are set up, though I don''t care for the yellowish cast that the photo seems to have, also I don''t personally care for the green text.</td>', 'I like the way the watches are set up, though I don''t care for the yellowish cast that the photo seems to have, also I don''t personally care for the green text.', '2005-04-26 00:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326750, 169958, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the soft, diffuse lighting and you did a nice job in controlling the reflections. Not sure of the composition though. The crop leaves some awkward space on the left that is too small for any print lettering. Almost as if you did so to prevent a centered composition. Sometimes centered is preferable. I would suggest leaving more rorom either above or below, which would naturally follow in this type of ad presentation (landscape aspect ratio).</td>', 'I like the soft, diffuse lighting and you did a nice job in controlling the reflections. Not sure of the composition though. The crop leaves some awkward space on the left that is too small for any print lettering. Almost as if you did so to prevent a centered composition. Sometimes centered is preferable. I would suggest leaving more rorom either above or below, which would naturally follow in this type of ad presentation (landscape aspect ratio).', '2005-04-26 00:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326760, 170118, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice timepiece. Band detail is sort of obscured by the background (black on black). There''s a bit of reflection cutting across the lower half of the face, but otherwise nicely lit.</td>', 'Nice timepiece. Band detail is sort of obscured by the background (black on black). There''s a bit of reflection cutting across the lower half of the face, but otherwise nicely lit.', '2005-04-26 00:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326779, 169467, 22479, '<td valign="top">Lovely blurred backdrop. I''m assuming you edited it in? It works well to isolate your subject. I can easily see this as an ad, well done.</td>', 'Lovely blurred backdrop. I''m assuming you edited it in? It works well to isolate your subject. I can easily see this as an ad, well done.', '2005-04-26 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326786, 169821, 22479, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Nice detail, focus, DOF, and lighting. The processing is relatively clean and free from artifacts (just a slight halo around the center piece pearl). Not a huge fan of the border. Overall one of the best entries though. 8</td>', 'Lovely. Nice detail, focus, DOF, and lighting. The processing is relatively clean and free from artifacts (just a slight halo around the center piece pearl). Not a huge fan of the border. Overall one of the best entries though. 8', '2005-04-26 00:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
