(1326873, 169806, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this shot, though to me the large text is a little overpowering.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this shot, though to me the large text is a little overpowering.', '2005-04-26 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326879, 170318, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea with a good technique. It looks so good I''m almost hesitant to mention there could have been a wee bit more light on the stone itself. Something about the composition doesn''t attract me.  I will look back after the challenge to see if the model is wearing dark hose. If so, it was a brilliant idea. I''m going to have to remember this.</td>', 'Wonderful idea with a good technique. It looks so good I''m almost hesitant to mention there could have been a wee bit more light on the stone itself. Something about the composition doesn''t attract me.  I will look back after the challenge to see if the model is wearing dark hose. If so, it was a brilliant idea. I''m going to have to remember this.', '2005-04-26 01:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326929, 170224, 1031, '<td valign="top">If your are just going to use the one line of type, I think I''d move it up -- it feels a bit unbalanced. Good job capturing both gold and silver tones, and getting the focal place on the main subject.</td>', 'If your are just going to use the one line of type, I think I''d move it up -- it feels a bit unbalanced. Good job capturing both gold and silver tones, and getting the focal place on the main subject.', '2005-04-26 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326932, 169898, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice control of the spot-lighting, and a pretty stone.</td>', 'Nice control of the spot-lighting, and a pretty stone.', '2005-04-26 01:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326936, 170148, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately all too true. Hmmm ... and it could be that what that ring says is thousands of years old too.</td>', 'Unfortunately all too true. Hmmm ... and it could be that what that ring says is thousands of years old too.', '2005-04-26 01:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326941, 170051, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting/coloring has captured the "feel" of antique stones pretty well.</td>', 'Lighting/coloring has captured the "feel" of antique stones pretty well.', '2005-04-26 01:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1326944, 170252, 1031, '<td valign="top">Those are some pretty colorful "black" stones : )<br/>I''ll have to find out more since it''s my birthstone ...</td>', 'Those are some pretty colorful "black" stones : )I''ll have to find out more since it''s my birthstone ...', '2005-04-26 01:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
