(1327439, 170172, 30857, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white portrait, but the jewel kind of gets lost because our attention go to her beautiful eyes or her nice smile. I think that with a tighter crop, just showing her ear with the earring, this picture would have had a greater impact.<br/>Nevertheless great picture :))</td>', 'Nice black and white portrait, but the jewel kind of gets lost because our attention go to her beautiful eyes or her nice smile. I think that with a tighter crop, just showing her ear with the earring, this picture would have had a greater impact.Nevertheless great picture :))', '2005-04-26 05:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
