(1328771, 170276, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very nice simple portrait of an old watch.</td>', 'Very nice simple portrait of an old watch.', '2005-04-26 14:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328772, 170327, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but I think you''ve lost some of the sparkle you could have from the diamonds.</td>', 'I like your idea, but I think you''ve lost some of the sparkle you could have from the diamonds.', '2005-04-26 14:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328775, 169963, 7466, '<td valign="top">lovely piece of jewelry, but it is lost in the boxes.</td>', 'lovely piece of jewelry, but it is lost in the boxes.', '2005-04-26 15:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328778, 170357, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice, moody composition.</td>', 'Nice, moody composition.', '2005-04-26 15:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328782, 169814, 7466, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the focus seems to be sharpest on the background.</td>', 'Great idea, but the focus seems to be sharpest on the background.', '2005-04-26 15:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328789, 170340, 30890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the ring but I think the lettering colud have been a little less overpowering</td>', 'Nice shot of the ring but I think the lettering colud have been a little less overpowering', '2005-04-26 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328807, 169563, 33652, '<td valign="top">I love the stripes on the gold and reflections. 10</td>', 'I love the stripes on the gold and reflections. 10', '2005-04-26 15:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328814, 170355, 25787, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more dof.</td>', 'Needs a little more dof.', '2005-04-26 15:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328821, 169821, 30890, '<td valign="top">Great photograph. Made better by the absence of lettering</td>', 'Great photograph. Made better by the absence of lettering', '2005-04-26 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328829, 168945, 16241, '<td valign="top">classy</td>', 'classy', '2005-04-26 15:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328832, 169433, 16241, '<td valign="top">good photo, title not so hot</td>', 'good photo, title not so hot', '2005-04-26 15:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328833, 168939, 30890, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the ring, but all the writing takes the eye away from it.</td>', 'Great shot of the ring, but all the writing takes the eye away from it.', '2005-04-26 15:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328837, 169286, 32608, '<td valign="top">well done.  Love the framing and text......I imagine you are hearing alot of crap about it.I like it.9</td>', 'well done.  Love the framing and text......I imagine you are hearing alot of crap about it.I like it.9', '2005-04-26 15:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328840, 168939, 33672, '<td valign="top">This ad is sooo close to being perfect.  Great,great comp and i can feel the texture. Yoour choice of lighting is also very good However, I don''t get the two-tone and I''d ask for more diamond and setting and less ring. I''d probably ask for a horizontal orientation.</td>', 'This ad is sooo close to being perfect.  Great,great comp and i can feel the texture. Yoour choice of lighting is also very good However, I don''t get the two-tone and I''d ask for more diamond and setting and less ring. I''d probably ask for a horizontal orientation.', '2005-04-26 15:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328845, 169491, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Humorous. Great font but needs a crisper shot of the rock itself.</td>', 'Nice job. Humorous. Great font but needs a crisper shot of the rock itself.', '2005-04-26 15:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328851, 170153, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very origianl and I llike the way you used the shape to place the text.  Great dof but the peice itself needs to be crisper as it is what you''re trying to sell.</td>', 'Very origianl and I llike the way you used the shape to place the text.  Great dof but the peice itself needs to be crisper as it is what you''re trying to sell.', '2005-04-26 15:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328854, 170234, 32608, '<td valign="top">sharp and crisp......back lighting nice.you highlighted the necklace well.</td>', 'sharp and crisp......back lighting nice.you highlighted the necklace well.', '2005-04-26 15:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328859, 170287, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the Comp here but it doesn''t jump out at me.Crisper shot of the piece and a different color font would make this a very,very nice entry.</td>', 'I like the Comp here but it doesn''t jump out at me.Crisper shot of the piece and a different color font would make this a very,very nice entry.', '2005-04-26 15:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328867, 170046, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is such a great photo and I believe that I recognize arnit''s model.(whose skill I greatly admire)  However, I don''t get the sense that its an ad for jewelery.  Maybe for skin lotion. Technically its perfect. but I don''t believe it would sell the bling/bling.</td>', 'This is such a great photo and I believe that I recognize arnit''s model.(whose skill I greatly admire)  However, I don''t get the sense that its an ad for jewelery.  Maybe for skin lotion. Technically its perfect. but I don''t believe it would sell the bling/bling.', '2005-04-26 15:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328873, 170366, 33672, '<td valign="top">Such a nice job. Great placement, nice detail too. (If you overlook the misspelling) Everything stands out well.</td>', 'Such a nice job. Great placement, nice detail too. (If you overlook the misspelling) Everything stands out well.', '2005-04-26 15:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328877, 169757, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and text placementI think a Deeper DOF would have solved the crispness problem I see.  (maybe more contrast too)</td>', 'Nice composition and text placementI think a Deeper DOF would have solved the crispness problem I see.  (maybe more contrast too)', '2005-04-26 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328878, 169327, 33672, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a filter that takes away some needed contrast. Nice comp and title. Although it seems like less  than one ct.</td>', 'There seems to be a filter that takes away some needed contrast. Nice comp and title. Although it seems like less  than one ct.', '2005-04-26 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328882, 169467, 33542, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better with a more diffuse light, rather than one that creates such a strong hotspot... nice focus and idea, thought</td>', 'I think it would have been better with a more diffuse light, rather than one that creates such a strong hotspot... nice focus and idea, thought', '2005-04-26 15:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328884, 169821, 33542, '<td valign="top">reflections in pearl are distracting... I would have preferred maybe a more diffuse light or some editing</td>', 'reflections in pearl are distracting... I would have preferred maybe a more diffuse light or some editing', '2005-04-26 15:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328886, 170361, 9162, '<td valign="top">You put alot of thought into this and it shows</td>', 'You put alot of thought into this and it shows', '2005-04-26 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328890, 169354, 33542, '<td valign="top">reflections on skin are a little disconcerting (makes skin look fake)... I think I might have edited those out.</td>', 'reflections on skin are a little disconcerting (makes skin look fake)... I think I might have edited those out.', '2005-04-26 15:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328891, 169958, 33542, '<td valign="top">odd crop... I would have preferred watch to be the center of the picture or more space on the side for the ad</td>', 'odd crop... I would have preferred watch to be the center of the picture or more space on the side for the ad', '2005-04-26 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328895, 169714, 33542, '<td valign="top">better if you tone down hotspot with photo-editor (or use more diffuse light)</td>', 'better if you tone down hotspot with photo-editor (or use more diffuse light)', '2005-04-26 15:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328896, 170343, 33542, '<td valign="top">cute pic, but doesn''t really seem like an ad</td>', 'cute pic, but doesn''t really seem like an ad', '2005-04-26 15:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328898, 168939, 33542, '<td valign="top">pretty focus</td>', 'pretty focus', '2005-04-26 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328899, 170158, 9162, '<td valign="top">photo composition and placement of the text is very good</td>', 'photo composition and placement of the text is very good', '2005-04-26 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328900, 170252, 33542, '<td valign="top">I love black opals</td>', 'I love black opals', '2005-04-26 15:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328904, 169349, 33542, '<td valign="top">better if you''d edited out the reflection of the watch on the white surface... there''s also a small hotspot on the face of the watch</td>', 'better if you''d edited out the reflection of the watch on the white surface... there''s also a small hotspot on the face of the watch', '2005-04-26 15:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328905, 170183, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like the surface the watch is sitting on</td>', 'I like the surface the watch is sitting on', '2005-04-26 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328908, 170316, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''d have focused on the heart... if you tried to focus on the heart and got this, I think the heart was too close to the lens</td>', 'I''d have focused on the heart... if you tried to focus on the heart and got this, I think the heart was too close to the lens', '2005-04-26 15:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328910, 170037, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the styrofoam peanuts as a backdrop</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the styrofoam peanuts as a backdrop', '2005-04-26 15:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328911, 169569, 33542, '<td valign="top">focus is off on the front pearls</td>', 'focus is off on the front pearls', '2005-04-26 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328913, 169903, 33542, '<td valign="top">white balance might be off</td>', 'white balance might be off', '2005-04-26 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328914, 170065, 33542, '<td valign="top">nice focus, but shadow on the watch face is distracting</td>', 'nice focus, but shadow on the watch face is distracting', '2005-04-26 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328915, 170238, 33542, '<td valign="top">focus is on center when I think it would have been better on balls of bracelet</td>', 'focus is on center when I think it would have been better on balls of bracelet', '2005-04-26 15:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328918, 170165, 33672, '<td valign="top">Funny tag line. Needs capital letters.... Very ice composition.  I like how you left room on the bottom for more or different text,  This ad would be a good starting point and after some text (I.E. content and font) revisions, would work for me</td>', 'Funny tag line. Needs capital letters.... Very ice composition.  I like how you left room on the bottom for more or different text,  This ad would be a good starting point and after some text (I.E. content and font) revisions, would work for me', '2005-04-26 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328919, 170148, 33542, '<td valign="top">reflections on gold are distracting</td>', 'reflections on gold are distracting', '2005-04-26 15:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328920, 170240, 33542, '<td valign="top">focus seems a little off and there''s a hot spot on close side of watch</td>', 'focus seems a little off and there''s a hot spot on close side of watch', '2005-04-26 15:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328921, 170156, 33542, '<td valign="top">skin looks a little mottled... I don''t know if you''ve tried this, but a trick I use is to apply a red filter before changing to b/w... it smooths the appearance of skin</td>', 'skin looks a little mottled... I don''t know if you''ve tried this, but a trick I use is to apply a red filter before changing to b/w... it smooths the appearance of skin', '2005-04-26 15:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328922, 170363, 33542, '<td valign="top">earrings look weird on the hand</td>', 'earrings look weird on the hand', '2005-04-26 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328923, 169025, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection</td>', 'I like the reflection', '2005-04-26 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328928, 169444, 33542, '<td valign="top">funny text... watch is crooked, though</td>', 'funny text... watch is crooked, though', '2005-04-26 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328941, 168960, 35998, '<td valign="top">I think I''d rather have seen the kiss still wrapped with gold jewelry...or even the white...or maybe do some photoshopping on the kiss, and add some sparkle to the ring. <br/> <br/>Overall, good tag line, very original.</td>', 'I think I''d rather have seen the kiss still wrapped with gold jewelry...or even the white...or maybe do some photoshopping on the kiss, and add some sparkle to the ring.  Overall, good tag line, very original.', '2005-04-26 15:58:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1328944, 168475, 35998, '<td valign="top">I commented, but don''t know that it "went"... love this ad, very clearly stated.  Very nice.</td>', 'I commented, but don''t know that it "went"... love this ad, very clearly stated.  Very nice.', '2005-04-26 15:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328946, 169327, 35998, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  first one to sparkle~</td>', 'Very nice.  first one to sparkle~', '2005-04-26 16:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328949, 169950, 35998, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I might have chosen a heavier version of this font... maybe place the rings on an old BW wedding photo...<br/></td>', 'Very nice.  I might have chosen a heavier version of this font... maybe place the rings on an old BW wedding photo...', '2005-04-26 16:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328951, 170252, 35998, '<td valign="top">Should have gotten a woman to model...</td>', 'Should have gotten a woman to model...', '2005-04-26 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328956, 170201, 35998, '<td valign="top">Nice... I can picture a series of "Perfect Setting Ads"  a landscape, a table setting and then this.... Very nice.</td>', 'Nice... I can picture a series of "Perfect Setting Ads"  a landscape, a table setting and then this.... Very nice.', '2005-04-26 16:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328959, 169965, 33672, '<td valign="top">Brighter colors,(maybe a tad more saturation) a little more detail, And take out the reflexion and this is one of the best in the contest. Great comp and execution.</td>', 'Brighter colors,(maybe a tad more saturation) a little more detail, And take out the reflexion and this is one of the best in the contest. Great comp and execution.', '2005-04-26 16:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328964, 169563, 35998, '<td valign="top">Nice, would have liked to see some sparkle directly represented on the stones.</td>', 'Nice, would have liked to see some sparkle directly represented on the stones.', '2005-04-26 16:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328970, 169254, 35998, '<td valign="top">I''ve used scrabble pieces in real ads despite my legal department telling me not too, as the tiles themselves are trademarked... so in real life you would have atleast had to Photoshop the numbers on the tiles out...</td>', 'I''ve used scrabble pieces in real ads despite my legal department telling me not too, as the tiles themselves are trademarked... so in real life you would have atleast had to Photoshop the numbers on the tiles out...', '2005-04-26 16:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328971, 168965, 31610, '<td valign="top">Your text is lost in the vase. Try using an outline on it.</td>', 'Your text is lost in the vase. Try using an outline on it.', '2005-04-26 16:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328973, 169965, 35998, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-04-26 16:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328976, 169578, 33672, '<td valign="top">Original piece and ad design.  Many probably won''t get the name play on the musical group. The silver needs to be more brilliant and there needs to be more contrast. Placement and Comp are excellent.</td>', 'Original piece and ad design.  Many probably won''t get the name play on the musical group. The silver needs to be more brilliant and there needs to be more contrast. Placement and Comp are excellent.', '2005-04-26 16:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328980, 170361, 8139, '<td valign="top">admirable . 10</td>', 'admirable . 10', '2005-04-26 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1328985, 170327, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and photo, I''d change the font to something less complicated.  Overall very nice. Nice text placement.</td>', 'Nice comp and photo, I''d change the font to something less complicated.  Overall very nice. Nice text placement.', '2005-04-26 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329001, 169396, 31610, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this one much better if you had not put text on it.</td>', 'I would have liked this one much better if you had not put text on it.', '2005-04-26 16:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329004, 169903, 30049, '<td valign="top">If you were going for a rich warm tone, it worked.  If not - the lighting is off a bit.  ;^)  I like the way you''ve grouped the watches, it''s a unique twist to what I''ve seen thus far.  One problem with the watches laying flat is you''re getting some excess reflections on the watch faces.  A polarizer would have helped some with that.  Regarding the text, another color choice might have been a gold that coordinates with the watches.  Of course, this all just my opinion.  Hope all goes well for you with the challenge - good luck.</td>', 'If you were going for a rich warm tone, it worked.  If not - the lighting is off a bit.  ;^)  I like the way you''ve grouped the watches, it''s a unique twist to what I''ve seen thus far.  One problem with the watches laying flat is you''re getting some excess reflections on the watch faces.  A polarizer would have helped some with that.  Regarding the text, another color choice might have been a gold that coordinates with the watches.  Of course, this all just my opinion.  Hope all goes well for you with the challenge - good luck.', '2005-04-26 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329009, 170166, 31610, '<td valign="top">Nice use of text</td>', 'Nice use of text', '2005-04-26 16:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329017, 170271, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea...let the earring stand out against the darker areas of the image.  I would like to see a bit more of the jewelry.  Perhaps crop most of the face and some of the shoulder out...   Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea...let the earring stand out against the darker areas of the image.  I would like to see a bit more of the jewelry.  Perhaps crop most of the face and some of the shoulder out...   Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-26 16:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329022, 170357, 31610, '<td valign="top">I love that ring!</td>', 'I love that ring!', '2005-04-26 16:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329056, 170349, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple composition...it works just fine.  Nice sparkle in the diamond.  Lighting may be just a shade hot.  What is reflecting in the mans ring?  Looks like the edge of a table or a persons head?  Overall - nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Simple composition...it works just fine.  Nice sparkle in the diamond.  Lighting may be just a shade hot.  What is reflecting in the mans ring?  Looks like the edge of a table or a persons head?  Overall - nice shot.  Good luck.', '2005-04-26 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329057, 169814, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve framed this and have the text in a border area outside of the image.  The jewelry has a few hot spots from lighting which makes it seem a bit out of focus in comparison to the backdrop used.  Overall a nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve framed this and have the text in a border area outside of the image.  The jewelry has a few hot spots from lighting which makes it seem a bit out of focus in comparison to the backdrop used.  Overall a nice photo.  Good luck.', '2005-04-26 16:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329067, 168945, 17033, '<td valign="top">Subtle, sophisticated, professional. Great composition. Couple of comments: mamba too dark I think and perhaps pendant stones are sharpened beyond the available detail. Great overall</td>', 'Subtle, sophisticated, professional. Great composition. Couple of comments: mamba too dark I think and perhaps pendant stones are sharpened beyond the available detail. Great overall', '2005-04-26 16:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329072, 168960, 29904, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! in every sence of the word!  The Blue without a doubt!</td>', 'Brilliant! in every sence of the word!  The Blue without a doubt!', '2005-04-26 16:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329077, 169444, 17033, '<td valign="top">You''re out of the date window for the Challenge...or has the watch stopped!!!!! Very funny and yet really quite professional. I have to say that my pref. is for a light pieces against a dark background rather than this high key approach but overall I like it (my wife wants to know where you got it too for some reason).</td>', 'You''re out of the date window for the Challenge...or has the watch stopped!!!!! Very funny and yet really quite professional. I have to say that my pref. is for a light pieces against a dark background rather than this high key approach but overall I like it (my wife wants to know where you got it too for some reason).', '2005-04-26 17:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329084, 169252, 17033, '<td valign="top">Sophisticated approach but high key style diminishes impact of stone imho. Good attempt overall. PS is it DeBeers? Or is this clue to the photographer?!</td>', 'Sophisticated approach but high key style diminishes impact of stone imho. Good attempt overall. PS is it DeBeers? Or is this clue to the photographer?!', '2005-04-26 17:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329094, 168960, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure advertiserswould go for this cheeky approach but fantastic capture of the rocks.</td>', 'Not sure advertiserswould go for this cheeky approach but fantastic capture of the rocks.', '2005-04-26 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329100, 170037, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure juxtaposition of pearls with polystyrene works although without the packaging this would be quite effective.</td>', 'Not sure juxtaposition of pearls with polystyrene works although without the packaging this would be quite effective.', '2005-04-26 17:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329124, 169609, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the way the jewelry looks, however all the lines tend to distract me.</td>', 'I like the way the jewelry looks, however all the lines tend to distract me.', '2005-04-26 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329127, 170355, 32378, '<td valign="top">This needs more depth of field.</td>', 'This needs more depth of field.', '2005-04-26 17:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329129, 169302, 32378, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.</td>', 'Cute idea.', '2005-04-26 17:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329142, 169569, 32378, '<td valign="top">Seems like the focus is a little soft on the close pearls.</td>', 'Seems like the focus is a little soft on the close pearls.', '2005-04-26 17:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329145, 170230, 32378, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little to blown out.</td>', 'The colors are a little to blown out.', '2005-04-26 17:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329151, 169256, 32378, '<td valign="top">Not to be picky, but I think there are 4Cs.  Cut, Color, Clarity and Carat.</td>', 'Not to be picky, but I think there are 4Cs.  Cut, Color, Clarity and Carat.', '2005-04-26 17:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329152, 169569, 35746, '<td valign="top">i really enjoyed viewing your entry the shot is so full and yet your product stands out very dramatically....keeping the color of the rose so subdued was a wonderful move...best of luck.....</td>', 'i really enjoyed viewing your entry the shot is so full and yet your product stands out very dramatically....keeping the color of the rose so subdued was a wonderful move...best of luck.....', '2005-04-26 17:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329155, 169539, 32378, '<td valign="top">The flower seems to be the dominate subject and not the jewelry.</td>', 'The flower seems to be the dominate subject and not the jewelry.', '2005-04-26 17:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329157, 170156, 32378, '<td valign="top">My eyes aren''t drawn to the necklace.</td>', 'My eyes aren''t drawn to the necklace.', '2005-04-26 17:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329161, 170276, 35746, '<td valign="top">bravo and well done....simple and elegant...the clarity of the product is wonderful...and is inviting to me as the potential buyer</td>', 'bravo and well done....simple and elegant...the clarity of the product is wonderful...and is inviting to me as the potential buyer', '2005-04-26 17:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329171, 170158, 35746, '<td valign="top">i absolutely love this ad...brilliant move keeping the natural beauty of the stone in a natural habitat.....best of luck......</td>', 'i absolutely love this ad...brilliant move keeping the natural beauty of the stone in a natural habitat.....best of luck......', '2005-04-26 17:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
