(1329506, 168507, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice layout and comp. It needs a different DOF that accentuates the whole ring. Font needs to be in contrast with background to stand out more. Minor revisions that would bring a smile to most ad people.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice layout and comp. It needs a different DOF that accentuates the whole ring. Font needs to be in contrast with background to stand out more. Minor revisions that would bring a smile to most ad people.  Nice job.', '2005-04-26 19:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329507, 169757, 6814, '<td valign="top">For this image to really work, the diamond has to POP at the viewer.  Because of the way this was lit, that''s not the case.  The diamond is reflecting gold when it should be just the glitter of crystal.</td>', 'For this image to really work, the diamond has to POP at the viewer.  Because of the way this was lit, that''s not the case.  The diamond is reflecting gold when it should be just the glitter of crystal.', '2005-04-26 19:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329513, 169719, 6814, '<td valign="top">For an advertising piece, you really don''t want the shadows which tend to be distracting.  This is a shot where a macro ring would have given you the light that you need to fully illuminate the stones.</td>', 'For an advertising piece, you really don''t want the shadows which tend to be distracting.  This is a shot where a macro ring would have given you the light that you need to fully illuminate the stones.', '2005-04-26 19:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329516, 170065, 33672, '<td valign="top">Wow! very nice. Attention to detail as I believe that you''ve found the "official Bulova Font" Nice comp and clarity. One small revision i''d suggest is the text on the bottom needs to be larger, capitalized and one word!</td>', 'Wow! very nice. Attention to detail as I believe that you''ve found the "official Bulova Font" Nice comp and clarity. One small revision i''d suggest is the text on the bottom needs to be larger, capitalized and one word!', '2005-04-26 19:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329518, 168507, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image which focuses the viewer''s attention where it should be . . . on the stone.  Excellent job!</td>', 'This is an excellent image which focuses the viewer''s attention where it should be . . . on the stone.  Excellent job!', '2005-04-26 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329524, 170203, 6814, '<td valign="top">The ring almost gets lost in the flowers.  You need to crop this down so that the ring is truly the center of attention.  Also, the focus should be absolutely sharp on the ring.  In this image, the focus on the ring is too soft.</td>', 'The ring almost gets lost in the flowers.  You need to crop this down so that the ring is truly the center of attention.  Also, the focus should be absolutely sharp on the ring.  In this image, the focus on the ring is too soft.', '2005-04-26 20:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329530, 170340, 6814, '<td valign="top">The angle of the lighting for this shot is wrong which leaves the stones in shadow.  You need to lower your light to a point that''s almost below the ring in order to get the lighting effect that will focus attention where it needs to be.</td>', 'The angle of the lighting for this shot is wrong which leaves the stones in shadow.  You need to lower your light to a point that''s almost below the ring in order to get the lighting effect that will focus attention where it needs to be.', '2005-04-26 20:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329532, 170349, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  The catch-light on the diamond is just a touch too harsh, but still works.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  The catch-light on the diamond is just a touch too harsh, but still works.  Nicely done.', '2005-04-26 20:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329536, 169396, 6814, '<td valign="top">For a jewelry advertisement, the lighting across the stones needs to be almost equal on all areas.  in this case, the stones on the left side of the image are in deep shadow which is very distracting.</td>', 'For a jewelry advertisement, the lighting across the stones needs to be almost equal on all areas.  in this case, the stones on the left side of the image are in deep shadow which is very distracting.', '2005-04-26 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329538, 169302, 6814, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the ring gets lost in the glove in this shot.  I like the idea, but your central subject is overwhelmed by the prop.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the ring gets lost in the glove in this shot.  I like the idea, but your central subject is overwhelmed by the prop.', '2005-04-26 20:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329542, 169491, 34556, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, right on topic.</td>', 'Nice shot, right on topic.', '2005-04-26 20:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329543, 170234, 6814, '<td valign="top">I love the idea behind this image.  You''ve focused the attention on the necklace with the color.  The focus on the necklace needs to be just a little sharper to fully get the job done.</td>', 'I love the idea behind this image.  You''ve focused the attention on the necklace with the color.  The focus on the necklace needs to be just a little sharper to fully get the job done.', '2005-04-26 20:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329548, 170080, 34556, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the focus/eqousure is spot on. I would suggest having the time set so a s not to block the text.</td>', 'I like the composition, the focus/eqousure is spot on. I would suggest having the time set so a s not to block the text.', '2005-04-26 20:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329550, 170165, 6814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job selling your product.  You''ve done everything right from composition, to lighting to focus.  Excellent!</td>', 'Beautiful job selling your product.  You''ve done everything right from composition, to lighting to focus.  Excellent!', '2005-04-26 20:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
