(1329632, 169877, 32108, '<td valign="top">presentation is uninteresting</td>', 'presentation is uninteresting', '2005-04-26 20:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329665, 168507, 31955, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and lighting. Good job with the reflections too. I think the font style and color complient the ring nicely. I predict a top 10 finish for this one. Well done.</td>', 'Nice comp and lighting. Good job with the reflections too. I think the font style and color complient the ring nicely. I predict a top 10 finish for this one. Well done.', '2005-04-26 20:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329681, 169563, 31955, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and good choice of text and font....<br/> <br/>This is my second pass at this. Im bumping this up a mark.  I can see no reflections and the lighting is really stunning. Only thing I would do different is turn the ring a bit so its face on. I am predicting a top 10 finish for this one. Good job. 7</td>', 'Good lighting and good choice of text and font.... This is my second pass at this. Im bumping this up a mark.  I can see no reflections and the lighting is really stunning. Only thing I would do different is turn the ring a bit so its face on. I am predicting a top 10 finish for this one. Good job. 7', '2005-04-26 20:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329686, 170300, 33672, '<td valign="top">I almost passed this as I didn''t see any text, which leads to my only revise I would suggest (enlarge the text!). This is a great shot and well composed. The marketing in me loves that there''s a price listed! This Dof works if the photo were crisper or had more contrast. However, I prefer a deeper one. (DOF)</td>', 'I almost passed this as I didn''t see any text, which leads to my only revise I would suggest (enlarge the text!). This is a great shot and well composed. The marketing in me loves that there''s a price listed! This Dof works if the photo were crisper or had more contrast. However, I prefer a deeper one. (DOF)', '2005-04-26 20:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329689, 168355, 31955, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Brilliant lighting and good control of reflections. Font style and color are nice. They look like there meant to be there unlike some others. Also the border compliments the image. I would have made the border a little less black and more liek the font color. This is in my top 10. Good job.</td>', 'Nice job. Brilliant lighting and good control of reflections. Font style and color are nice. They look like there meant to be there unlike some others. Also the border compliments the image. I would have made the border a little less black and more liek the font color. This is in my top 10. Good job.', '2005-04-26 20:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329698, 170166, 31955, '<td valign="top">This is good. I could imagine turning a mag page and seeing this. Good posture, looks like hes going somewhere. Nice choice of font and text. Very minimal is very effective. This is in my top ten. Good Job</td>', 'This is good. I could imagine turning a mag page and seeing this. Good posture, looks like hes going somewhere. Nice choice of font and text. Very minimal is very effective. This is in my top ten. Good Job', '2005-04-26 20:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329704, 170332, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great photo and ad! Masterful shots like this are so well composed that they don''t need text. This tells me exactly what you''re selling and it''s an image builder as well. To nit pick, the reflection is a bit distracting as I can see you. But one of the most professional in the comp. Outstanding!</td>', 'Great photo and ad! Masterful shots like this are so well composed that they don''t need text. This tells me exactly what you''re selling and it''s an image builder as well. To nit pick, the reflection is a bit distracting as I can see you. But one of the most professional in the comp. Outstanding!', '2005-04-26 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329724, 170339, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love it but the supply would be limited, no? Great comp and lighting and shadows!  Very creatve! I like how you placed the text to contrast.  You''d do well in advertising.</td>', 'I love it but the supply would be limited, no? Great comp and lighting and shadows!  Very creatve! I like how you placed the text to contrast.  You''d do well in advertising.', '2005-04-26 20:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329735, 169569, 33672, '<td valign="top">Wow! Doesn''t need text. Great Comp. Necklace Needs to be a touch crisper to be fully effective as an ad.  Outstanding job and the borders a nice touch</td>', 'Wow! Doesn''t need text. Great Comp. Necklace Needs to be a touch crisper to be fully effective as an ad.  Outstanding job and the borders a nice touch', '2005-04-26 20:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329739, 170257, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice layout.  Great comp, ad I''m sure what your selling. Text placement needs work. Larger and different font would do wonders. so would a crisper shot of the cross.</td>', 'Nice layout.  Great comp, ad I''m sure what your selling. Text placement needs work. Larger and different font would do wonders. so would a crisper shot of the cross.', '2005-04-26 20:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329746, 170320, 33672, '<td valign="top">The comp here is fantastic, A different font, consistancy with punctuation (Artist license doesn''t extend that far) and more contrast with the ring would be needed to make this a proffesional Ad. Great background and font.</td>', 'The comp here is fantastic, A different font, consistancy with punctuation (Artist license doesn''t extend that far) and more contrast with the ring would be needed to make this a proffesional Ad. Great background and font.', '2005-04-26 21:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329753, 170224, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here with DOF and placing the text in the out of focus area,  i wish more of the necklace was in focus. You probably didn''t need to get the whole necklace in but With the comp you used, you''d need a deeper field.  The ring makes it crowded and seems out of place. Seperate the two or exclude the ring. I love the text and the font. It really jumps out at you.</td>', 'I like what you did here with DOF and placing the text in the out of focus area,  i wish more of the necklace was in focus. You probably didn''t need to get the whole necklace in but With the comp you used, you''d need a deeper field.  The ring makes it crowded and seems out of place. Seperate the two or exclude the ring. I love the text and the font. It really jumps out at you.', '2005-04-26 21:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329755, 169719, 33672, '<td valign="top">Text  gets lost. It could of used a black stroke of .5 point to really stand out. I like the font and the piece. The Dof and text mix wonderfully (putting the text in the out of focus area). Edit: I didn''t know you can''t use a stroke because its against DPC rules. You''d need a diffrent color font or background to get it to stand out.  I really like the comp here.</td>', 'Text  gets lost. It could of used a black stroke of .5 point to really stand out. I like the font and the piece. The Dof and text mix wonderfully (putting the text in the out of focus area). Edit: I didn''t know you can''t use a stroke because its against DPC rules. You''d need a diffrent color font or background to get it to stand out.  I really like the comp here.', '2005-04-26 21:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329758, 169963, 33672, '<td valign="top">Having the piece go from the black to the white makes it difficult to show the details. The ad itself is original and well centered.</td>', 'Having the piece go from the black to the white makes it difficult to show the details. The ad itself is original and well centered.', '2005-04-26 21:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329763, 170079, 33672, '<td valign="top">White text could be easily placed on this well composed, very crisp photo! Nice, job. ad ready.</td>', 'White text could be easily placed on this well composed, very crisp photo! Nice, job. ad ready.', '2005-04-26 21:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329773, 170194, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very,very clever. However, You''ll need a much crisper shot with enough contrast to really show the tiffany name to pull this off. very creative. Fonts need to be little looser (most don''t know how to do this) but overall excellent job!</td>', 'Very,very clever. However, You''ll need a much crisper shot with enough contrast to really show the tiffany name to pull this off. very creative. Fonts need to be little looser (most don''t know how to do this) but overall excellent job!', '2005-04-26 21:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329785, 170203, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo of jewelry,  The DOF works for me but the background color may be tough to find a font color that stands out enough to deliver the message.</td>', 'This is a great photo of jewelry,  The DOF works for me but the background color may be tough to find a font color that stands out enough to deliver the message.', '2005-04-26 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329789, 170361, 35739, '<td valign="top">One of the better photo''s I have seen so far.  I like how you brought out just the jewery. I like the expression on the model.  I do not care for the font however to me that does not count.</td>', 'One of the better photo''s I have seen so far.  I like how you brought out just the jewery. I like the expression on the model.  I do not care for the font however to me that does not count.', '2005-04-26 21:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329790, 169467, 33672, '<td valign="top">So crisp and well defined! The comp is lacking and I see so much potential if only the shell were larger and flipped so the ring were inside the shell. the angle would show more of the ring.  Your skills as a photographer would keep you in our palm pilot.</td>', 'So crisp and well defined! The comp is lacking and I see so much potential if only the shell were larger and flipped so the ring were inside the shell. the angle would show more of the ring.  Your skills as a photographer would keep you in our palm pilot.', '2005-04-26 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329791, 169734, 35739, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Being a collector of vintage watches, I was attracted to this.<br/>Well done. The only issue would be the choice of background color.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Being a collector of vintage watches, I was attracted to this.Well done. The only issue would be the choice of background color.', '2005-04-26 21:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329793, 169543, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the glowing nature captured in the  photo of the pearls.  <br/> <br/>I''m afraid I feel less sanguine about the text.  Wish it had some of that same  warm sepia luster.  Not sure I would pair these two fonts.  When using three parallel one word sentences it''s best if they are all the the same part of speech.</td>', 'I love the glowing nature captured in the  photo of the pearls.   I''m afraid I feel less sanguine about the text.  Wish it had some of that same  warm sepia luster.  Not sure I would pair these two fonts.  When using three parallel one word sentences it''s best if they are all the the same part of speech.', '2005-04-26 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329794, 169873, 33560, '<td valign="top">Quite striking.  Elegant.</td>', 'Quite striking.  Elegant.', '2005-04-26 21:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329797, 170357, 33560, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  With this treatment, even the patina looks good.</td>', 'Lovely.  With this treatment, even the patina looks good.', '2005-04-26 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329802, 169877, 33672, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it The shadows are great but the DOF and focus are not effective. comp is good.</td>', 'I don''t get it The shadows are great but the DOF and focus are not effective. comp is good.', '2005-04-26 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329803, 169569, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a very beautiful composition.  Both image and imagery are powerful.  I''m kind of wishing the pearls nearest the camera were a bit more in focus, but I don''t see that as a big problem.</td>', 'It''s a very beautiful composition.  Both image and imagery are powerful.  I''m kind of wishing the pearls nearest the camera were a bit more in focus, but I don''t see that as a big problem.', '2005-04-26 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329810, 170271, 33672, '<td valign="top">alot of potential here. Great comp that would lend itself well to text.  However, It needs a larger piece or more emphasis on it as I''m really not sure what you''re trying to sell.  Great photo and lighting.</td>', 'alot of potential here. Great comp that would lend itself well to text.  However, It needs a larger piece or more emphasis on it as I''m really not sure what you''re trying to sell.  Great photo and lighting.', '2005-04-26 21:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329815, 170345, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the concept.  Try as I may, I can''t seem to overcome my prejudice that I should be seeing more jewelry and less blurry shadows.</td>', 'I love the concept.  Try as I may, I can''t seem to overcome my prejudice that I should be seeing more jewelry and less blurry shadows.', '2005-04-26 21:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329825, 169970, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp! The colors jump out at me, the subject is very crisp, but the details need revisions. I''d suggest a different font with a different color (darker and larger, even though I can see what you''re trying to do here.) Also the DOF make me feel as if I''m looking at it sideways.</td>', 'Great comp! The colors jump out at me, the subject is very crisp, but the details need revisions. I''d suggest a different font with a different color (darker and larger, even though I can see what you''re trying to do here.) Also the DOF make me feel as if I''m looking at it sideways.', '2005-04-26 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329826, 170232, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, nice execurion.</td>', 'Nice concept, nice execurion.', '2005-04-26 21:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329828, 170074, 33672, '<td valign="top">This has great composition,The DOF is great but I''m not sure what you''re trying to sell. There needs to more focus and emphasis on the product.</td>', 'This has great composition,The DOF is great but I''m not sure what you''re trying to sell. There needs to more focus and emphasis on the product.', '2005-04-26 21:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329831, 169286, 36299, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I like the balance.  The text is great for an add, this picture is good enough to just have a single word being the designers name or company.</td>', 'This is great.  I like the balance.  The text is great for an add, this picture is good enough to just have a single word being the designers name or company.', '2005-04-26 21:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329837, 168575, 33560, '<td valign="top">HAH!  A fake bee pollenating a fake flower indoors under fake sunlight.  Definitely good for a chuckle.<br/> <br/>The colors in the bee look good together, they are all clear, primary colors.  Fake daisy clashes subtly with itself   (orange and magenta almost work; magenta and brown do not.)  and strongly with the bee.  The bee seems a little unsharp. The glare on the right and the resulting lens flare are distracting.</td>', 'HAH!  A fake bee pollenating a fake flower indoors under fake sunlight.  Definitely good for a chuckle. The colors in the bee look good together, they are all clear, primary colors.  Fake daisy clashes subtly with itself   (orange and magenta almost work; magenta and brown do not.)  and strongly with the bee.  The bee seems a little unsharp. The glare on the right and the resulting lens flare are distracting.', '2005-04-26 21:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329838, 169821, 36299, '<td valign="top">The pearls in this picture are nice.  Only thing different, I would do, is use an oyster shell instead.  By doing that, you would bump the richness of the photo.  By adding another dark object that belongs.</td>', 'The pearls in this picture are nice.  Only thing different, I would do, is use an oyster shell instead.  By doing that, you would bump the richness of the photo.  By adding another dark object that belongs.', '2005-04-26 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329842, 170158, 36299, '<td valign="top">Love this.  A tad shiny on the silver cross from lighting, but not bad.  Negative space works well with orange, and complements the shadows.</td>', 'Love this.  A tad shiny on the silver cross from lighting, but not bad.  Negative space works well with orange, and complements the shadows.', '2005-04-26 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329846, 170278, 36299, '<td valign="top">This awesome, I love the lizard on rock with water and leaf.  Catches the 5 elements.</td>', 'This awesome, I love the lizard on rock with water and leaf.  Catches the 5 elements.', '2005-04-26 21:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329847, 170065, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice idea comparing a watch to a rock. Beautifully photographed.  Quibbles: I''m wondering if it should not be ''forever''  and if the balance would be just a bit better if the font face for this word were just a smidge smaller.  Finally, I kind of like those dots, but wonder if the exclamation weakens the claim by cheapening it.</td>', 'Nice idea comparing a watch to a rock. Beautifully photographed.  Quibbles: I''m wondering if it should not be ''forever''  and if the balance would be just a bit better if the font face for this word were just a smidge smaller.  Finally, I kind of like those dots, but wonder if the exclamation weakens the claim by cheapening it.', '2005-04-26 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329851, 169025, 33560, '<td valign="top">Glowing, Glimmering, Gorgeous.</td>', 'Glowing, Glimmering, Gorgeous.', '2005-04-26 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329852, 170086, 33672, '<td valign="top">This has alot of potential.  The comp is great and the gorilla leaves some interesting negative space for text placement. There need to be more attention drawn to the product.  More emphasis on it so we know what''s being sold.The text needs revisions and should have to tell what the product is. Good start.</td>', 'This has alot of potential.  The comp is great and the gorilla leaves some interesting negative space for text placement. There need to be more attention drawn to the product.  More emphasis on it so we know what''s being sold.The text needs revisions and should have to tell what the product is. Good start.', '2005-04-26 21:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329853, 169714, 36078, '<td valign="top">Love the picture and focus on the ring and rose.  I wish the eye sockets had some gems in them but heck no fault of yours.  I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Love the picture and focus on the ring and rose.  I wish the eye sockets had some gems in them but heck no fault of yours.  I gave you a 7.', '2005-04-26 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329857, 170363, 36299, '<td valign="top">Capturing gems is a tuffy, only thing I would add is to increase the dof and use nail polish that worked with the gems.</td>', 'Capturing gems is a tuffy, only thing I would add is to increase the dof and use nail polish that worked with the gems.', '2005-04-26 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329859, 170349, 36078, '<td valign="top">I like the wideness of the photo but the colors seem to be off to me.  Just seems a slightly bit pinkish.  I still gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like the wideness of the photo but the colors seem to be off to me.  Just seems a slightly bit pinkish.  I still gave it a 7.', '2005-04-26 21:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329860, 168569, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love AZ!  I can see details and the shot is very crisp. It is, however, very crowded and a little dark. The font need revision and needs to be more consistant to work in this composition.</td>', 'I love AZ!  I can see details and the shot is very crisp. It is, however, very crowded and a little dark. The font need revision and needs to be more consistant to work in this composition.', '2005-04-26 21:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329862, 168475, 36299, '<td valign="top">Ring is not in focus, but knuckle is.  To shallow a Depth of Field.  Great Idea though.  I like it.</td>', 'Ring is not in focus, but knuckle is.  To shallow a Depth of Field.  Great Idea though.  I like it.', '2005-04-26 21:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329867, 169714, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice  shot, nice font and shaodows. The comp needs to leave more room for text and the skull ring need to be sharper.</td>', 'Nice  shot, nice font and shaodows. The comp needs to leave more room for text and the skull ring need to be sharper.', '2005-04-26 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329868, 170339, 36078, '<td valign="top">Glad to see your the only one with this idea.  I was thinking of something simular, but was going to try and heatl some metal and then stick one of my "the one" rings as a scarifice.  Great shot.  Gave it a 7.</td>', 'Glad to see your the only one with this idea.  I was thinking of something simular, but was going to try and heatl some metal and then stick one of my "the one" rings as a scarifice.  Great shot.  Gave it a 7.', '2005-04-26 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329870, 170326, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the simple, and static composition and the white background.<br/> <br/>I don''t really know what green jade ought to look like.  Here it  posesses a beautiful color, but the reflections are so controlled that I cannot see that it is shiny or transluscent.  There is an analogous problem, it seems with the diamonds. Finally, I''m having a bit of a hard time telling which parts of the ring are actually in crisp focus.</td>', 'I love the simple, and static composition and the white background. I don''t really know what green jade ought to look like.  Here it  posesses a beautiful color, but the reflections are so controlled that I cannot see that it is shiny or transluscent.  There is an analogous problem, it seems with the diamonds. Finally, I''m having a bit of a hard time telling which parts of the ring are actually in crisp focus.', '2005-04-26 21:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329879, 170037, 33560, '<td valign="top">The incongruity of styrofoam packing peanuts, IMO, undermines the photo both visually and thematically.  Love the bowl. Love the necklace.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'The incongruity of styrofoam packing peanuts, IMO, undermines the photo both visually and thematically.  Love the bowl. Love the necklace.  Nice lighting.', '2005-04-26 22:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329882, 169950, 33672, '<td valign="top">Crisp shot and great comp.  Font should be fatter (is there a bold? or ad it after you save for web) I can''t figure out what you''re doing with address and why it is consistant.  But I like this ad.</td>', 'Crisp shot and great comp.  Font should be fatter (is there a bold? or ad it after you save for web) I can''t figure out what you''re doing with address and why it is consistant.  But I like this ad.', '2005-04-26 22:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329894, 169396, 33560, '<td valign="top">Love the photo of the ring.  Crisp focus, great composition, lighting.  The text doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Love the photo of the ring.  Crisp focus, great composition, lighting.  The text doesn''t work for me.', '2005-04-26 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1329899, 170094, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice Job! Fantastic comp and Text Placement. Direct and to the point, no doubt what''s being sold.  Bottom font color needs to be darker (maybe both) and capiltalized.Good message.</td>', 'Nice Job! Fantastic comp and Text Placement. Direct and to the point, no doubt what''s being sold.  Bottom font color needs to be darker (maybe both) and capiltalized.Good message.', '2005-04-26 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329900, 169569, 36299, '<td valign="top">Love this idea, but the pearls are not in focus.  Not enough Depth of Field, if there was this would be a real I catcher.</td>', 'Love this idea, but the pearls are not in focus.  Not enough Depth of Field, if there was this would be a real I catcher.', '2005-04-26 22:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329901, 167997, 33560, '<td valign="top">A little cute, a little corny.  Not sure this would be an effective ad, but the longer I look at the photo the more I warm to it.</td>', 'A little cute, a little corny.  Not sure this would be an effective ad, but the longer I look at the photo the more I warm to it.', '2005-04-26 22:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329905, 170361, 33560, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  Perfect in every respect.</td>', 'Brilliant.  Perfect in every respect.', '2005-04-26 22:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329908, 170287, 36299, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea, only things I would work on id the focus or Depth of Field.</td>', 'This is a neat idea, only things I would work on id the focus or Depth of Field.', '2005-04-26 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329913, 170265, 36299, '<td valign="top">Really like how the gem catches the light here, and is offset by the flower and the water is a nice touch.</td>', 'Really like how the gem catches the light here, and is offset by the flower and the water is a nice touch.', '2005-04-26 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329919, 169903, 33560, '<td valign="top">I really like the variety of textures; wood, leather, gold, glass.  Serene, staid, warm, comfortable, safe, serious, dignified, and rich.    I wish more than the stitching of the band appeared to me to be in crisp focus.  <br/> <br/>I''m afraid some mischievous hacker has squeezed into the corners of this photo some text in electric-green, san serif font  AAAAAAAARRRRRGGGGGHHHHH!!!!    Perhaps you should consider having them reported and banned from the site.</td>', 'I really like the variety of textures; wood, leather, gold, glass.  Serene, staid, warm, comfortable, safe, serious, dignified, and rich.    I wish more than the stitching of the band appeared to me to be in crisp focus.   I''m afraid some mischievous hacker has squeezed into the corners of this photo some text in electric-green, san serif font  AAAAAAAARRRRRGGGGGHHHHH!!!!    Perhaps you should consider having them reported and banned from the site.', '2005-04-26 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329927, 169361, 33560, '<td valign="top">Pairing bleached beach wood with pearls is an inspired choice.  I also like the blue background.  While I appreciate the rhythm of the pearls assembled in lines, the fact that those lines run parallel with the edge of the photo makes the composition feel more static than it needs to be.</td>', 'Pairing bleached beach wood with pearls is an inspired choice.  I also like the blue background.  While I appreciate the rhythm of the pearls assembled in lines, the fact that those lines run parallel with the edge of the photo makes the composition feel more static than it needs to be.', '2005-04-26 22:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329943, 169349, 35739, '<td valign="top">I believe the watch is on glass and the reflection is distracting.  The watch is not displayed straight (not that this matters) .  Not sure about the shadows on the right side (band).</td>', 'I believe the watch is on glass and the reflection is distracting.  The watch is not displayed straight (not that this matters) .  Not sure about the shadows on the right side (band).', '2005-04-26 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329945, 170339, 33560, '<td valign="top">I really like the allusion to the Lord of the Rings.  I like the shiny glowing quality of the ring and the shadow of the grabbing hand. I know it is ridiculously silly to feel as strongly as I do about the colors, but the muted taupe clashes mightily with the warm pink and coral, IMO.</td>', 'I really like the allusion to the Lord of the Rings.  I like the shiny glowing quality of the ring and the shadow of the grabbing hand. I know it is ridiculously silly to feel as strongly as I do about the colors, but the muted taupe clashes mightily with the warm pink and coral, IMO.', '2005-04-26 22:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329951, 170340, 35739, '<td valign="top">Its the text.   It would have been nice if there was some reflection in the diamonds.  I do not like the layout. Wish the diamonds were facing the camera(so all the diamonds are shown)  A little reflection on the diamonds may have brought out this ring.  Looks like a beautiful ring.</td>', 'Its the text.   It would have been nice if there was some reflection in the diamonds.  I do not like the layout. Wish the diamonds were facing the camera(so all the diamonds are shown)  A little reflection on the diamonds may have brought out this ring.  Looks like a beautiful ring.', '2005-04-26 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329960, 170355, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not clear at all. I am sure these are beautiful yet I cannot tell.</td>', 'Not clear at all. I am sure these are beautiful yet I cannot tell.', '2005-04-26 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329961, 170172, 33560, '<td valign="top">There''s a refreshing ''girl next door'' look to the model.  While most ad aproaches make you want it precisely because you cannot have it, this strikes me as taking a different approach.  It strikes me as moral high ground - in a way.   Appealing to our sense of beauty without tapping into those powerful ''deadly sin'' emotions.  Apologies for philosophizing, but I am interested in photography for more than what lies on the surface.<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful shot. And it gets better and better with viewing.</td>', 'There''s a refreshing ''girl next door'' look to the model.  While most ad aproaches make you want it precisely because you cannot have it, this strikes me as taking a different approach.  It strikes me as moral high ground - in a way.   Appealing to our sense of beauty without tapping into those powerful ''deadly sin'' emotions.  Apologies for philosophizing, but I am interested in photography for more than what lies on the surface. It''s a beautiful shot. And it gets better and better with viewing.', '2005-04-26 22:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329967, 169444, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  Nice photo.</td>', 'Very funny!  Nice photo.', '2005-04-26 22:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329968, 170079, 33560, '<td valign="top">Offbeat.  Gorgeous.  Thanks!</td>', 'Offbeat.  Gorgeous.  Thanks!', '2005-04-26 22:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329972, 170309, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful,  Very different, Very FUNNY.</td>', 'Very beautiful,  Very different, Very FUNNY.', '2005-04-26 22:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329985, 170166, 33560, '<td valign="top">Strong Imagery.  Beautiful Photo.  Great break from sparkles and gloss.</td>', 'Strong Imagery.  Beautiful Photo.  Great break from sparkles and gloss.', '2005-04-26 23:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329986, 170340, 8624, '<td valign="top">your ring shot looks great. nice soft lighting and good use of shallow depth of field. I don''t care for the font or the dark black choice for it, though.</td>', 'your ring shot looks great. nice soft lighting and good use of shallow depth of field. I don''t care for the font or the dark black choice for it, though.', '2005-04-26 23:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329987, 170051, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely laid out composition with a pleasant &amp; neutral background that doesn''t take away from the shot.<br/>Not sure on the size of the text, and seems like there is something missing in the last line of text. Maybe something like "Make it Antique Sapphires &amp; Diamonds" or something like that anyway.<br/></td>', 'Nicely laid out composition with a pleasant & neutral background that doesn''t take away from the shot.Not sure on the size of the text, and seems like there is something missing in the last line of text. Maybe something like "Make it Antique Sapphires & Diamonds" or something like that anyway.', '2005-04-26 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329989, 169472, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but if you are selling the jewelry and not the girl or the sunglassses, then I think those elements should be the focus of the image.</td>', 'I like the shot, but if you are selling the jewelry and not the girl or the sunglassses, then I think those elements should be the focus of the image.', '2005-04-26 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329990, 170184, 8624, '<td valign="top">lighting is very dark and harsh. I think a brighter background and a tighter crop on the ring might have been more effective.</td>', 'lighting is very dark and harsh. I think a brighter background and a tighter crop on the ring might have been more effective.', '2005-04-26 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329991, 169444, 22293, '<td valign="top">such a nice break from the more mundane shots and text.  funny stuff.</td>', 'such a nice break from the more mundane shots and text.  funny stuff.', '2005-04-26 23:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329992, 170327, 19708, '<td valign="top">This has a nice feel to it - simple &amp; clean. The lighting works well here.<br/>I have mixed feelings on the mixing of the font, and the word "are" isn''t very clean (no biggie really)<br/></td>', 'This has a nice feel to it - simple & clean. The lighting works well here.I have mixed feelings on the mixing of the font, and the word "are" isn''t very clean (no biggie really)', '2005-04-26 23:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329994, 170320, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think the background makes Bob''s fine jewelry look too cheap and kitschy.</td>', 'I think the background makes Bob''s fine jewelry look too cheap and kitschy.', '2005-04-26 23:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329996, 170327, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and a good clean design. focus is a little soft. I don''t understand your choice of 3 different font size and two type faces. keep it simple.</td>', 'nice lighting and a good clean design. focus is a little soft. I don''t understand your choice of 3 different font size and two type faces. keep it simple.', '2005-04-26 23:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329997, 170230, 25397, '<td valign="top">Awesome, one of my favourites<br/> <br/>The softness on the rings works well, despite what some others may say<br/></td>', 'Awesome, one of my favourites The softness on the rings works well, despite what some others may say', '2005-04-26 23:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329999, 169010, 8624, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea showing the back of the watch. It is eye catching, but I don''t know how it sells the product. what is the striped thing behind the words? keep it simple!</td>', 'Interesting idea showing the back of the watch. It is eye catching, but I don''t know how it sells the product. what is the striped thing behind the words? keep it simple!', '2005-04-26 23:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330000, 170339, 25397, '<td valign="top">Woah man, is that a hand I see reaching for it in the shadow!? :-o<br/>Awesome.<br/> <br/>Jjust cause your a Lord Of The Rings kinda person your picture has a special place in my heart.</td>', 'Woah man, is that a hand I see reaching for it in the shadow!? :-oAwesome. Jjust cause your a Lord Of The Rings kinda person your picture has a special place in my heart.', '2005-04-26 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330002, 170325, 25397, '<td valign="top">very creative take on the challenge</td>', 'very creative take on the challenge', '2005-04-26 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330003, 169302, 8624, '<td valign="top">good idea but get in tighter!  too much glove, not enough ring.</td>', 'good idea but get in tighter!  too much glove, not enough ring.', '2005-04-26 23:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330009, 170234, 25397, '<td valign="top">good choice on the selective desaturation, it makes the picture man <br/>If I said I gave you a 10, I wouldn''t be lying. :-)</td>', 'good choice on the selective desaturation, it makes the picture man If I said I gave you a 10, I wouldn''t be lying. :-)', '2005-04-26 23:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
