(1330025, 169361, 25397, '<td valign="top">it''s treebeards new bracelet!<br/> <br/>I think this could have really jumped out more if the beads weren''t so centered in the frame. The picture needs a little contrast boost too, it would really compliment the wood.</td>', 'it''s treebeards new bracelet! I think this could have really jumped out more if the beads weren''t so centered in the frame. The picture needs a little contrast boost too, it would really compliment the wood.', '2005-04-26 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330027, 169302, 25397, '<td valign="top">the text style fits well with this pic-ter</td>', 'the text style fits well with this pic-ter', '2005-04-26 23:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330028, 168463, 25397, '<td valign="top">Cool gradient effect on the backround, brings your eye to where it should be<br/> <br/>good work</td>', 'Cool gradient effect on the backround, brings your eye to where it should be good work', '2005-04-26 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330031, 170340, 25397, '<td valign="top">I''d be real careful going to that website, man.</td>', 'I''d be real careful going to that website, man.', '2005-04-26 23:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330034, 169327, 25397, '<td valign="top">It''s the title that makes my cursor slide more to the right- if you know what I mean.</td>', 'It''s the title that makes my cursor slide more to the right- if you know what I mean.', '2005-04-26 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330036, 169609, 25397, '<td valign="top">I love this one, very cool placement, depth of field and ''all that jazz''<br/></td>', 'I love this one, very cool placement, depth of field and ''all that jazz''', '2005-04-26 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330037, 170305, 19708, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too close for an advertisement in my opinion.<br/>The cyan reflections and the cyan "blotches" in the background might have been removeable by taking the Hue/Saturation adjustment in your editor, sliding the lightness of the Cyan channel all the way bright, or taking it''s saturation all the way down.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too close for an advertisement in my opinion.The cyan reflections and the cyan "blotches" in the background might have been removeable by taking the Hue/Saturation adjustment in your editor, sliding the lightness of the Cyan channel all the way bright, or taking it''s saturation all the way down.', '2005-04-26 23:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330042, 170359, 19708, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit too close on the shot, thus losing some of it''s sharpness in the process.<br/>I don''t know what the red stripe is, but it is a distraction in this shot (plus it''s kinda'' crooked too?)</td>', 'Maybe a bit too close on the shot, thus losing some of it''s sharpness in the process.I don''t know what the red stripe is, but it is a distraction in this shot (plus it''s kinda'' crooked too?)', '2005-04-26 23:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330050, 170364, 19708, '<td valign="top">At this magnification, some of the details were lost resulting in a bit of a harsh image.<br/>Perhaps neat image (or similar noise reduction software) could have helped smooth the gold surfaces, yielding a softer image i my opinion.</td>', 'At this magnification, some of the details were lost resulting in a bit of a harsh image.Perhaps neat image (or similar noise reduction software) could have helped smooth the gold surfaces, yielding a softer image i my opinion.', '2005-04-26 23:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330059, 169862, 19708, '<td valign="top">Focal point seems to be more drawn to her eyes, than the earring (which looks a bit over-sharpened in my opinion)<br/>I like the direction/idea you went with this to soften the overall look.</td>', 'Focal point seems to be more drawn to her eyes, than the earring (which looks a bit over-sharpened in my opinion)I like the direction/idea you went with this to soften the overall look.', '2005-04-26 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330069, 170263, 19708, '<td valign="top">The overall blue theme on this is a bit too harsh on the eyes in my opinion.<br/>May have been a good candidate for neat image (or similar noise reduction software) to smooth out the noise, then appy the text.<br/>The font used is a bit odd in the way it gets smaller going to the right, particularly the word "you". May have looked better to have the words "for you" the same size.</td>', 'The overall blue theme on this is a bit too harsh on the eyes in my opinion.May have been a good candidate for neat image (or similar noise reduction software) to smooth out the noise, then appy the text.The font used is a bit odd in the way it gets smaller going to the right, particularly the word "you". May have looked better to have the words "for you" the same size.', '2005-04-26 23:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330102, 170153, 19708, '<td valign="top">Composition works for me, as well as the text layout.<br/>Personally the font used could have a little more feminine flair to it, which would soften teh feel there.<br/>I''m sure you have received comments about the lack of detail here and can only suggest less of a crop, not shooting too close to the subject, a smaller aperature (if available).<br/>Decent attempt at a difficult subject. (5)</td>', 'Composition works for me, as well as the text layout.Personally the font used could have a little more feminine flair to it, which would soften teh feel there.I''m sure you have received comments about the lack of detail here and can only suggest less of a crop, not shooting too close to the subject, a smaller aperature (if available).Decent attempt at a difficult subject. (5)', '2005-04-26 23:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330104, 168569, 19708, '<td valign="top">Lighting, background &amp; composition work pretty well here.<br/>Text/font used are taking a lot away from this submission in my opinion.</td>', 'Lighting, background & composition work pretty well here.Text/font used are taking a lot away from this submission in my opinion.', '2005-04-26 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330142, 170320, 19708, '<td valign="top">Having a hard time with this one.<br/>The ring isn''t lit well enough in the band to really make out what it is.<br/>The text is so big/spaced far apart it is difficult to read.<br/>The background is pretty unique and cheerful. (5)</td>', 'Having a hard time with this one.The ring isn''t lit well enough in the band to really make out what it is.The text is so big/spaced far apart it is difficult to read.The background is pretty unique and cheerful. (5)', '2005-04-27 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
