(1331580, 168945, 33560, '<td valign="top">The mamba is one of the earth''s most deadly poisonous snakes; when it bites, that''s it.  So I am entertained by the visual allusion to a snake in this photo as well as the textual one.  It''s a nice capture and negative space is used very well.</td>', 'The mamba is one of the earth''s most deadly poisonous snakes; when it bites, that''s it.  So I am entertained by the visual allusion to a snake in this photo as well as the textual one.  It''s a nice capture and negative space is used very well.', '2005-04-27 09:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331599, 168595, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a very organic piece of jewelry, so it is completely appropriate that it be juxtaposed with a natural object whose simplicity and geometric form suggests manmade objects.  As much as I like the idea, the colors, the forms, I think that the allium or whatever the flower is creates a visually confusing background which makes seeing the beautiful form of this piece more difficult.</td>', 'It''s a very organic piece of jewelry, so it is completely appropriate that it be juxtaposed with a natural object whose simplicity and geometric form suggests manmade objects.  As much as I like the idea, the colors, the forms, I think that the allium or whatever the flower is creates a visually confusing background which makes seeing the beautiful form of this piece more difficult.', '2005-04-27 09:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331604, 170290, 33560, '<td valign="top">Bothered by the almost nonexistant DOF.  I personally dislike this cerise pink paired with gold.</td>', 'Bothered by the almost nonexistant DOF.  I personally dislike this cerise pink paired with gold.', '2005-04-27 09:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331635, 169563, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the lines, the form of this ring. And I love its color.  Perfect lighting, DOF.  The backgound definitely adds interest, espscially in the reflections.   <br/> <br/>The text adds weight and balance to the photo where it needs them, yet somehow it doesn''t quite work for me. (Thinking out loud: While the serif font seems appropriate for  a ring that appears to have a little age, I think its flowing lines suggest either sanserif or something a little cursive, possibly purple, and perhaps bunched up more on the left side.  But I know nothing of these things.)</td>', 'I love the lines, the form of this ring. And I love its color.  Perfect lighting, DOF.  The backgound definitely adds interest, espscially in the reflections.    The text adds weight and balance to the photo where it needs them, yet somehow it doesn''t quite work for me. (Thinking out loud: While the serif font seems appropriate for  a ring that appears to have a little age, I think its flowing lines suggest either sanserif or something a little cursive, possibly purple, and perhaps bunched up more on the left side.  But I know nothing of these things.)', '2005-04-27 09:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331642, 170278, 33560, '<td valign="top">Lovely Lizard!  Up, or On the Rocks.  Beautiful composition. Nicely lit.  The water and laurel leaves are inspired touches. So''s the decision to crop the tail.  I think it''s a little subtle compared to a few  in this competition, but it is really lovely.</td>', 'Lovely Lizard!  Up, or On the Rocks.  Beautiful composition. Nicely lit.  The water and laurel leaves are inspired touches. So''s the decision to crop the tail.  I think it''s a little subtle compared to a few  in this competition, but it is really lovely.', '2005-04-27 09:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331670, 169757, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a rough color palette to work with - hard to get it just right without lots of clashing colors,  Kudos  on succeding here.  The diamond is well focused and lit.  The gold is very nicely rendered.<br/> <br/>Mixed feelings about the text. Aalthough it is well composed, uses the negative space well, is a good choice of font, and seems to be a pretty good color choice; I might like it better if it were a tad smaller or a tad darker.</td>', 'This is a rough color palette to work with - hard to get it just right without lots of clashing colors,  Kudos  on succeding here.  The diamond is well focused and lit.  The gold is very nicely rendered. Mixed feelings about the text. Aalthough it is well composed, uses the negative space well, is a good choice of font, and seems to be a pretty good color choice; I might like it better if it were a tad smaller or a tad darker.', '2005-04-27 09:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331698, 170195, 33560, '<td valign="top">Strong image to tap into the subconscious of the utilitarian majority.  Great choice of model - someone naturally attractive but not self-consciously so or over-primped.   Lighting is beautiful and so is DOF.  I even like that we do not see the eyes.<br/> <br/>I think the strong qualities of this photo are very subtle and understated. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Strong image to tap into the subconscious of the utilitarian majority.  Great choice of model - someone naturally attractive but not self-consciously so or over-primped.   Lighting is beautiful and so is DOF.  I even like that we do not see the eyes. I think the strong qualities of this photo are very subtle and understated. Hope it does well.', '2005-04-27 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331701, 168960, 33560, '<td valign="top">A hug and a kiss bundled together.  Nice idea.  Beautifully lit, crisply focused.  Nice.</td>', 'A hug and a kiss bundled together.  Nice idea.  Beautifully lit, crisply focused.  Nice.', '2005-04-27 09:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331734, 169539, 33560, '<td valign="top">Please forgive me for being so bold as to suggest it, but would Jasmine and Gold be a better title?  Jasmine is fragrant, rare, fleeting, expensive, remote, highly desirable, feminine, beautiful.  Gold is solid, permanent, expensive, highly prized, feminine, beautiful.  And the photo does a great job of suggesting their strong  symbolic resemblances.  I''m afraid ''Sales Event'' conveys to me a big rambling mouldering or temporary structure that smells of mold and dung at which herds of livestock or semi-trash are traded.    What''s wrong with this image?<br/> <br/>Sans title, it''s a nice, strong image.</td>', 'Please forgive me for being so bold as to suggest it, but would Jasmine and Gold be a better title?  Jasmine is fragrant, rare, fleeting, expensive, remote, highly desirable, feminine, beautiful.  Gold is solid, permanent, expensive, highly prized, feminine, beautiful.  And the photo does a great job of suggesting their strong  symbolic resemblances.  I''m afraid ''Sales Event'' conveys to me a big rambling mouldering or temporary structure that smells of mold and dung at which herds of livestock or semi-trash are traded.    What''s wrong with this image? Sans title, it''s a nice, strong image.', '2005-04-27 09:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331777, 169543, 9821, '<td valign="top">very well done ... 10</td>', 'very well done ... 10', '2005-04-27 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331778, 169754, 9821, '<td valign="top">perfectly done ... 10</td>', 'perfectly done ... 10', '2005-04-27 09:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331779, 170331, 33560, '<td valign="top">Composition is inspired, beautiful, clever. The result is quite dramatic.  I wonder whether the strong white reflection in the shell unnecessarily draws our eyes from the subject; and whether it could be cropped out without ruining the spacial strengths of the photo.</td>', 'Composition is inspired, beautiful, clever. The result is quite dramatic.  I wonder whether the strong white reflection in the shell unnecessarily draws our eyes from the subject; and whether it could be cropped out without ruining the spacial strengths of the photo.', '2005-04-27 09:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
