(1331842, 170080, 9821, '<td valign="top">excellent job</td>', 'excellent job', '2005-04-27 10:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331860, 169349, 33560, '<td valign="top">Pretty good choice of subject.   The straight-on lighting casts harsh shadows.  The composition is static, would have been better with left end cropped.  Watch is just a little too far away and too unsharp.  I want not only to be able to read the brand name, but the little lables in the blue dials.    Not finding a compelling reason for the watch to be set on its side.  If it is to be horizontal, it would seem a little neater if it were exactly horizontal.  Hope some of these suggestions are helpful.</td>', 'Pretty good choice of subject.   The straight-on lighting casts harsh shadows.  The composition is static, would have been better with left end cropped.  Watch is just a little too far away and too unsharp.  I want not only to be able to read the brand name, but the little lables in the blue dials.    Not finding a compelling reason for the watch to be set on its side.  If it is to be horizontal, it would seem a little neater if it were exactly horizontal.  Hope some of these suggestions are helpful.', '2005-04-27 10:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331865, 170276, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice clean crisp image.  Well done with the lighting and DOF.  The starbursts are a nice touch, but you went overboard...should have just kept them to the watch, distracting on the chain and seem unrealistic there.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice clean crisp image.  Well done with the lighting and DOF.  The starbursts are a nice touch, but you went overboard...should have just kept them to the watch, distracting on the chain and seem unrealistic there.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331879, 170263, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and the idea, but there seems to be too much saturation that takes away from the natural colors. Nice font.</td>', 'I like the comp and the idea, but there seems to be too much saturation that takes away from the natural colors. Nice font.', '2005-04-27 10:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331889, 169286, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed the photo with the white border leaving room for text outside the box.  This looks good.  I have no idea what type of jewelry this is.  They actually look like letter openers, and the way they are positioned almost look like scissors (ahhhh, not more scissors!!!).  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the way you framed the photo with the white border leaving room for text outside the box.  This looks good.  I have no idea what type of jewelry this is.  They actually look like letter openers, and the way they are positioned almost look like scissors (ahhhh, not more scissors!!!).  ;^)  Good luck.', '2005-04-27 10:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331891, 170174, 33672, '<td valign="top">great Idea and comp! however, I''d believe that this ad is for flowers and not jewelry.</td>', 'great Idea and comp! however, I''d believe that this ad is for flowers and not jewelry.', '2005-04-27 10:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331900, 169950, 6870, '<td valign="top">Can''t see much wrong with this one, but I can see lots RIGHT. Composition is good, lighting gives good shape to the rings, and I also like the small depth of field. 9</td>', 'Can''t see much wrong with this one, but I can see lots RIGHT. Composition is good, lighting gives good shape to the rings, and I also like the small depth of field. 9', '2005-04-27 10:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331907, 169873, 6870, '<td valign="top">Stunning light and facetry from the gem. I''d like to see the ring, too.</td>', 'Stunning light and facetry from the gem. I''d like to see the ring, too.', '2005-04-27 10:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331914, 170343, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a fun interpretation of this challenge. I like the expressions on the girls, and their poses. I find myself wishing there were more contrast: more white whites and more black darks.</td>', 'This is a fun interpretation of this challenge. I like the expressions on the girls, and their poses. I find myself wishing there were more contrast: more white whites and more black darks.', '2005-04-27 10:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331926, 170339, 6870, '<td valign="top">Points for originality here! Fun image, nicely lit. 8</td>', 'Points for originality here! Fun image, nicely lit. 8', '2005-04-27 10:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332071, 169148, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of verbiage.  Nice background choice for this piece of jewelry.  Good composition with positioning of the necklace and text.  Not sure about the choice of text for the jewelers name...hard to read.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting choice of verbiage.  Nice background choice for this piece of jewelry.  Good composition with positioning of the necklace and text.  Not sure about the choice of text for the jewelers name...hard to read.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 10:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332121, 169252, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool props for your composition, it balances nicely.  This would have really popped with a navy or black background behind the paper IMO.  Good lighting on the ring (very nice diamond by the way...).    Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool props for your composition, it balances nicely.  This would have really popped with a navy or black background behind the paper IMO.  Good lighting on the ring (very nice diamond by the way...).    Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332166, 170339, 30049, '<td valign="top">I must be missing something.  The scary looking hand shadow, the red color cast...?  Interesting photo.  The lighting, composition, and details are very good.  I think the red border distracts, but then you''re probably trying to tie it in with the overall red tone.  Good luck, this should make top 20.</td>', 'I must be missing something.  The scary looking hand shadow, the red color cast...?  Interesting photo.  The lighting, composition, and details are very good.  I think the red border distracts, but then you''re probably trying to tie it in with the overall red tone.  Good luck, this should make top 20.', '2005-04-27 11:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332188, 170166, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dark face makes attn go to watch and OUTBACK word mark. So nice work! Advertising done effectively. 10</td>', 'Dark face makes attn go to watch and OUTBACK word mark. So nice work! Advertising done effectively. 10', '2005-04-27 11:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332211, 170332, 34402, '<td valign="top">Shadows look a bit harsh.</td>', 'Shadows look a bit harsh.', '2005-04-27 11:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332272, 169821, 34402, '<td valign="top">Wow, by far the best I have seen yet!</td>', 'Wow, by far the best I have seen yet!', '2005-04-27 11:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332343, 170327, 34402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the exception of the bottom . . . there seems to be too much empty space.</td>', 'I like the composition with the exception of the bottom . . . there seems to be too much empty space.', '2005-04-27 11:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332348, 169774, 34402, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!</td>', 'Excellent composition!', '2005-04-27 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332350, 169327, 34402, '<td valign="top">Love the sparkle!</td>', 'Love the sparkle!', '2005-04-27 11:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332353, 168939, 34402, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!</td>', 'Very nice composition!', '2005-04-27 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332358, 170156, 34402, '<td valign="top">For some reason her chest looks ''mottled'' which in this case distracts away from the necklace.</td>', 'For some reason her chest looks ''mottled'' which in this case distracts away from the necklace.', '2005-04-27 11:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332365, 169227, 34402, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the soft look of the roses in the background.</td>', 'Very nice! Love the soft look of the roses in the background.', '2005-04-27 11:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332397, 170357, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, to the point.  I like it.  Good choice of using black with the silver.  Lighting is fine in my opinion, although I''ll bet you will see a couple of comments that it''s hot in a couple of spots.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, to the point.  I like it.  Good choice of using black with the silver.  Lighting is fine in my opinion, although I''ll bet you will see a couple of comments that it''s hot in a couple of spots.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 11:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332411, 169491, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of background material.  Interesting jewelry piece.  Go Trekkies!  ;^)  No, I''m not one, but I used to watch the show.  I think you''ve balanced this photo and text very well.  The lighting and focus is fine too.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice choice of background material.  Interesting jewelry piece.  Go Trekkies!  ;^)  No, I''m not one, but I used to watch the show.  I think you''ve balanced this photo and text very well.  The lighting and focus is fine too.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 11:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332422, 168945, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a snake at the top end!  ;^)  I like the color combinations you used for this.  The text may be just a bit too subdued, but I like the choice of font style, size and color.  Only wish I could see just a little more of the main piece of jewelry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a snake at the top end!  ;^)  I like the color combinations you used for this.  The text may be just a bit too subdued, but I like the choice of font style, size and color.  Only wish I could see just a little more of the main piece of jewelry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 11:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332635, 169504, 37031, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail and sharpness.</td>', 'I really like the detail and sharpness.', '2005-04-27 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332645, 168960, 17291, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites for this challenge. Great job! I gave it a 10.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites for this challenge. Great job! I gave it a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332652, 169694, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love the composition and lighting (something I am working on). I gave this photo a 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I love the composition and lighting (something I am working on). I gave this photo a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332671, 168813, 17291, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. The diamonds look a little washed out.</td>', 'I like this photo. The diamonds look a little washed out.', '2005-04-27 12:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332675, 168965, 17291, '<td valign="top">I like the background selected for this photo. The jewelry looks very sharp. I gave this photo a 10.</td>', 'I like the background selected for this photo. The jewelry looks very sharp. I gave this photo a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332681, 169252, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great layout and them. I gave this photo a 10.</td>', 'Great layout and them. I gave this photo a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332682, 169877, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ho-hum.  Technically it''s fine, just lacking something in the creativity department.  I think it''s the text outside the image in a plain white border that pulls the attention away from what is otherwise a nice image.  It''s like a MS Word document with a table and an image inserted with text put under it.  Sorry if this comes across the wrong way...really.  I like the image - just the total package isn''t jumping out at me.</td>', 'Ho-hum.  Technically it''s fine, just lacking something in the creativity department.  I think it''s the text outside the image in a plain white border that pulls the attention away from what is otherwise a nice image.  It''s like a MS Word document with a table and an image inserted with text put under it.  Sorry if this comes across the wrong way...really.  I like the image - just the total package isn''t jumping out at me.', '2005-04-27 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332688, 169719, 37031, '<td valign="top">good use of shadow</td>', 'good use of shadow', '2005-04-27 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332691, 170080, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That watch face just jumps right out at you.  Great use of the rocks and water...is this Lara?  Lighting is great, focus is out of this world.  Only negative I have, and it''s hard to avoid, is I''m seeing some jaggies in the watch numbers, date border and watch hands.  Nitpicky, I know.  Hope you ribbon with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow!  That watch face just jumps right out at you.  Great use of the rocks and water...is this Lara?  Lighting is great, focus is out of this world.  Only negative I have, and it''s hard to avoid, is I''m seeing some jaggies in the watch numbers, date border and watch hands.  Nitpicky, I know.  Hope you ribbon with this.  Good luck.', '2005-04-27 12:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332692, 169965, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like this.  Fun colors, crisp image - nice choice of text.  Composition works out well.  Should place pretty high with this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like this.  Fun colors, crisp image - nice choice of text.  Composition works out well.  Should place pretty high with this one.  Good luck.', '2005-04-27 12:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332693, 170046, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I gave this photo a 10.</td>', 'Great composition. I gave this photo a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332701, 168939, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great composition, color and lighting. I gave this photo a 10.</td>', 'Great composition, color and lighting. I gave this photo a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332704, 170166, 17291, '<td valign="top">This photo is good enough for a magazine. I love the layout. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'This photo is good enough for a magazine. I love the layout. I gave it a 10.', '2005-04-27 12:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332711, 170316, 17291, '<td valign="top">Then pendant seems a little soft. I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Then pendant seems a little soft. I gave it a 9.', '2005-04-27 12:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332716, 169472, 17291, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but the focus doesn''t seem to be on the jewelry.</td>', 'I like the photo but the focus doesn''t seem to be on the jewelry.', '2005-04-27 12:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332734, 170359, 17291, '<td valign="top">The Red line is a little distracting and the bracelet seems to be a little on the soft side.</td>', 'The Red line is a little distracting and the bracelet seems to be a little on the soft side.', '2005-04-27 12:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332737, 169954, 17291, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I know that the lighting and focus couldn''t have been an easy task. You pulled it off quite nicely.</td>', 'I like this photo. I know that the lighting and focus couldn''t have been an easy task. You pulled it off quite nicely.', '2005-04-27 12:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332763, 170174, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Lighting seems a little hot on the ring and flower stem.  Multiple light sources may help with this.  I like the style of text you used.  Overall, nice job.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Lighting seems a little hot on the ring and flower stem.  Multiple light sources may help with this.  I like the style of text you used.  Overall, nice job.', '2005-04-27 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1332775, 170318, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve lit this.  Very creative use of lighting.  The text in the bottom left could be cleaner.  Overall, nice job.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve lit this.  Very creative use of lighting.  The text in the bottom left could be cleaner.  Overall, nice job.  Good luck.', '2005-04-27 12:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332792, 170366, 30049, '<td valign="top">The pieces of jewelry you selected have nice character to them.  Well lit and presented in a professional manner.  The text color choice I don''t agree with and it looks funny (to me) centered as it is.  Maybe if it had been on one line instead of two?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The pieces of jewelry you selected have nice character to them.  Well lit and presented in a professional manner.  The text color choice I don''t agree with and it looks funny (to me) centered as it is.  Maybe if it had been on one line instead of two?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 12:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332812, 170194, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Where''s the eggs?  ;^)  The lighting seems a bit hot on the main jewelry piece.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Where''s the eggs?  ;^)  The lighting seems a bit hot on the main jewelry piece.', '2005-04-27 12:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332826, 170345, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadows, that''s creative.  The ring itself in the image is a bit blurry and should be more emphasized based on the theme of the challenge.  Of course, that''s JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice use of shadows, that''s creative.  The ring itself in the image is a bit blurry and should be more emphasized based on the theme of the challenge.  Of course, that''s JMO.  Good luck.', '2005-04-27 12:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332836, 170074, 4564, '<td valign="top">I know it'' snot easy to shoot a candel and I think you did it very well!  Personaly, I wish the fire was more elongated vertically. I think it would make the candle more powerful.  Nice use of the black and the reflection.  The text is big and annoying to me, but I''m difficult when it comes to the use of fonts.  I wish we were not limited to 640 pixels because I''d love to see the detail on the jewel. ;-)  Nice shot. Well done.</td>', 'I know it'' snot easy to shoot a candel and I think you did it very well!  Personaly, I wish the fire was more elongated vertically. I think it would make the candle more powerful.  Nice use of the black and the reflection.  The text is big and annoying to me, but I''m difficult when it comes to the use of fonts.  I wish we were not limited to 640 pixels because I''d love to see the detail on the jewel. ;-)  Nice shot. Well done.', '2005-04-27 12:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332843, 169862, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of white on white.  Head may be a bit too tilted (gives a weird angle to the earring).  Overall well executed.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice use of white on white.  Head may be a bit too tilted (gives a weird angle to the earring).  Overall well executed.  Nice shot.', '2005-04-27 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332857, 169148, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Excellent colors and textures.  i wish the DOF was not so narrow, but that''s just my personal taste.  nice selection of jewel. font seems to work here, which cannot be said about most of the entries inthis challenge.  On of my top 10. Cheers!</td>', 'Very nice composition. Excellent colors and textures.  i wish the DOF was not so narrow, but that''s just my personal taste.  nice selection of jewel. font seems to work here, which cannot be said about most of the entries inthis challenge.  On of my top 10. Cheers!', '2005-04-27 12:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332871, 169227, 4564, '<td valign="top">Jewel is very sharp and crisp.   nice details and reflections.  I think the DOF could have been more narrow to make the jewel stand out more.  Nice use of the flowers to complement the color of the jewel.  I am not sure about the centered composition which seems a bit off to me.  Good job!</td>', 'Jewel is very sharp and crisp.   nice details and reflections.  I think the DOF could have been more narrow to make the jewel stand out more.  Nice use of the flowers to complement the color of the jewel.  I am not sure about the centered composition which seems a bit off to me.  Good job!', '2005-04-27 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332879, 169919, 4564, '<td valign="top">Well presented. Simple, efficient.  Jewel works well with the flower.  Composition is well executed. A bit uninspiring to me, but still a very good job.</td>', 'Well presented. Simple, efficient.  Jewel works well with the flower.  Composition is well executed. A bit uninspiring to me, but still a very good job.', '2005-04-27 12:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332893, 170153, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat idea wrapping the text arond the object.  The jewelry piece itself is a bit bright and the detail of the stones is lost.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Neat idea wrapping the text arond the object.  The jewelry piece itself is a bit bright and the detail of the stones is lost.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 12:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
