(1332915, 169970, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a greeting card.  That''s a compliment.  Very nice composition.  Nice look at the photographers reflection in the ring too!  ;^)  So close...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a greeting card.  That''s a compliment.  Very nice composition.  Nice look at the photographers reflection in the ring too!  ;^)  So close...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
