(1333242, 169254, 20462, '<td valign="top">I needed to read the letters and the caption more than once, and then I turned my attention to the jewelry.  I feel the jewelry must still be front and center.  Originality is very high here.</td>', 'I needed to read the letters and the caption more than once, and then I turned my attention to the jewelry.  I feel the jewelry must still be front and center.  Originality is very high here.', '2005-04-27 14:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
