(1335324, 170366, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting.  I almost think I would have liked this even more without the text.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting.  I almost think I would have liked this even more without the text.', '2005-04-27 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
