(1335922, 168816, 1031, '<td valign="top">Having the strong lighting is good, but the harsh shadow is not so good. Either a reflector to shine some light behind the bead to reduce the shadow, or selectively lightening the shadow would help.</td>', 'Having the strong lighting is good, but the harsh shadow is not so good. Either a reflector to shine some light behind the bead to reduce the shadow, or selectively lightening the shadow would help.', '2005-04-28 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
