(1336056, 169970, 1031, '<td valign="top">You have a pretty significant reflection in the ring, something usually avoided in ads. I like the colors and layout/concept.</td>', 'You have a pretty significant reflection in the ring, something usually avoided in ads. I like the colors and layout/concept.', '2005-04-28 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336070, 169563, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the background, although it puts some funny stripes on the ring.</td>', 'Nice work with the background, although it puts some funny stripes on the ring.', '2005-04-28 00:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336134, 170332, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the images.  Focus is nice and composition is good.  A couple of suggestions.  Shadows are somewhat distracting, would be better without them.  Also, and I think this is the biggest one, The second hands really should be synchronized.  It makes me think that one of the watches is running fast or slow.  Not something you would want to advertise.</td>', 'I like the images.  Focus is nice and composition is good.  A couple of suggestions.  Shadows are somewhat distracting, would be better without them.  Also, and I think this is the biggest one, The second hands really should be synchronized.  It makes me think that one of the watches is running fast or slow.  Not something you would want to advertise.', '2005-04-28 01:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336144, 169630, 34396, '<td valign="top">Shot of jewelry is good.  Bacground has some odd shadows.  I like the lighting and the reflective surface.</td>', 'Shot of jewelry is good.  Bacground has some odd shadows.  I like the lighting and the reflective surface.', '2005-04-28 01:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
