(1336217, 170326, 20679, '<td valign="top">such a hard challenge in many ways. Sadly this is much too flatly lit to be considered for print and the sharpness is lacking. Lighting from the side or a little behind (even with a battery operated flashlight) would help add some texture</td>', 'such a hard challenge in many ways. Sadly this is much too flatly lit to be considered for print and the sharpness is lacking. Lighting from the side or a little behind (even with a battery operated flashlight) would help add some texture', '2005-04-28 01:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336220, 170320, 20679, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that the background and text detract from the ring in this for my taste at least</td>', 'I''m afraid that the background and text detract from the ring in this for my taste at least', '2005-04-28 01:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336227, 169630, 22734, '<td valign="top">Impressive and very well lit to bring out the detail and mystique. Bumping up.</td>', 'Impressive and very well lit to bring out the detail and mystique. Bumping up.', '2005-04-28 01:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336272, 169467, 18197, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. From my perspective, this is best of show. It''s not perfect (I''m bothered a bit by the focus and losing detail in the front shell) but it is so well composed, colored, leveled and so on that it overcomes the few minor glitches. Congratulations, and well done!</td>', 'Stunning photo. From my perspective, this is best of show. It''s not perfect (I''m bothered a bit by the focus and losing detail in the front shell) but it is so well composed, colored, leveled and so on that it overcomes the few minor glitches. Congratulations, and well done!', '2005-04-28 02:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336277, 170046, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl. Nice jewelry. Great technically. I can really imagine this in a high end magazine. It would fit perfectly in Conde Nast Traveler, for example. Congratualations on a superb image!</td>', 'Pretty girl. Nice jewelry. Great technically. I can really imagine this in a high end magazine. It would fit perfectly in Conde Nast Traveler, for example. Congratualations on a superb image!', '2005-04-28 02:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336282, 170166, 18197, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo. Well composed, captured and executed. Unique in a very positive way. Understated focus on the watch is dynamite. Text on wrist and below watch fits perfectly. If this doesn''t ribbon, I''ll be well and truly disappointed in DPC voters.</td>', 'Outstanding photo. Well composed, captured and executed. Unique in a very positive way. Understated focus on the watch is dynamite. Text on wrist and below watch fits perfectly. If this doesn''t ribbon, I''ll be well and truly disappointed in DPC voters.', '2005-04-28 02:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336294, 168960, 36472, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture and the idea. The combination of all the elements make for a brilliant idea. Very well executed.</td>', 'I really like this picture and the idea. The combination of all the elements make for a brilliant idea. Very well executed.', '2005-04-28 02:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336306, 170349, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great lighting but the composition is a little flat. Maybe if the diamond ring was propped up on the band??? I dunno.</td>', 'Great lighting but the composition is a little flat. Maybe if the diamond ring was propped up on the band??? I dunno.', '2005-04-28 02:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336309, 169903, 32767, '<td valign="top">I looks as if your white balance is off. Nice composition.</td>', 'I looks as if your white balance is off. Nice composition.', '2005-04-28 02:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336318, 170357, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Perfect composition and lighting. The text works well in it''s space.</td>', 'Very nice image. Perfect composition and lighting. The text works well in it''s space.', '2005-04-28 02:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336330, 168595, 32767, '<td valign="top">The sea space creature flower seems a bit busy for the piece.</td>', 'The sea space creature flower seems a bit busy for the piece.', '2005-04-28 02:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336348, 169869, 19708, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh here. Reflections &amp; soft lighting sources are so critical in something like this and tough to do as well. Not sure what the black specs are...</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh here. Reflections & soft lighting sources are so critical in something like this and tough to do as well. Not sure what the black specs are...', '2005-04-28 02:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336419, 169569, 36201, '<td valign="top">Very elegant, beautiful job.  I love this photo.</td>', 'Very elegant, beautiful job.  I love this photo.', '2005-04-28 03:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336422, 169295, 36201, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Seriously, nice photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Ouch!  Seriously, nice photo.  Well done!', '2005-04-28 03:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336746, 170327, 34247, '<td valign="top">Great ad. nice text, layout, etc. One small thing would be the reflection of the rings on the base material? A bit distracting I think. 7</td>', 'Great ad. nice text, layout, etc. One small thing would be the reflection of the rings on the base material? A bit distracting I think. 7', '2005-04-28 07:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336789, 170158, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have composed the image with a diagonal split..it adds to the overall impact as well as accomodating the text very neatly.<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the way you have composed the image with a diagonal split..it adds to the overall impact as well as accomodating the text very neatly.Nicely done.', '2005-04-28 08:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336795, 169349, 18450, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, focus is good but something about the lighting is not quite right.....bit flat  I think.</td>', 'Nice shot, focus is good but something about the lighting is not quite right.....bit flat  I think.', '2005-04-28 08:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336801, 168965, 18450, '<td valign="top">Interesting creative concept</td>', 'Interesting creative concept', '2005-04-28 08:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336802, 170183, 14603, '<td valign="top">Subject, lighting and composition are all in keeping with what I`d expect to see in a magazine advertisement.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Subject, lighting and composition are all in keeping with what I`d expect to see in a magazine advertisement.Nice work', '2005-04-28 08:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336807, 168769, 18450, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot. Lighting seems a little flat, the gems don''t sparkle. Very good concept.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot. Lighting seems a little flat, the gems don''t sparkle. Very good concept.', '2005-04-28 08:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336811, 170149, 18450, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on the gems and I really like the way the colour of the stone is reflected in the crystal.</td>', 'Very nice lighting on the gems and I really like the way the colour of the stone is reflected in the crystal.', '2005-04-28 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336818, 168507, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very effective approach to the subject...the shallow DOF giving the stone more prominance.<br/>The text will be seen as a welcome addition by some and a hindrance by others depending on taste...but it works for me.</td>', 'Very effective approach to the subject...the shallow DOF giving the stone more prominance.The text will be seen as a welcome addition by some and a hindrance by others depending on taste...but it works for me.', '2005-04-28 08:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336819, 170300, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely stone colours, but to me the lighting seems a little harsh, the dof slightly too shallow to be able to truely appreciate  the beauty of the bracelet</td>', 'Lovely stone colours, but to me the lighting seems a little harsh, the dof slightly too shallow to be able to truely appreciate  the beauty of the bracelet', '2005-04-28 08:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336836, 170355, 13879, '<td valign="top">The overall colour is really appealing, and the position of the ear-rings is good...which makes even more of a shame that not enough is in focus to really make out the item.</td>', 'The overall colour is really appealing, and the position of the ear-rings is good...which makes even more of a shame that not enough is in focus to really make out the item.', '2005-04-28 08:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336839, 170332, 13879, '<td valign="top">I CAN SEE YOU!!! shame about the reflections, other than that nicely lit &amp; a sharp image.</td>', 'I CAN SEE YOU!!! shame about the reflections, other than that nicely lit & a sharp image.', '2005-04-28 08:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336846, 170174, 13879, '<td valign="top">nice text &amp; composition is appealing. The lighing (and resulting shadows) are a bit too harsh for my liking, but it certainly makes the ring sparkle!</td>', 'nice text & composition is appealing. The lighing (and resulting shadows) are a bit too harsh for my liking, but it certainly makes the ring sparkle!', '2005-04-28 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336849, 170320, 18450, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but to me the busyness of the b/g takes the focus off the jewellery</td>', 'I like the concept, but to me the busyness of the b/g takes the focus off the jewellery', '2005-04-28 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336859, 169539, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, the flower is beautiful. I feel that, though the focus is perfect,  the flower dominates the image, the jewellery is 2ndary.</td>', 'Lovely idea, the flower is beautiful. I feel that, though the focus is perfect,  the flower dominates the image, the jewellery is 2ndary.', '2005-04-28 08:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336861, 170148, 18450, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like the simplicity of the idea.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like the simplicity of the idea.', '2005-04-28 08:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336863, 170234, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!!</td>', 'Lovely shot!!', '2005-04-28 09:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336869, 169954, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great colours, I love the richness of the red combined with the gold. Focus on the jewellery is, to me, a little soft.</td>', 'Great colours, I love the richness of the red combined with the gold. Focus on the jewellery is, to me, a little soft.', '2005-04-28 09:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336870, 169762, 18450, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, perhaps a little too central and lacking in definition. I really like the colours of the clock.</td>', 'Nice idea, perhaps a little too central and lacking in definition. I really like the colours of the clock.', '2005-04-28 09:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336873, 169719, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great colours and focus on the gems. I do like the composition of this image</td>', 'Great colours and focus on the gems. I do like the composition of this image', '2005-04-28 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336879, 170362, 18450, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and colours/focus on the gold. With the pearl in slightly sharper focus to me this would have been a winner.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and colours/focus on the gold. With the pearl in slightly sharper focus to me this would have been a winner.', '2005-04-28 09:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336884, 169970, 18450, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!!!! Concept, focus, the lace and the writing are all very professional.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!!!! Concept, focus, the lace and the writing are all very professional.', '2005-04-28 09:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336889, 170345, 13879, '<td valign="top">Can easily imagine it in a glossy magazine! I''d like the shadow to be a bit shaper. But i can only imagine how difficult this was to setup &amp; take! great shot</td>', 'Can easily imagine it in a glossy magazine! I''d like the shadow to be a bit shaper. But i can only imagine how difficult this was to setup & take! great shot', '2005-04-28 09:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336890, 170361, 14603, '<td valign="top">Could definitely see this in a magazine or jeweller`s window.<br/>The lighting and colour tone is perfect for contrasting with the gold.<br/>The very professional look this image has should guarantee a good placing....best of luck.</td>', 'Could definitely see this in a magazine or jeweller`s window.The lighting and colour tone is perfect for contrasting with the gold.The very professional look this image has should guarantee a good placing....best of luck.', '2005-04-28 09:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336900, 169903, 18450, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. To me the lighting seems a little yellow and I''ve love to have seen a sharper focus on the watch at the back. Really do like the way you have them displayed.</td>', 'Nice composition. To me the lighting seems a little yellow and I''ve love to have seen a sharper focus on the watch at the back. Really do like the way you have them displayed.', '2005-04-28 09:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336906, 169950, 14603, '<td valign="top">Clean, sharp, well composed and lit.<br/>All the attributes for a good advertisement.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Clean, sharp, well composed and lit.All the attributes for a good advertisement.Nice work', '2005-04-28 09:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336910, 170325, 32982, '<td valign="top">If only i coud vote This was my winner <br/>a 10 should be it</td>', 'If only i coud vote This was my winner a 10 should be it', '2005-04-28 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336911, 169774, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!! The lines, layout, design here are excellent!! Imaginative and creative and very well done</td>', 'Great shot!!! The lines, layout, design here are excellent!! Imaginative and creative and very well done', '2005-04-28 09:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336914, 169814, 13879, '<td valign="top">A good add! I find the texture of the cloth a little distracting, but not too much. I think the lighting is just right, the highlights on the beads are quite bright but by no means over the top.  Hope you do well.</td>', 'A good add! I find the texture of the cloth a little distracting, but not too much. I think the lighting is just right, the highlights on the beads are quite bright but by no means over the top.  Hope you do well.', '2005-04-28 09:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336924, 170174, 32982, '<td valign="top">wow good colors<br/>my fav :-) <br/>10 from me if i could vote</td>', 'wow good colorsmy fav :-) 10 from me if i could vote', '2005-04-28 09:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336925, 170183, 13879, '<td valign="top">Compostion is good, as is the lighting. I like the font os the text... even if i havent a clue what it says! unless the text relates to the second-hand moving, I would have preferred it to be stationary.  Good add</td>', 'Compostion is good, as is the lighting. I like the font os the text... even if i havent a clue what it says! unless the text relates to the second-hand moving, I would have preferred it to be stationary.  Good add', '2005-04-28 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336928, 169302, 18450, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but would have loved to have seen the mitt the other way up ''catching'' the diamond. Also feel that because of the size differences the ring tends to get a little lost in the glove.......not sure how this could be overcome though.</td>', 'Love the idea, but would have loved to have seen the mitt the other way up ''catching'' the diamond. Also feel that because of the size differences the ring tends to get a little lost in the glove.......not sure how this could be overcome though.', '2005-04-28 09:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336930, 168960, 30605, '<td valign="top">That''s have to be the best diamond shot in this challenge. I like the lighting, the fact that I can actually see the diamond facets and not just a big flash. Good composition also and I like the combination you made here. However, the choice of font could have been better. 9</td>', 'That''s have to be the best diamond shot in this challenge. I like the lighting, the fact that I can actually see the diamond facets and not just a big flash. Good composition also and I like the combination you made here. However, the choice of font could have been better. 9', '2005-04-28 09:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336938, 170080, 14603, '<td valign="top">Personally,I think you have produced the perfect backdrop for the watch.<br/>The colour tones and textures of the background are interesting in themselves but do not overpower the subject.<br/>Would have worked just as well for me without text.<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'Personally,I think you have produced the perfect backdrop for the watch.The colour tones and textures of the background are interesting in themselves but do not overpower the subject.Would have worked just as well for me without text.Nicely done.', '2005-04-28 09:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336942, 170046, 30605, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, black background and simple text. Nice model. I also like the fact that your model only wears the jewelry, even though the jewelry are small, they attract a lot of attention.</td>', 'I like the lighting, black background and simple text. Nice model. I also like the fact that your model only wears the jewelry, even though the jewelry are small, they attract a lot of attention.', '2005-04-28 09:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336945, 169734, 13879, '<td valign="top">A very bold add. I''m not too keen on the choice of background colour (&amp; text colour), but I understand why you used it. I''d like the watch to stand out a bit more.  Technically I think the photo is excellent.</td>', 'A very bold add. I''m not too keen on the choice of background colour (& text colour), but I understand why you used it. I''d like the watch to stand out a bit more.  Technically I think the photo is excellent.', '2005-04-28 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336946, 169965, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. Like the non intrusive text/font you choose.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. Like the non intrusive text/font you choose.', '2005-04-28 09:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336948, 169252, 14603, '<td valign="top">Simple lines and good composition make this work well as an advertisement.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Simple lines and good composition make this work well as an advertisement.Good luck.', '2005-04-28 09:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336960, 170080, 30605, '<td valign="top">Your composition and background are excellent. Overall look is very professional. However, this photograph could never pass as a watche ad because the position of the hour hand blocks the watche maker name. Having set a ten to two time position, this shot would have been a 9 or 10 from me. Because of this, I can''t give ore than 7.</td>', 'Your composition and background are excellent. Overall look is very professional. However, this photograph could never pass as a watche ad because the position of the hour hand blocks the watche maker name. Having set a ten to two time position, this shot would have been a 9 or 10 from me. Because of this, I can''t give ore than 7.', '2005-04-28 09:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336967, 170300, 30605, '<td valign="top">A bit too much reflection on the bracelet and should have use a deeper DOF to show more details of the jewelry. I like the composition. Nice non intrusive text, I like that. 7</td>', 'A bit too much reflection on the bracelet and should have use a deeper DOF to show more details of the jewelry. I like the composition. Nice non intrusive text, I like that. 7', '2005-04-28 09:35:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1336976, 169569, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition, not too distracting from jewelry. Focus seems a bit soft on the pearl at the very front and mostly crisp on the rose; should have been the othe way around.</td>', 'Good composition, not too distracting from jewelry. Focus seems a bit soft on the pearl at the very front and mostly crisp on the rose; should have been the othe way around.', '2005-04-28 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336984, 170166, 30605, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and ligthing. Shadows on model and good lighting of the watch makes this picture work.</td>', 'Excellent composition and ligthing. Shadows on model and good lighting of the watch makes this picture work.', '2005-04-28 09:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336990, 170079, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good lighting control here, no blown highligths. Likes the contrast of the jewel on the dark background.</td>', 'Good lighting control here, no blown highligths. Likes the contrast of the jewel on the dark background.', '2005-04-28 09:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336998, 169613, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition/angle. Return for more comments: I like the shadow/lighting approach. A little, little bit more bright to reveal more details would have been nice. Also, you should have use a deeper DOF to have the 6 o''clock portion of the watch in focus a bit more. Bumping up.</td>', 'Good composition/angle. Return for more comments: I like the shadow/lighting approach. A little, little bit more bright to reveal more details would have been nice. Also, you should have use a deeper DOF to have the 6 o''clock portion of the watch in focus a bit more. Bumping up.', '2005-04-28 09:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337004, 170327, 30605, '<td valign="top">A bit too much light reflecting in the diamonds I think. Details are lost in the diamonds; can''t see the diamond faces</td>', 'A bit too much light reflecting in the diamonds I think. Details are lost in the diamonds; can''t see the diamond faces', '2005-04-28 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337010, 169861, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice time piece. Good lighting. Love the background color in contrast with the watch. Good use of DOF, watch is sharp. Composition a bit static however. Would have been good to see the watch bands since bands are really an integral part of watches of the caliber. I don''t recall ever seeing a watch ad where the bands are not visible.</td>', 'Nice time piece. Good lighting. Love the background color in contrast with the watch. Good use of DOF, watch is sharp. Composition a bit static however. Would have been good to see the watch bands since bands are really an integral part of watches of the caliber. I don''t recall ever seeing a watch ad where the bands are not visible.', '2005-04-28 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337015, 170361, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very good use of post precessing to make the jewelry stand out of the model. Text is not too intrusive also, very good. My only quirk is personal, but your model seems to be in pain, likes she don''t enjoy wearing the jewels (an impression not good in a jewel ad). A very gentle smile would have make this picture top rated. 6</td>', 'Very good use of post precessing to make the jewelry stand out of the model. Text is not too intrusive also, very good. My only quirk is personal, but your model seems to be in pain, likes she don''t enjoy wearing the jewels (an impression not good in a jewel ad). A very gentle smile would have make this picture top rated. 6', '2005-04-28 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337035, 168816, 30605, '<td valign="top">Composition and placement are uninteresting. Hard shadow not esthetic at all.</td>', 'Composition and placement are uninteresting. Hard shadow not esthetic at all.', '2005-04-28 10:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337036, 169741, 30605, '<td valign="top">I can''t picture this as a jewelry ad.</td>', 'I can''t picture this as a jewelry ad.', '2005-04-28 10:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337039, 170240, 30605, '<td valign="top">Lightinh not very good I think. Looks like a direct flash was use. Too litle of the watch is in "good" ligth.</td>', 'Lightinh not very good I think. Looks like a direct flash was use. Too litle of the watch is in "good" ligth.', '2005-04-28 10:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337063, 169396, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good lighting on the diamonds. Ring not enough lit I think. One side of the ring is in almost total darkness.  Reflection too dim; it''s distracting instead of usefull. A more intense reflection or none at all would have been better.</td>', 'Good lighting on the diamonds. Ring not enough lit I think. One side of the ring is in almost total darkness.  Reflection too dim; it''s distracting instead of usefull. A more intense reflection or none at all would have been better.', '2005-04-28 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337081, 170265, 30605, '<td valign="top">Water droplet makes it too "cliche" and it compete with the sparkles of the stones. Color of the flower is reflecting too much in the neckless. Neckless looks orange instead of white gold.</td>', 'Water droplet makes it too "cliche" and it compete with the sparkles of the stones. Color of the flower is reflecting too much in the neckless. Neckless looks orange instead of white gold.', '2005-04-28 10:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337093, 168595, 30605, '<td valign="top">The use of flower here is too powerfull for the jewel. I can''t really tell what kind of jewel I am loking at. Composition very center and static. However, lighting and focus are good.</td>', 'The use of flower here is too powerfull for the jewel. I can''t really tell what kind of jewel I am loking at. Composition very center and static. However, lighting and focus are good.', '2005-04-28 10:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337155, 170081, 18485, '<td valign="top">too much crop</td>', 'too much crop', '2005-04-28 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337159, 169295, 18485, '<td valign="top">un funny</td>', 'un funny', '2005-04-28 10:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337163, 168960, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice job and very cute too</td>', 'nice job and very cute too', '2005-04-28 10:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337164, 170234, 18485, '<td valign="top">lovely display.  i''m not a fan of selective desat but you have pulled off something special here.  nice job</td>', 'lovely display.  i''m not a fan of selective desat but you have pulled off something special here.  nice job', '2005-04-28 10:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337167, 170094, 18485, '<td valign="top">perfect lighting.  well done.</td>', 'perfect lighting.  well done.', '2005-04-28 10:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337169, 170309, 18485, '<td valign="top">fun and yes, very colorful.  i''m not sure what you are advertizing but the photo is great.</td>', 'fun and yes, very colorful.  i''m not sure what you are advertizing but the photo is great.', '2005-04-28 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337181, 169396, 8970, '<td valign="top">The ring appears to be floating in space too much.  The reflection feels to take more away from the picture than it gives.</td>', 'The ring appears to be floating in space too much.  The reflection feels to take more away from the picture than it gives.', '2005-04-28 10:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337184, 170172, 8970, '<td valign="top">The women''s face is too clear and draws my eyes to hers and then away from the picture.  It had to keep staring back to ever focus on the earring which should have been the main focus.</td>', 'The women''s face is too clear and draws my eyes to hers and then away from the picture.  It had to keep staring back to ever focus on the earring which should have been the main focus.', '2005-04-28 10:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337192, 170325, 8970, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the flower here, but the bug jewelry in the middle is a bit out of focus.  The focal plain appears to be right in font of it instead of on it.</td>', 'I love the use of the flower here, but the bug jewelry in the middle is a bit out of focus.  The focal plain appears to be right in font of it instead of on it.', '2005-04-28 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
