(1337217, 169762, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, the image has a bit too much blue color cast in it for me.  The jewelry piece itself I think could be cleaner - some dust on the band and the face of the watch that would have improved the image if it wasn''t there.  Good luck.</td>', 'Neat idea, the image has a bit too much blue color cast in it for me.  The jewelry piece itself I think could be cleaner - some dust on the band and the face of the watch that would have improved the image if it wasn''t there.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337218, 170165, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail.  Interesting tie-in with the background.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice color and detail.  Interesting tie-in with the background.  Good job.', '2005-04-28 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337219, 169539, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image.  I think I would prefer to see more emphasis on the jewelry, but it''s ok.  Did you try a darker background like navy or black?  Make everything pop a bit more. Overall, good job.</td>', 'It''s a nice image.  I think I would prefer to see more emphasis on the jewelry, but it''s ok.  Did you try a darker background like navy or black?  Make everything pop a bit more. Overall, good job.', '2005-04-28 11:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337220, 169829, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not getting the B/W connection for a jewelry advertisement.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not getting the B/W connection for a jewelry advertisement.', '2005-04-28 11:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337221, 170332, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Need some work on lighting to eliminate the many reflections of the photographer.  Can see the head and shoulder in the top half of the image, the hands and camera directly under the watch face, and the head-shoulders-torso of the photog at the bottom.  A white reflector board in front of you (hole cutout for camera lens) would get rid of many of these distractions.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Need some work on lighting to eliminate the many reflections of the photographer.  Can see the head and shoulder in the top half of the image, the hands and camera directly under the watch face, and the head-shoulders-torso of the photog at the bottom.  A white reflector board in front of you (hole cutout for camera lens) would get rid of many of these distractions.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337222, 168769, 30049, '<td valign="top">Composed welll as a three piece arrangement.  Like the light reflecting off of a stone on the top right piece.  Background looks dirty...that''s a shame because otherwise this is a very nice job.  Good luck.</td>', 'Composed welll as a three piece arrangement.  Like the light reflecting off of a stone on the top right piece.  Background looks dirty...that''s a shame because otherwise this is a very nice job.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337223, 169873, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s pink.  ;^)  Very nice stone.  Presentation of the jewelry is a little bland.  JMO.  Good use of light and is focused very well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep, it''s pink.  ;^)  Very nice stone.  Presentation of the jewelry is a little bland.  JMO.  Good use of light and is focused very well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337224, 170359, 30049, '<td valign="top">The red line is very distracting. The background seems dusty also.  Interesting piece of jewelry, wish it had been presented a little differently.  There seems to be some fun color in the bracelet - with the right lighting and a little closer look this could have been a great image.  Good luck.</td>', 'The red line is very distracting. The background seems dusty also.  Interesting piece of jewelry, wish it had been presented a little differently.  There seems to be some fun color in the bracelet - with the right lighting and a little closer look this could have been a great image.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337225, 170172, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait type picture.  May  be a bit too subtle for a jewelry ad.  Also, why B/W?  That diamond would jump out more against skin color.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice portrait type picture.  May  be a bit too subtle for a jewelry ad.  Also, why B/W?  That diamond would jump out more against skin color.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337226, 170252, 30049, '<td valign="top">How can I say this without potentially hurting someones feelings...I love the color of the jewelry, in focus, great lighting...the model''s facial hair is distracting for this type of photo (Jewelry Advertisement).  Not sure what the solution is (if any is needed, after all this is just my opinion)...maybe apply a slight blur?  Overall, great shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'How can I say this without potentially hurting someones feelings...I love the color of the jewelry, in focus, great lighting...the model''s facial hair is distracting for this type of photo (Jewelry Advertisement).  Not sure what the solution is (if any is needed, after all this is just my opinion)...maybe apply a slight blur?  Overall, great shot.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337227, 169694, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very contemporary look.  Nice job.  Looks just like many ads one would find.  I don''t have anything to add.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'Very contemporary look.  Nice job.  Looks just like many ads one would find.  I don''t have anything to add.  Good luck on the voting.', '2005-04-28 11:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337228, 170241, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice shot under tough lighting conditions.  I wonder how this would have looked if you cropped say 100 - 125 pixels off the top? I like the sparkle in her eye.  Does she have something blue on her lips?  The beads on the end of the earring are a bit hot.  Overall, a very interesting approach to this challenge...I like it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot under tough lighting conditions.  I wonder how this would have looked if you cropped say 100 - 125 pixels off the top? I like the sparkle in her eye.  Does she have something blue on her lips?  The beads on the end of the earring are a bit hot.  Overall, a very interesting approach to this challenge...I like it.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337229, 168595, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now that''s very interesting, and kind of confusing.  The jewelry blends in a bit (reflections on the gold make the gold band disappear like camoflage) and for the life of me I can''t figure out what that white stuff in the middle is.  It''s fun and creative.  Good luck.</td>', 'Now that''s very interesting, and kind of confusing.  The jewelry blends in a bit (reflections on the gold make the gold band disappear like camoflage) and for the life of me I can''t figure out what that white stuff in the middle is.  It''s fun and creative.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337230, 170074, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very, very, nice.  Clean, crisp image.  Well lit and composed.  Good job.  I might have selected a cursive type font perhaps, but that of course is subjective.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very, very, nice.  Clean, crisp image.  Well lit and composed.  Good job.  I might have selected a cursive type font perhaps, but that of course is subjective.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337231, 170326, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece of jewelry.  I''m thinking this may have worked better on a black background to let the ring and diamonds pop out a bit?</td>', 'Interesting piece of jewelry.  I''m thinking this may have worked better on a black background to let the ring and diamonds pop out a bit?', '2005-04-28 11:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337233, 169741, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but how does this fit as a ''Jewelry Advertisement''?  Really, I''m not trying to be sarcastic, I just don''t see the connection.  Cool photo tho.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but how does this fit as a ''Jewelry Advertisement''?  Really, I''m not trying to be sarcastic, I just don''t see the connection.  Cool photo tho.', '2005-04-28 11:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337234, 170364, 30049, '<td valign="top">Aw Man!  Where''s the 300 ring?  ;^)  This is a fun photo.  Very shallow DOF to have the 299 in focus and not the 298?  Too bad you couldn''t get a different angle to eliminate the reflection (of the table edge?) visible on the bottom of both stones.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Aw Man!  Where''s the 300 ring?  ;^)  This is a fun photo.  Very shallow DOF to have the 299 in focus and not the 298?  Too bad you couldn''t get a different angle to eliminate the reflection (of the table edge?) visible on the bottom of both stones.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337235, 169840, 30049, '<td valign="top">That is the strangest necklace I''ve ever seen.  Interesting, and certainly different.  Where did you find such a piece of jewelry?  Lighting is close to being overexposed on the (curtains?) and has totally blown out on some of the jewel faces.  It''s a neat idea.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That is the strangest necklace I''ve ever seen.  Interesting, and certainly different.  Where did you find such a piece of jewelry?  Lighting is close to being overexposed on the (curtains?) and has totally blown out on some of the jewel faces.  It''s a neat idea.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337237, 169609, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey - They''re water droplets!  Cool idea.  ;^)  Nice job on the composition.  Looks like natural lighting was used - smart idea.  I like it.  You may take a hit for not attempting to incorporate some text, but hey - it should still do ok.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey - They''re water droplets!  Cool idea.  ;^)  Nice job on the composition.  Looks like natural lighting was used - smart idea.  I like it.  You may take a hit for not attempting to incorporate some text, but hey - it should still do ok.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337238, 170290, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...sure is a lot of red in there.  For me it''s not appealing (the color that is), but that''s JMO.  The ring itself came out very nice.  Good full color in the stones with nice lighting.  Perhaps just a bit too shallow on the DOF - the leading edge of the ring under the front three stones should be in focus.  Again, JMO.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm...sure is a lot of red in there.  For me it''s not appealing (the color that is), but that''s JMO.  The ring itself came out very nice.  Good full color in the stones with nice lighting.  Perhaps just a bit too shallow on the DOF - the leading edge of the ring under the front three stones should be in focus.  Again, JMO.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337240, 170065, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool props  - I like the rock.  Lighting is ok.  Focus on the watch seems off a bit.  What is that reflection on the left side of the watch?  Looks like sunglasses.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool props  - I like the rock.  Lighting is ok.  Focus on the watch seems off a bit.  What is that reflection on the left side of the watch?  Looks like sunglasses.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337241, 170340, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pretty decent image of the ring.  The face of the ring where the jewels (and emphasis is) is a bit dark.  Good DOF.  The text used looks like it was upsized and looks jagged around the edges.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty decent image of the ring.  The face of the ring where the jewels (and emphasis is) is a bit dark.  Good DOF.  The text used looks like it was upsized and looks jagged around the edges.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337242, 169433, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s ok.  Seems a bit washed out, perhaps because of the white background.  The diamond is well lit, but lacks sparkle.  How did this look with a black background?</td>', 'It''s ok.  Seems a bit washed out, perhaps because of the white background.  The diamond is well lit, but lacks sparkle.  How did this look with a black background?', '2005-04-28 11:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337243, 169630, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very interesting piece of jewelry.  The lighting and details are very good.  This would have worked perfect without the reflection and using some text in the image in the negative space that would have been available.  With the reflection the image seems off balance to me.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very interesting piece of jewelry.  The lighting and details are very good.  This would have worked perfect without the reflection and using some text in the image in the negative space that would have been available.  With the reflection the image seems off balance to me.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337247, 169227, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the roses.  The colors in this jump out nicely.  The only nitpicks I can come up with are the necklace is a little hot in the mid-section, and the green in the top left corner is a little distracting.  Overall, great job.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice use of the roses.  The colors in this jump out nicely.  The only nitpicks I can come up with are the necklace is a little hot in the mid-section, and the green in the top left corner is a little distracting.  Overall, great job.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337248, 170361, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job duplicating the feel of a Jewelry Advertisement.  Good pop with the jewelry pieces...they stand out nicely.  Nice use of lighting to get this effect.  I''m thinking this will make top 10.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice job duplicating the feel of a Jewelry Advertisement.  Good pop with the jewelry pieces...they stand out nicely.  Nice use of lighting to get this effect.  I''m thinking this will make top 10.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337249, 169769, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why not color?  The impact of diamonds is lost in the B/W.  Nice sparkle from the necklace but from the title I get the impression you wanted this image to be about the diamonds...</td>', 'Why not color?  The impact of diamonds is lost in the B/W.  Nice sparkle from the necklace but from the title I get the impression you wanted this image to be about the diamonds...', '2005-04-28 11:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337250, 170303, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color.  The focus is soft, but it appears to be intentional.  Gives the jewelry a happy worn look which is a different approach from the bright, sharp jewelry images in other entries.  There are some dark shadows, but it comes off just fine.  Good job overall.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice use of color.  The focus is soft, but it appears to be intentional.  Gives the jewelry a happy worn look which is a different approach from the bright, sharp jewelry images in other entries.  There are some dark shadows, but it comes off just fine.  Good job overall.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337251, 169869, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...nice idea, execution is off a bit.  First, the image is very small given that the maximum allowed is 640 pixels.  Second - why the dust spots?  It looks like the focus is fine at the front of the ring.  Looks like the photog was standing in front of the light, evidenced by the dark reflection centered on the ring and the diamond seems dark as well.  Nice effort - good luck.</td>', 'Hmmm...nice idea, execution is off a bit.  First, the image is very small given that the maximum allowed is 640 pixels.  Second - why the dust spots?  It looks like the focus is fine at the front of the ring.  Looks like the photog was standing in front of the light, evidenced by the dark reflection centered on the ring and the diamond seems dark as well.  Nice effort - good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337252, 170081, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why B/W?  This is a very interesting piece of jewely, should be bright and happy...this image is coming off a bit dark to me.  Text is hard to do if you''re not used to it - looks like you upsized the text after inputing it, then it becomes jagged on the edges.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why B/W?  This is a very interesting piece of jewely, should be bright and happy...this image is coming off a bit dark to me.  Text is hard to do if you''re not used to it - looks like you upsized the text after inputing it, then it becomes jagged on the edges.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337253, 170316, 30049, '<td valign="top">Plastic bowl underneath isn''t it?  ;^)  I can see the second ring.  I almost did the same thing but chickened out at the end.  Nice piece of jewelry.  Lighting and composition is good.  The focus appears sharper near the top (at about the 7th link top left) than down farther...?  Good luck.</td>', 'Plastic bowl underneath isn''t it?  ;^)  I can see the second ring.  I almost did the same thing but chickened out at the end.  Nice piece of jewelry.  Lighting and composition is good.  The focus appears sharper near the top (at about the 7th link top left) than down farther...?  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337254, 169354, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice piece of jewelry.  How did you get the reflective sparkle off of natural skin?  That''s very cool.  IMO this would have worked a little better if it had been cropped to exclude most of the neck.</td>', 'Nice piece of jewelry.  How did you get the reflective sparkle off of natural skin?  That''s very cool.  IMO this would have worked a little better if it had been cropped to exclude most of the neck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337255, 170265, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is creative.  Nice way to get the color reflection on the jewelry.  Only nitpick I have is the text color...subjective, yes I know - but I think black would have worked better.  The blue gets lost a bit in my opinion.  Overall, nice work.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is creative.  Nice way to get the color reflection on the jewelry.  Only nitpick I have is the text color...subjective, yes I know - but I think black would have worked better.  The blue gets lost a bit in my opinion.  Overall, nice work.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337256, 169954, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too closeup for my taste.  It might work with a different color background but the red is overpowering and I''m not seeing any fine detail and color in the diamond(s).  Some shades of blue work very well with diamonds.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a bit too closeup for my taste.  It might work with a different color background but the red is overpowering and I''m not seeing any fine detail and color in the diamond(s).  Some shades of blue work very well with diamonds.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337257, 170079, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of colors for this image.  The jewelry item jumps out nicely.  Very crisp, clean image.  I know it wasn''t required to have text, but I think in this case the voters may drop your score a little because there isn''t any text and the room for it is there.  JMO.  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'I like the choice of colors for this image.  The jewelry item jumps out nicely.  Very crisp, clean image.  I know it wasn''t required to have text, but I think in this case the voters may drop your score a little because there isn''t any text and the room for it is there.  JMO.  Best of luck to you.', '2005-04-28 11:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337258, 170323, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why is the clasp open?  Nice watch, obviously worn - so the advertisement is...?  As a stand alone image the lighting is good, nice contrast, and I like the gray background.  Good luck.</td>', 'Why is the clasp open?  Nice watch, obviously worn - so the advertisement is...?  As a stand alone image the lighting is good, nice contrast, and I like the gray background.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337260, 169396, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great color and clarity!  Very nice.  Even a starburst to boot...  Can''t decide if I like the reflection or not - guess it''s ok.  Anyway, best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  Great color and clarity!  Very nice.  Even a starburst to boot...  Can''t decide if I like the reflection or not - guess it''s ok.  Anyway, best of luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
