(1337283, 170224, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  DOF may be a bit shallow for the jewelry.  I understand the concept for the fade to back.  The piece in the center is almost distracting to the gold chain.  Good job on the lighting and I like your choice of text (words and font style).  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok.  DOF may be a bit shallow for the jewelry.  I understand the concept for the fade to back.  The piece in the center is almost distracting to the gold chain.  Good job on the lighting and I like your choice of text (words and font style).  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337284, 169734, 30049, '<td valign="top">Rich colors with the burgandy and gold.  Nice detail in the watch.  Good control of lighting and reflections.  Well done.</td>', 'Rich colors with the burgandy and gold.  Nice detail in the watch.  Good control of lighting and reflections.  Well done.', '2005-04-28 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337285, 170041, 30049, '<td valign="top">At first I was having a hard time figuring this out - couldn''t get a size context.  The cufflinks looked like box lids, and at first I thought the ring was some type of container.  Maybe I need to take a break!  ;^)  Now that I''ve figured it out...I really like your choice of background materials.  The lighting is right on, as is the focus.  This should do well.  Good luck.</td>', 'At first I was having a hard time figuring this out - couldn''t get a size context.  The cufflinks looked like box lids, and at first I thought the ring was some type of container.  Maybe I need to take a break!  ;^)  Now that I''ve figured it out...I really like your choice of background materials.  The lighting is right on, as is the focus.  This should do well.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337286, 168463, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job of lighting and use of background to tie the colors in with the jewelry item.  I think the light could have been difused just a little more to tone down some of the hard glare coming from some faces of the stones.  JMO.  Overall, well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice job of lighting and use of background to tie the colors in with the jewelry item.  I think the light could have been difused just a little more to tone down some of the hard glare coming from some faces of the stones.  JMO.  Overall, well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337287, 170184, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok...you''ve got a little sex appeal going on.  The image is well composed for what it is.  I''m not sure there is enough emphasis on the jewelry...only the final results will tell for sure.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok...you''ve got a little sex appeal going on.  The image is well composed for what it is.  I''m not sure there is enough emphasis on the jewelry...only the final results will tell for sure.  Good luck.', '2005-04-28 11:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337288, 170051, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Slick use of the word ''Antique'' as a cover for the few nicks and dings.  ;^)  You did a good job by rotating the image.  The lighting is right on.  Good job.  Hope this does well for you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  Slick use of the word ''Antique'' as a cover for the few nicks and dings.  ;^)  You did a good job by rotating the image.  The lighting is right on.  Good job.  Hope this does well for you in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337289, 169569, 30049, '<td valign="top">This image has alot of appeal.  I like the use of the necklace leading across the image.  Good lighting, composition and focus.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This image has alot of appeal.  I like the use of the necklace leading across the image.  Good lighting, composition and focus.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
