(1337354, 169148, 8970, '<td valign="top">The words seem more important than the bracelet.  The bracelet would work much better if it was all in focus, the depth of field is way too low in this picture.</td>', 'The words seem more important than the bracelet.  The bracelet would work much better if it was all in focus, the depth of field is way too low in this picture.', '2005-04-28 11:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
