(1337839, 169252, 2490, '<td valign="top">De Bears, huh. :)  This is one of my higher choices.  Excellent composition and coloring.  Not quite as "focused" on the diamonds as I would like, personally.  9</td>', 'De Bears, huh. :)  This is one of my higher choices.  Excellent composition and coloring.  Not quite as "focused" on the diamonds as I would like, personally.  9', '2005-04-28 13:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337845, 169539, 2490, '<td valign="top">Too much emphasis on the flower, not enough on the jewelry.  5</td>', 'Too much emphasis on the flower, not enough on the jewelry.  5', '2005-04-28 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337847, 170276, 2490, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Is this jewelry?? :)  I''m judging watches as jewelry but betting you are getting slammed.  8</td>', 'Very well done.  Is this jewelry?? :)  I''m judging watches as jewelry but betting you are getting slammed.  8', '2005-04-28 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337848, 169025, 2490, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  8</td>', 'Very nicely done.  8', '2005-04-28 13:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337872, 170156, 18197, '<td valign="top">It appears to me that you have blurred the background. Where the necklace (which is in perfect focus -- nice job with that by the way)  is resting against her skin, the skin would have also been in focus. But it doesn''t appear to be. Thus the blurring makes it look like the necklace has been placed on top of a photo. This effect (whether gausian or DOF) detracts from the impact of the photo in my opinion. Further, I think the composition might be improved by moving the necklace down in the frame ... showing  a little more neck to balance the image would improve it possibly. You are welcome to PM me after the voting if you like.</td>', 'It appears to me that you have blurred the background. Where the necklace (which is in perfect focus -- nice job with that by the way)  is resting against her skin, the skin would have also been in focus. But it doesn''t appear to be. Thus the blurring makes it look like the necklace has been placed on top of a photo. This effect (whether gausian or DOF) detracts from the impact of the photo in my opinion. Further, I think the composition might be improved by moving the necklace down in the frame ... showing  a little more neck to balance the image would improve it possibly. You are welcome to PM me after the voting if you like.', '2005-04-28 13:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337888, 170230, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Light a bit strong. Relection on the water is too strong.</td>', 'Nice composition. Light a bit strong. Relection on the water is too strong.', '2005-04-28 13:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337889, 170366, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and composition. The absolute dark background is a bit over the top for me. And text color is really clashing with the background.</td>', 'Good lighting and composition. The absolute dark background is a bit over the top for me. And text color is really clashing with the background.', '2005-04-28 13:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337896, 170316, 30605, '<td valign="top">Would have need a second light source from the left I think.There''s too much shadows created by the neckless and the ripples in the fabric.</td>', 'Would have need a second light source from the left I think.There''s too much shadows created by the neckless and the ripples in the fabric.', '2005-04-28 13:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337900, 168945, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice and subtle. Discret text, very good.</td>', 'Nice and subtle. Discret text, very good.', '2005-04-28 13:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337915, 169968, 30605, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. Too much shadows however. I suspect you placed the earrings on a glass; that''s why the double shadow. I don''t know if it was intended that way, but I think it detract from the main subject.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. Too much shadows however. I suspect you placed the earrings on a glass; that''s why the double shadow. I don''t know if it was intended that way, but I think it detract from the main subject.', '2005-04-28 13:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337929, 169354, 30605, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say; I think it''s uninteresting that you croped the head of your model. It''s not very esthetic to chop someone''s head. If you only wanted to photograph the neckless, you would have benn better putting it on a flat surface.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say; I think it''s uninteresting that you croped the head of your model. It''s not very esthetic to chop someone''s head. If you only wanted to photograph the neckless, you would have benn better putting it on a flat surface.', '2005-04-28 13:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337935, 169252, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I would have prefered that you get closer to the ring since it seems well lit with detail preserved in the diamonds.</td>', 'Good composition. I would have prefered that you get closer to the ring since it seems well lit with detail preserved in the diamonds.', '2005-04-28 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337941, 170094, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good lighting; no shadow, no reflection. You should have positioned the hour hand to not obscure the watch maker name. I can''t see this picture as an ad with the watch maker name partially blocked.</td>', 'Good lighting; no shadow, no reflection. You should have positioned the hour hand to not obscure the watch maker name. I can''t see this picture as an ad with the watch maker name partially blocked.', '2005-04-28 13:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337946, 169010, 30605, '<td valign="top">nice capture, clean, crisp. Well lit. However, I doubt that the buckle is the most interesting part of that watch.</td>', 'nice capture, clean, crisp. Well lit. However, I doubt that the buckle is the most interesting part of that watch.', '2005-04-28 13:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337956, 169295, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good use of shalow DOF. Ring is well lit with no blown highlight. Pleasing color balance. However, the shadow casted by the ring is way to strong I think. Maybe having another diffuse light source would have reduce the shadow.</td>', 'Good composition and good use of shalow DOF. Ring is well lit with no blown highlight. Pleasing color balance. However, the shadow casted by the ring is way to strong I think. Maybe having another diffuse light source would have reduce the shadow.', '2005-04-28 13:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337971, 169822, 30605, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. Very impresive use of shallow DOF. However, some part of the jewel are not in focus, especially the "V"; it''s a bit distractive, especially since this part is dead center.</td>', 'Love the composition. Very impresive use of shallow DOF. However, some part of the jewel are not in focus, especially the "V"; it''s a bit distractive, especially since this part is dead center.', '2005-04-28 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337982, 170182, 30605, '<td valign="top">Not enough lit; hard to see what it is (earrings?) and details. Good composition, placing the earrings the way you did is more dynamic. I suspect you placed the earrings on a glass or mirror, which creates a double reflection that is not attractive.</td>', 'Not enough lit; hard to see what it is (earrings?) and details. Good composition, placing the earrings the way you did is more dynamic. I suspect you placed the earrings on a glass or mirror, which creates a double reflection that is not attractive.', '2005-04-28 13:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337985, 170361, 20018, '<td valign="top">the models face could''ve maybe been cropped out and a bit less sharp, other than that really nice job</td>', 'the models face could''ve maybe been cropped out and a bit less sharp, other than that really nice job', '2005-04-28 14:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337988, 169958, 30605, '<td valign="top">Unsual placement of the watch resting on the crown. Good lighting with no shadow and almost no reflection.</td>', 'Unsual placement of the watch resting on the crown. Good lighting with no shadow and almost no reflection.', '2005-04-28 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337992, 170184, 20018, '<td valign="top">could''ve kept the sharpness of hand decreased to emphasize the ring more</td>', 'could''ve kept the sharpness of hand decreased to emphasize the ring more', '2005-04-28 14:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338003, 168507, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition and overall lighting. Rotation of the ring makes the picture moer interesting I think. Too shallow DOF however, especially on the front of the ring; would have be nice to see all diamonds in sharp focus. From what I can tell, there seems to have a strong reflection of something white in the main stone. Text is subtle, well done.</td>', 'Good composition and overall lighting. Rotation of the ring makes the picture moer interesting I think. Too shallow DOF however, especially on the front of the ring; would have be nice to see all diamonds in sharp focus. From what I can tell, there seems to have a strong reflection of something white in the main stone. Text is subtle, well done.', '2005-04-28 14:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338007, 169734, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice watch. Good lighting. Would have been nice to photograph this watch at an angle to show the curve.</td>', 'Nice watch. Good lighting. Would have been nice to photograph this watch at an angle to show the curve.', '2005-04-28 14:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338012, 170201, 30605, '<td valign="top">Can''t see too many detail. Framed closer would have been better.</td>', 'Can''t see too many detail. Framed closer would have been better.', '2005-04-28 14:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338066, 169757, 20018, '<td valign="top">noisy, colors look off</td>', 'noisy, colors look off', '2005-04-28 14:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338068, 170358, 20018, '<td valign="top">DOF is too shallow</td>', 'DOF is too shallow', '2005-04-28 14:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338077, 170366, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rings are portrayed and their golden color, but the text, especially the yellownes is realy ugly. I''d rather have seen no text at all. The space above the rings is also to dominant.</td>', 'I like the way the rings are portrayed and their golden color, but the text, especially the yellownes is realy ugly. I''d rather have seen no text at all. The space above the rings is also to dominant.', '2005-04-28 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338086, 169539, 20018, '<td valign="top">the flower seems to be more of a focal point rather than the chain</td>', 'the flower seems to be more of a focal point rather than the chain', '2005-04-28 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338093, 169694, 3032, '<td valign="top">It has some lighting flaws, but I love the composition setup, text positioning and toning. The eye and the ring are the most dominant element, I think that''s good. It''s just that I am not comofortable with the light on the hand and ring. 9</td>', 'It has some lighting flaws, but I love the composition setup, text positioning and toning. The eye and the ring are the most dominant element, I think that''s good. It''s just that I am not comofortable with the light on the hand and ring. 9', '2005-04-28 14:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338161, 169256, 32161, '<td valign="top">great, well done.  9</td>', 'great, well done.  9', '2005-04-28 14:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338162, 169806, 32161, '<td valign="top">like the photo, dont like the large text.</td>', 'like the photo, dont like the large text.', '2005-04-28 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338164, 169354, 25571, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very interesting, as it gives good sparkly reflection on the skin. Unfortunatly the composition is not very interesting; no features, no movement, could''ve been a plastic doll. Also the composition is not even, which bugs my eyes some (two black spots on each sides). 5</td>', 'Lighting is very interesting, as it gives good sparkly reflection on the skin. Unfortunatly the composition is not very interesting; no features, no movement, could''ve been a plastic doll. Also the composition is not even, which bugs my eyes some (two black spots on each sides). 5', '2005-04-28 14:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338168, 168945, 32161, '<td valign="top">very, very good, great text, great photo. well done 10</td>', 'very, very good, great text, great photo. well done 10', '2005-04-28 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338169, 168804, 32161, '<td valign="top">cool, well done.</td>', 'cool, well done.', '2005-04-28 14:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338170, 170303, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of the few times I''ve loved such a heavy special effect. Strong image, good field waiting for text.</td>', 'One of the few times I''ve loved such a heavy special effect. Strong image, good field waiting for text.', '2005-04-28 14:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338173, 169327, 32161, '<td valign="top">like the starbursts. well done.</td>', 'like the starbursts. well done.', '2005-04-28 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338174, 170051, 32161, '<td valign="top">nice job, well done.</td>', 'nice job, well done.', '2005-04-28 14:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338178, 170081, 32161, '<td valign="top">a tad dark, nice framing though.</td>', 'a tad dark, nice framing though.', '2005-04-28 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338180, 169821, 30861, '<td valign="top">The pearls are beautifully rendered here. I like the inline as well.  The photo''s very "commercial" (as opposed to artistic), which is what I take the challenge to be about. Or, rather, this is a challenge in which "commercial" can be an asset. Good job.</td>', 'The pearls are beautifully rendered here. I like the inline as well.  The photo''s very "commercial" (as opposed to artistic), which is what I take the challenge to be about. Or, rather, this is a challenge in which "commercial" can be an asset. Good job.', '2005-04-28 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338184, 170224, 32161, '<td valign="top">great use of depth of field. well done</td>', 'great use of depth of field. well done', '2005-04-28 14:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338187, 169578, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love this one. It doesn''t shout "creative", it just renders the object skilfully and incorporates simple, effective text and a striking title font that works very well.</td>', 'I love this one. It doesn''t shout "creative", it just renders the object skilfully and incorporates simple, effective text and a striking title font that works very well.', '2005-04-28 14:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338188, 169433, 32161, '<td valign="top">nice background.</td>', 'nice background.', '2005-04-28 14:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338189, 170234, 32161, '<td valign="top">great use of desat</td>', 'great use of desat', '2005-04-28 14:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338193, 170158, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. This stands out from the crowd. Fine desat job, lovingly rendered image.</td>', 'Nicely done. This stands out from the crowd. Fine desat job, lovingly rendered image.', '2005-04-28 14:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338197, 169563, 32161, '<td valign="top">nice sharp focusing.<br/>great framing.<br/>this is one of my top scores for the challenge.</td>', 'nice sharp focusing.great framing.this is one of my top scores for the challenge.', '2005-04-28 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338201, 169829, 32161, '<td valign="top">Soft but really nice. well done. 8</td>', 'Soft but really nice. well done. 8', '2005-04-28 14:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338204, 170276, 30861, '<td valign="top">Easily among the best of the watch pictures. Nice work. The connection of the fob to the watch is not, perhaps, as well-displayed and lit as it ought to be, it''s getting lost in the background. The watch itself is beautifully rendered.</td>', 'Easily among the best of the watch pictures. Nice work. The connection of the fob to the watch is not, perhaps, as well-displayed and lit as it ought to be, it''s getting lost in the background. The watch itself is beautifully rendered.', '2005-04-28 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338209, 168507, 32161, '<td valign="top">Im looking at an advertisment! well done. 9</td>', 'Im looking at an advertisment! well done. 9', '2005-04-28 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338214, 169873, 29269, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see a different background - white does not provide enough contrast for the advertisement. There is also a shade/reflection of pink on the white that bothers me a little bit. 7.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see a different background - white does not provide enough contrast for the advertisement. There is also a shade/reflection of pink on the white that bothers me a little bit. 7.', '2005-04-28 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338217, 169543, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is lovely in conception, nice to look at until one gets in close. Unfortunately the forwasrdmost pearls are in front of the zone of sharpness and this hurts you badly IMO. More DOF would have done the trick. 7 from me, I really like the design, fonts, and tonality of this.</td>', 'This is lovely in conception, nice to look at until one gets in close. Unfortunately the forwasrdmost pearls are in front of the zone of sharpness and this hurts you badly IMO. More DOF would have done the trick. 7 from me, I really like the design, fonts, and tonality of this.', '2005-04-28 14:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338219, 170327, 32161, '<td valign="top">nice  text, great background, well done.</td>', 'nice  text, great background, well done.', '2005-04-28 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338222, 169433, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully rendered, especially on the spherical element. A little austere overall IMO.</td>', 'Beautifully rendered, especially on the spherical element. A little austere overall IMO.', '2005-04-28 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338224, 169467, 29269, '<td valign="top">Good idea with shells. A softer light source might have been a better idea, more diffused light would leave less of the reflection on the pearl and improve the overall image. 7.</td>', 'Good idea with shells. A softer light source might have been a better idea, more diffused light would leave less of the reflection on the pearl and improve the overall image. 7.', '2005-04-28 14:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338242, 168355, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice - the best wristwatch shot of the challenge. One of my top 5.<br/>I like the 10:10 hands setting - many entries ignored this common trick to achieve symmetry and show the background of the watch in a best possible manner.<br/>Like the soft light. Bumping up to 9 on the second pass.<br/></td>', 'Very nice - the best wristwatch shot of the challenge. One of my top 5.I like the 10:10 hands setting - many entries ignored this common trick to achieve symmetry and show the background of the watch in a best possible manner.Like the soft light. Bumping up to 9 on the second pass.', '2005-04-28 14:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338264, 169869, 34247, '<td valign="top">There seems to be specks on the photo?</td>', 'There seems to be specks on the photo?', '2005-04-28 14:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338271, 170183, 34247, '<td valign="top">Like the shot. both watch and text font are "manly" and I hope the text means something manly as well.</td>', 'Like the shot. both watch and text font are "manly" and I hope the text means something manly as well.', '2005-04-28 15:00:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1338276, 169252, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice, elegant, simple ad. The focus is good, the font is right. 7</td>', 'Nice, elegant, simple ad. The focus is good, the font is right. 7', '2005-04-28 15:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338279, 169734, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice layout, but text font lets the ad down, imho. 6</td>', 'Nice layout, but text font lets the ad down, imho. 6', '2005-04-28 15:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338284, 169757, 34247, '<td valign="top">the rock seems off focus, and the font isn''t very effective. but great layout and composition. 6</td>', 'the rock seems off focus, and the font isn''t very effective. but great layout and composition. 6', '2005-04-28 15:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338287, 169970, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection on the ring.</td>', 'Nice reflection on the ring.', '2005-04-28 15:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338290, 169965, 34247, '<td valign="top">great layout and composition. 8</td>', 'great layout and composition. 8', '2005-04-28 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338294, 170065, 34247, '<td valign="top">Better focus on the watch face would be more effective, imho. but nice layout. 7</td>', 'Better focus on the watch face would be more effective, imho. but nice layout. 7', '2005-04-28 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338298, 169354, 34247, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the reflection on the skin? and perhaps a bit of cleaning up on the stretch lines would add more effect. 6</td>', 'I''m not sure about the reflection on the skin? and perhaps a bit of cleaning up on the stretch lines would add more effect. 6', '2005-04-28 15:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338302, 169472, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but dof is perhaps too narrow. would work better with the jewelry in sharper focus. but i like the layout a lot, so 8</td>', 'nice shot, but dof is perhaps too narrow. would work better with the jewelry in sharper focus. but i like the layout a lot, so 8', '2005-04-28 15:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338304, 169613, 34247, '<td valign="top">Great shot. like the blue tint a lot. seems to highlight the complexity of the watch face without it being too intimidating. great dof. 10</td>', 'Great shot. like the blue tint a lot. seems to highlight the complexity of the watch face without it being too intimidating. great dof. 10', '2005-04-28 15:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338305, 169295, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good shot. 7</td>', 'nice idea, good shot. 7', '2005-04-28 15:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338310, 169025, 34247, '<td valign="top">I think the reflection here works better than reflections in many other entries. 7</td>', 'I think the reflection here works better than reflections in many other entries. 7', '2005-04-28 15:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338313, 169444, 34247, '<td valign="top">Love the cheek. the lighting and focus definitely highlights the fakeness. 8</td>', 'Love the cheek. the lighting and focus definitely highlights the fakeness. 8', '2005-04-28 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338318, 169956, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. Nice focus and lighting. Black background works well. 8</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. Nice focus and lighting. Black background works well. 8', '2005-04-28 15:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338324, 168355, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice masculine ad. great layout and lighting. 8</td>', 'Nice masculine ad. great layout and lighting. 8', '2005-04-28 15:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338327, 169491, 34247, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. I do like the colors and layout. Great text. 8</td>', 'Hahaha. I do like the colors and layout. Great text. 8', '2005-04-28 15:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338330, 170153, 34247, '<td valign="top">The focus seems soft to me. Nice layout though.</td>', 'The focus seems soft to me. Nice layout though.', '2005-04-28 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338333, 169958, 25571, '<td valign="top">I find the composition a bit off, as its not even, but the watch ''wants'' to be in the picture. Also the lighting is very yellow for a silver watch (was this shot in RAW?), the colour temperature is too strong and could''ve been cooled down some. The Time displayed is good but could''ve been better to be able to read what''s writen. Sharpness is good, but could''ve been slightly better. It also seems the lighting is a bit too strong (or too close?) to the watch. How many spots did you use? I''d suggested more Wattage at a lesser distance, or a Soft-Box. DOF is good. 6</td>', 'I find the composition a bit off, as its not even, but the watch ''wants'' to be in the picture. Also the lighting is very yellow for a silver watch (was this shot in RAW?), the colour temperature is too strong and could''ve been cooled down some. The Time displayed is good but could''ve been better to be able to read what''s writen. Sharpness is good, but could''ve been slightly better. It also seems the lighting is a bit too strong (or too close?) to the watch. How many spots did you use? I''d suggested more Wattage at a lesser distance, or a Soft-Box. DOF is good. 6', '2005-04-28 15:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338335, 169579, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice ad. looks like a simple, elegant product. Nice dof and layout. The text is right size and placement, but perhaps different font? 8</td>', 'Nice ad. looks like a simple, elegant product. Nice dof and layout. The text is right size and placement, but perhaps different font? 8', '2005-04-28 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338337, 170046, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice layout, lighting. 8</td>', 'Nice layout, lighting. 8', '2005-04-28 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338341, 170271, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like the layout and idea, but the shot feels too dark, and perhaps would benefit from a lighter tone. Since it''s an ad, I''d probably also clean out the stretch lines around the neck. 6</td>', 'I like the layout and idea, but the shot feels too dark, and perhaps would benefit from a lighter tone. Since it''s an ad, I''d probably also clean out the stretch lines around the neck. 6', '2005-04-28 15:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338343, 170252, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice layout, saturation, lighting and text. I''d clean out the hair strands, though. 8</td>', 'Nice layout, saturation, lighting and text. I''d clean out the hair strands, though. 8', '2005-04-28 15:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338350, 170316, 34247, '<td valign="top">Focus seems sharpest at the point just above the centerpiece of the jewelry. Nice layout and decent lighting. 6</td>', 'Focus seems sharpest at the point just above the centerpiece of the jewelry. Nice layout and decent lighting. 6', '2005-04-28 15:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338366, 170305, 34247, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great, polished ad. A bit too much glare for me on the left side of the watch, but not major. 8</td>', 'Looks like a great, polished ad. A bit too much glare for me on the left side of the watch, but not major. 8', '2005-04-28 15:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338371, 170340, 34247, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a smaller font size would be more effective. The dof on the ring itself is nice.</td>', 'Perhaps a smaller font size would be more effective. The dof on the ring itself is nice.', '2005-04-28 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1338372, 169806, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the textures of this shot, and the denim and silver combo works well. Not so sure about the text, though. 7</td>', 'i like the textures of this shot, and the denim and silver combo works well. Not so sure about the text, though. 7', '2005-04-28 15:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
