(1339260, 170046, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very nice...Though there is a model, I know it''s about the jewels...seems pretty obvious to me....I bet you''ve had comments saying otherwise.... The text enhances the image and gently guides the viewer...and thank you for using a proper font... Beautiful light, lovely skin tone, perfect color.<br/> <br/>Part 2: Moving on up to a 10, looks like something you might see in nicer fashion magazine, simply elegant.</td>', 'Very nice...Though there is a model, I know it''s about the jewels...seems pretty obvious to me....I bet you''ve had comments saying otherwise.... The text enhances the image and gently guides the viewer...and thank you for using a proper font... Beautiful light, lovely skin tone, perfect color. Part 2: Moving on up to a 10, looks like something you might see in nicer fashion magazine, simply elegant.', '2005-04-28 18:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
