(1339563, 168475, 31213, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Something about this shot bothers me and I can''t exactly put my finger on it.  The whole image has a terrible yellow/red cast to it and definately could have used some color adjustment in photoshop.  Also the composition makes the shot uncomfortable.  The fingers look spread awkwardly and forcefully.  With words like "trust" int he title I would like to see softer colors with a comfortable hand and the ring all the way on the finger.  Tan line where the ring usually goes on the finger is pretty unfortunate as well.  Sorry, just full of complaints.  I doubt people are really giving you feedback, so I''d like to let it all spill and you can take what you want from it.<br/> <br/>Happy shooting,<br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'Hmm.  Something about this shot bothers me and I can''t exactly put my finger on it.  The whole image has a terrible yellow/red cast to it and definately could have used some color adjustment in photoshop.  Also the composition makes the shot uncomfortable.  The fingers look spread awkwardly and forcefully.  With words like "trust" int he title I would like to see softer colors with a comfortable hand and the ring all the way on the finger.  Tan line where the ring usually goes on the finger is pretty unfortunate as well.  Sorry, just full of complaints.  I doubt people are really giving you feedback, so I''d like to let it all spill and you can take what you want from it. Happy shooting, Chris A', '2005-04-28 19:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339567, 169504, 31213, '<td valign="top">With a different stone this lighting setup would have worked better, but  this stone is complicated and I''d like to see more of a high key lighting setup.  Nice job with the silver and dealing with the reflections though.</td>', 'With a different stone this lighting setup would have worked better, but  this stone is complicated and I''d like to see more of a high key lighting setup.  Nice job with the silver and dealing with the reflections though.', '2005-04-28 19:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339574, 168813, 31213, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of this diffused glow thats going on in some parts of the ring.  The back bottom part blends right into the ground.  I''d like to see a defined, crisp edge.  The diamonds seem to be a bit out of focus too.  Love the simplicity of the shot though, and I like the title. 6</td>', 'I''m not a fan of this diffused glow thats going on in some parts of the ring.  The back bottom part blends right into the ground.  I''d like to see a defined, crisp edge.  The diamonds seem to be a bit out of focus too.  Love the simplicity of the shot though, and I like the title. 6', '2005-04-28 19:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339579, 170355, 31213, '<td valign="top">Interesting color choice.  I dont think the depth of field should ahve been so shallow for an advertisement shot.  Nice jewelry and composition.</td>', 'Interesting color choice.  I dont think the depth of field should ahve been so shallow for an advertisement shot.  Nice jewelry and composition.', '2005-04-28 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339583, 169148, 31213, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty.  I like the curve in the jewelry, it makes for a good composition.</td>', 'Simple and pretty.  I like the curve in the jewelry, it makes for a good composition.', '2005-04-28 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339586, 169714, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the rose!  Even more than the jewelry.  The lighting on it is so perfect. Unfortunately I dont like the hot spot on the forehead of the skull.</td>', 'Love the rose!  Even more than the jewelry.  The lighting on it is so perfect. Unfortunately I dont like the hot spot on the forehead of the skull.', '2005-04-28 19:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339589, 170118, 31213, '<td valign="top">I dont know what the light blue/grey thing in the reflection behind the ring is but i dont like it.  Nice shot of the watch though.  Good lighting, composition, and message.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I dont know what the light blue/grey thing in the reflection behind the ring is but i dont like it.  Nice shot of the watch though.  Good lighting, composition, and message. 7', '2005-04-28 19:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339594, 170361, 31213, '<td valign="top">It may be this monitor cause I''m at work, but her skin tone looks really really odd.  I''m sure you darkened her in post to bring out the jewelry and make it pop, but something more needs to be done with her skin and i can''t put my finger on it.  I love the picture as a whole.  Nice model, idea, and composition.  Right on with the fouc too.  Nice work!<br/> <br/>Happy shooting,<br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'It may be this monitor cause I''m at work, but her skin tone looks really really odd.  I''m sure you darkened her in post to bring out the jewelry and make it pop, but something more needs to be done with her skin and i can''t put my finger on it.  I love the picture as a whole.  Nice model, idea, and composition.  Right on with the fouc too.  Nice work! Happy shooting, Chris A', '2005-04-28 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339597, 169694, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love it!  This could be in a magazine for sure.  Even though its overexposed (i know this is on purpose) and it looks very processed I''ve seen plenty of ads like this and it has an appel to it.  Nice work!  10</td>', 'Love it!  This could be in a magazine for sure.  Even though its overexposed (i know this is on purpose) and it looks very processed I''ve seen plenty of ads like this and it has an appel to it.  Nice work!  10', '2005-04-28 19:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339633, 170358, 30605, '<td valign="top">Too shallow DOF in my opinion. In a jewelry ad, I would expect to see the maximum amount of detail. Good composition and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Too shallow DOF in my opinion. In a jewelry ad, I would expect to see the maximum amount of detail. Good composition and interesting lighting.', '2005-04-28 20:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339638, 170166, 3524, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, mood, tone, crispness, and composition. This would work great as a watch advertisement, imo. I hope you didn''t suffer because the watch wasn''t shot macro-style. (9)</td>', 'Great lighting, mood, tone, crispness, and composition. This would work great as a watch advertisement, imo. I hope you didn''t suffer because the watch wasn''t shot macro-style. (9)', '2005-04-28 20:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339643, 170355, 30605, '<td valign="top">Too shallow depth of field. I would expect to see more detail of the jewelry in a jewelry ad. Composition and lighting are well done. Still a nice picture, but not appropriate for an advertisement. 6</td>', 'Too shallow depth of field. I would expect to see more detail of the jewelry in a jewelry ad. Composition and lighting are well done. Still a nice picture, but not appropriate for an advertisement. 6', '2005-04-28 20:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
