(1339699, 169950, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. Rotation really make this picture work. Lighting is well controlled. Soft shadows are nice.  Dark refelctions in the rings a bit distracting; looks like the photographer reflecting in the rings.</td>', 'Very good composition. Rotation really make this picture work. Lighting is well controlled. Soft shadows are nice.  Dark refelctions in the rings a bit distracting; looks like the photographer reflecting in the rings.', '2005-04-28 20:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
