(1340200, 169579, 36299, '<td valign="top">Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo.', '2005-04-28 22:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340201, 170080, 35804, '<td valign="top">This picture has a wonderful masculine feel to it. Really nice rich tone, color and light.</td>', 'This picture has a wonderful masculine feel to it. Really nice rich tone, color and light.', '2005-04-28 22:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340205, 169862, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Hard to say what to do here,  her eyes draw more then the jewelry.</td>', 'Nice.  Hard to say what to do here,  her eyes draw more then the jewelry.', '2005-04-28 22:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340208, 170118, 10634, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 7<br/>Technical: 6<br/>Interest: 6<br/>Overall: 6<br/> <br/>I''m not overly fond of the placement of the watch in this shot. Being a Libra, I like balance and this just seems off kilter to me. Tilting a bit more to the right and aligning the watch better with the corner may make this better. Otherwise, it is a good, clean, crisp image and a nice entry. Good Luck!</td>', 'Challenge: 7Technical: 6Interest: 6Overall: 6 I''m not overly fond of the placement of the watch in this shot. Being a Libra, I like balance and this just seems off kilter to me. Tilting a bit more to the right and aligning the watch better with the corner may make this better. Otherwise, it is a good, clean, crisp image and a nice entry. Good Luck!', '2005-04-28 22:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340216, 169472, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The head is in focus, but none of the jewelry is.</td>', 'Nice idea. The head is in focus, but none of the jewelry is.', '2005-04-28 22:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340217, 169349, 10634, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6<br/>Technical: 6<br/>Interest: 5<br/>Overall: 6<br/> <br/>The lighting is a little much. The glare on the "background" surface is distracting as is the glare on the watch itself. The color of the background does nothing to enhance the watch... I think it actually makes it look more dull. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Challenge: 6Technical: 6Interest: 5Overall: 6 The lighting is a little much. The glare on the "background" surface is distracting as is the glare on the watch itself. The color of the background does nothing to enhance the watch... I think it actually makes it look more dull. Keep up the good work!', '2005-04-28 22:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340220, 169543, 35530, '<td valign="top">Would be absolutely stunning with white pearls.</td>', 'Would be absolutely stunning with white pearls.', '2005-04-28 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
