(1340301, 170355, 33672, '<td valign="top">COlor are great but I''m not sure this DOF works because I have a hard time determining if this is even a pice of jewelry or sculpture. Deeper DOF might help.  Keep the product crisp.</td>', 'COlor are great but I''m not sure this DOF works because I have a hard time determining if this is even a pice of jewelry or sculpture. Deeper DOF might help.  Keep the product crisp.', '2005-04-28 22:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
