(1340496, 170094, 34247, '<td valign="top">elegant layout, nice product, good focus and details, i like the overall lightness of the ad and the two tone text use. a different font would work better with me, perhaps. 8</td>', 'elegant layout, nice product, good focus and details, i like the overall lightness of the ad and the two tone text use. a different font would work better with me, perhaps. 8', '2005-04-28 23:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340505, 170309, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative! Now if only we could actually see a fish in the bowl</td>', 'Very imaginative! Now if only we could actually see a fish in the bowl', '2005-04-28 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340514, 170359, 25571, '<td valign="top">Colours are something intriguing. The display of the jewel is an interesting idea, but doesn''t work very well. The line is not even (slight leaning towards the right) and the Red line takes lots away from the eye. The background is wierd as its tainted with ''green''? spots all over, and the cloth used wasn''t clean with SpotEditing, which shots through the black. 5</td>', 'Colours are something intriguing. The display of the jewel is an interesting idea, but doesn''t work very well. The line is not even (slight leaning towards the right) and the Red line takes lots away from the eye. The background is wierd as its tainted with ''green''? spots all over, and the cloth used wasn''t clean with SpotEditing, which shots through the black. 5', '2005-04-28 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340521, 170232, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, but not quite sharp enough, and the composition isn''t very powerfull</td>', 'Very good idea, but not quite sharp enough, and the composition isn''t very powerfull', '2005-04-28 23:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340523, 169609, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! I like the colour reflected at the jewel mixed with the background''s sunset colours. Very unique. Unfortunatly, the jewel could''Ve been sharper as it seems to lack a little focus. Also, the composition is a bit off. I wish i didn''t have to see the ''chain'' part on top, which takes away from the whole concept. 7</td>', 'Cool idea! I like the colour reflected at the jewel mixed with the background''s sunset colours. Very unique. Unfortunatly, the jewel could''Ve been sharper as it seems to lack a little focus. Also, the composition is a bit off. I wish i didn''t have to see the ''chain'' part on top, which takes away from the whole concept. 7', '2005-04-28 23:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340526, 169254, 25571, '<td valign="top">Funny! Unfortunatly, I''m not sure how this would work in an Advertisement. Colours are interesting but could''ve been punched a little more. Lighting in itself is uneven and makes it hard to reflect the ''beauty'' of the jewels, especially since they take about 10% of the shot. Text is plain and doesn''t bring anything special, just tries to help or explain the display., 5</td>', 'Funny! Unfortunatly, I''m not sure how this would work in an Advertisement. Colours are interesting but could''ve been punched a little more. Lighting in itself is uneven and makes it hard to reflect the ''beauty'' of the jewels, especially since they take about 10% of the shot. Text is plain and doesn''t bring anything special, just tries to help or explain the display., 5', '2005-04-28 23:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340530, 169302, 25571, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say about this shot... the idea is very fun and unique, although i''m not certian it would fair well in an advertisement. Unfortunatly, we don''t really ''see'' the ring, nor its actual Jewel... so there isn''t much to do here. Lighting is ok (Natural?) but the hangle is wierd. Perharps trying to use a reflector (white foam) on the right side to throw a little more light on to the glove could help in making the Diamond shine some... 5</td>', 'Not sure what to say about this shot... the idea is very fun and unique, although i''m not certian it would fair well in an advertisement. Unfortunatly, we don''t really ''see'' the ring, nor its actual Jewel... so there isn''t much to do here. Lighting is ok (Natural?) but the hangle is wierd. Perharps trying to use a reflector (white foam) on the right side to throw a little more light on to the glove could help in making the Diamond shine some... 5', '2005-04-28 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340532, 167997, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cute pic. In this particuliar case, i wished the little girl''s face would be in focus, which it isn''t. Since this shot is threated as a Portrait, its important to have the face in focus (just learning this myself) but in this case, doesn''t work very well. Colours are dull and the lighting, especially on the rings, is not very good, which doesn''t do any justice to them. 5</td>', 'Cute pic. In this particuliar case, i wished the little girl''s face would be in focus, which it isn''t. Since this shot is threated as a Portrait, its important to have the face in focus (just learning this myself) but in this case, doesn''t work very well. Colours are dull and the lighting, especially on the rings, is not very good, which doesn''t do any justice to them. 5', '2005-04-29 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340536, 169869, 28359, '<td valign="top">nicely done, (looks like you need to clean your lens or sensor)</td>', 'nicely done, (looks like you need to clean your lens or sensor)', '2005-04-29 00:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340538, 169694, 7485, '<td valign="top">Most creative one so far. Only minor problem is that the bottom of the first ''g'' fades into the finger. Still a truly professional looking ad - 8</td>', 'Most creative one so far. Only minor problem is that the bottom of the first ''g'' fades into the finger. Still a truly professional looking ad - 8', '2005-04-29 00:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340541, 170361, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool concept! I really like the shades of the skin vs the jewels. They seem to be missing some sharpness unfortunatly. Text is cool and looks good, not in the way too much. I seem to think you selected the jewels out of the pic for better editing... 6</td>', 'Cool concept! I really like the shades of the skin vs the jewels. They seem to be missing some sharpness unfortunatly. Text is cool and looks good, not in the way too much. I seem to think you selected the jewels out of the pic for better editing... 6', '2005-04-29 00:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340544, 170149, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Matchs pretty well with the rock. Lighting is somewhat dull and could''ve used some HUmphs. Lots of little grainny spots and dirts in the pic, which could''ve been avoided with some spot editing. That really kills the effect. Also a Frame of some kind (black and purple?) would do well here. 5</td>', 'Cool idea. Matchs pretty well with the rock. Lighting is somewhat dull and could''ve used some HUmphs. Lots of little grainny spots and dirts in the pic, which could''ve been avoided with some spot editing. That really kills the effect. Also a Frame of some kind (black and purple?) would do well here. 5', '2005-04-29 00:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340553, 170325, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice colours! Wish they could''ve been a little more bright. The pic shouts for Contrast IMO, and the jewel is unfortunatly, not well focused. Perharps due to lighting? NIce non the less. 6</td>', 'Nice colours! Wish they could''ve been a little more bright. The pic shouts for Contrast IMO, and the jewel is unfortunatly, not well focused. Perharps due to lighting? NIce non the less. 6', '2005-04-29 00:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340556, 170201, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Unfortunatly, the white takes away from the ring. Composition is intersting, if a bit ''large''. The rings are a bit small tho, hard to see, and they seem a tiny bit ''not'' sharp enought. 7</td>', 'Cute idea. Unfortunatly, the white takes away from the ring. Composition is intersting, if a bit ''large''. The rings are a bit small tho, hard to see, and they seem a tiny bit ''not'' sharp enought. 7', '2005-04-29 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340560, 170051, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I''d wished for an even crop on both sides of the ring tho (top and left). Lighting is good but is hard on the ''black'' jewels. Text is nice, perharps a bit too intrusive. Overall tho, the picture lacks the little ''humphs'' it needs to catch the eyes in a magazine. IMO. 6</td>', 'Nice composition. I''d wished for an even crop on both sides of the ring tho (top and left). Lighting is good but is hard on the ''black'' jewels. Text is nice, perharps a bit too intrusive. Overall tho, the picture lacks the little ''humphs'' it needs to catch the eyes in a magazine. IMO. 6', '2005-04-29 00:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340563, 169898, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice colour. Lighting is a bit wierd (from top?) and doesn''t really tive the ring any credit. Perharps its becase there is too much contrast between the colours. Composition is good, but a bit on the boring side, since there is nothing to complement the ring. Especially the colour of the ''background'', which goes from light white to dark greenish. 5</td>', 'Nice colour. Lighting is a bit wierd (from top?) and doesn''t really tive the ring any credit. Perharps its becase there is too much contrast between the colours. Composition is good, but a bit on the boring side, since there is nothing to complement the ring. Especially the colour of the ''background'', which goes from light white to dark greenish. 5', '2005-04-29 00:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340579, 170355, 19708, '<td valign="top">I think this had a lot of potential.<br/>Something (in my opinion) that may be hurting this shot for me is the limited depth of field. The focus is a bit too soft on the prongs and the jewels, then falls away very rapidly. A little more in focus would make me not have to study it so hard to see what it really is. (5)</td>', 'I think this had a lot of potential.Something (in my opinion) that may be hurting this shot for me is the limited depth of field. The focus is a bit too soft on the prongs and the jewels, then falls away very rapidly. A little more in focus would make me not have to study it so hard to see what it really is. (5)', '2005-04-29 00:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340581, 168813, 25571, '<td valign="top">Way too much light and fuzzyness. The ring is not sharp and out of focus. I think the Aperture is to blame here. Text is too present, takes away from the item. Frame is a bit claustrophobic on the item as well. 4</td>', 'Way too much light and fuzzyness. The ring is not sharp and out of focus. I think the Aperture is to blame here. Text is too present, takes away from the item. Frame is a bit claustrophobic on the item as well. 4', '2005-04-29 00:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340584, 170316, 19708, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone studied how jewelry is displayed, looking at the cloth and the circular support - nicely done. Focus seems a bit too soft for me, but may be a result of image compression (jpeg artifacts showing) (6)</td>', 'Looks like someone studied how jewelry is displayed, looking at the cloth and the circular support - nicely done. Focus seems a bit too soft for me, but may be a result of image compression (jpeg artifacts showing) (6)', '2005-04-29 00:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340586, 168945, 25571, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is awesome! I really love this shot! Reminds me of the Sentinels in The MAtrix for some reason. Lots of movement which gives the rock a very ''organic'' feel. Colours are rich and lighting is dead on. Sharpness seems very good as well, but unfortunatly... and sadly... its SOOO SMALL! ARg! I want to get closer to my screen. I''d wished for something a bit closer. Text is also a bit too ''non existant''. Other then that, Very Very nice work! 8</td>', 'Wow, this is awesome! I really love this shot! Reminds me of the Sentinels in The MAtrix for some reason. Lots of movement which gives the rock a very ''organic'' feel. Colours are rich and lighting is dead on. Sharpness seems very good as well, but unfortunatly... and sadly... its SOOO SMALL! ARg! I want to get closer to my screen. I''d wished for something a bit closer. Text is also a bit too ''non existant''. Other then that, Very Very nice work! 8', '2005-04-29 00:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340588, 170238, 19708, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the prism, and well-suited for displaying the bracelet. B&amp;W works well with the new age theme here. A little more depth of field would have helped this, not having the natural main focal point out of focus (uppermost ball) (6)</td>', 'Interesting use of the prism, and well-suited for displaying the bracelet. B&W works well with the new age theme here. A little more depth of field would have helped this, not having the natural main focal point out of focus (uppermost ball) (6)', '2005-04-29 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340592, 169956, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.<br/>Lighting here is very well done in my opinion, with the right side falling off into the shadows. Detail &amp; clarity, as well as natural skin tones a plus. (7)</td>', 'Nice composition.Lighting here is very well done in my opinion, with the right side falling off into the shadows. Detail & clarity, as well as natural skin tones a plus. (7)', '2005-04-29 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340602, 170149, 19708, '<td valign="top">Seems to be 2 focal points in this shot - the light colored broach in the foreground, and the purple ring. The two I think could have been used together, but without another item to compete such as the quartz/stone they are resting on. Specs in background in a member''s challenge could have easily been cloned out, but something to pay attention to when shooting (I never seem them either until it''s on my monitor) (5)</td>', 'Seems to be 2 focal points in this shot - the light colored broach in the foreground, and the purple ring. The two I think could have been used together, but without another item to compete such as the quartz/stone they are resting on. Specs in background in a member''s challenge could have easily been cloned out, but something to pay attention to when shooting (I never seem them either until it''s on my monitor) (5)', '2005-04-29 00:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340612, 170081, 19708, '<td valign="top">A decent composition and tone acheived here. Subtle, soft, filling the frame and well lit. (perhaps a little too tight of a crop, especially at the bottom)<br/>Text/font used doesn''t work well here as an advertisement. (5)</td>', 'A decent composition and tone acheived here. Subtle, soft, filling the frame and well lit. (perhaps a little too tight of a crop, especially at the bottom)Text/font used doesn''t work well here as an advertisement. (5)', '2005-04-29 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340621, 168355, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very professional in composition and quality.<br/>Lighting is very well done and the text/font is perfect in it''s size, style &amp; placement.<br/>Perhaps one of the best in this challenge. (10)</td>', 'Very professional in composition and quality.Lighting is very well done and the text/font is perfect in it''s size, style & placement.Perhaps one of the best in this challenge. (10)', '2005-04-29 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340638, 168575, 37118, '<td valign="top">Clear</td>', 'Clear', '2005-04-29 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340667, 170339, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love this one! You have put a lot of thought into this, good suggestive setup, yet leaving plenty to the imagination. I do hope people will take the time to think about this one for a moment.</td>', 'I love this one! You have put a lot of thought into this, good suggestive setup, yet leaving plenty to the imagination. I do hope people will take the time to think about this one for a moment.', '2005-04-29 00:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340676, 170203, 19708, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feelings about the clash of all the color and the piece of jewelry. Nice colors and lay out, but in my opinion, the background is a bit too overpowering / busy. (5)</td>', 'I have mixed feelings about the clash of all the color and the piece of jewelry. Nice colors and lay out, but in my opinion, the background is a bit too overpowering / busy. (5)', '2005-04-29 00:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340685, 169734, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely laid out composition with a complimentary color for the background.<br/>Only thing that isn''t coming across well here is the style / size / spacing of the font. Not sure what may look better, just seems at odds with the watch. (6)</td>', 'Nicely laid out composition with a complimentary color for the background.Only thing that isn''t coming across well here is the style / size / spacing of the font. Not sure what may look better, just seems at odds with the watch. (6)', '2005-04-29 01:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340692, 169762, 21367, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting watch with a lot going on here.  I might have tried a different angle: (turned the watch slightly to right or left) 1. So it didn''t appear so calculated, the crop is tight and the watch face being square gives a boxed in feeling.  2. With a  different angle there would be more depth to to the shot and we might be able to pull more detail from the stones on the face.  <br/> <br/>Also I might have used more light, I don''t have a lightbox or tent so I would have rigged a set up with a white sheet and shinned lots of light from both sides through the sheet on to the watch in order to use a small f/stop to obtain focus through the whole shot.</td>', 'Quite an interesting watch with a lot going on here.  I might have tried a different angle: (turned the watch slightly to right or left) 1. So it didn''t appear so calculated, the crop is tight and the watch face being square gives a boxed in feeling.  2. With a  different angle there would be more depth to to the shot and we might be able to pull more detail from the stones on the face.   Also I might have used more light, I don''t have a lightbox or tent so I would have rigged a set up with a white sheet and shinned lots of light from both sides through the sheet on to the watch in order to use a small f/stop to obtain focus through the whole shot.', '2005-04-29 01:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340695, 169472, 6519, '<td valign="top">I would like this photo for an ad for sunglasses. Perhaps I''m boring, but I like the subject to be in focus, especially if you''re trying to sell me something.</td>', 'I would like this photo for an ad for sunglasses. Perhaps I''m boring, but I like the subject to be in focus, especially if you''re trying to sell me something.', '2005-04-29 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340702, 168679, 19708, '<td valign="top">As an advertisement, this is pretty busy. My eyes are drawn all over the shot.<br/>Lighting and reflections are a bit too harsh (easy to do) and image seems cropped too tight on the top, resulting in some of the jewelry being cut off. (5)</td>', 'As an advertisement, this is pretty busy. My eyes are drawn all over the shot.Lighting and reflections are a bit too harsh (easy to do) and image seems cropped too tight on the top, resulting in some of the jewelry being cut off. (5)', '2005-04-29 01:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340707, 170271, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the intent here and applaud you on pulling off a rather unusual &amp; difficult lighting job on just the earring.The skin tone has a less than natural / appealing greenish tone to it that seems to be clashing with the pink cheeks. (5)</td>', 'I like the intent here and applaud you on pulling off a rather unusual & difficult lighting job on just the earring.The skin tone has a less than natural / appealing greenish tone to it that seems to be clashing with the pink cheeks. (5)', '2005-04-29 01:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340712, 167997, 21367, '<td valign="top">Cute shot and lovely expression, however there is more emphasis on the little girl''s expression than the jewelry itself.  There could be two different approches to throw interest back on the ring.  Well thought out text or desaturating everything but the ring.  Lighting on the ring could have been a tad bit better as some of the detail is blown out a bit.</td>', 'Cute shot and lovely expression, however there is more emphasis on the little girl''s expression than the jewelry itself.  There could be two different approches to throw interest back on the ring.  Well thought out text or desaturating everything but the ring.  Lighting on the ring could have been a tad bit better as some of the detail is blown out a bit.', '2005-04-29 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340716, 169613, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice mood and great point of view. I want to buy this watch now! 9</td>', 'Nice mood and great point of view. I want to buy this watch now! 9', '2005-04-29 01:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340717, 169227, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super use of texture to make your point. Bold colors and nice, clear image. 9</td>', 'Super use of texture to make your point. Bold colors and nice, clear image. 9', '2005-04-29 01:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340725, 169252, 36469, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant, earth tone colours add that warm feel. Text is perfect, almost looks like it''s written on the paper. Wouldn''t change a thing about this picture</td>', 'Very simple and elegant, earth tone colours add that warm feel. Text is perfect, almost looks like it''s written on the paper. Wouldn''t change a thing about this picture', '2005-04-29 01:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340730, 169774, 36469, '<td valign="top">I have an obsession with martini glasses so the glass makes me love this real quick, the dark green background does a great job at making the glass and silver stand out. awesome!</td>', 'I have an obsession with martini glasses so the glass makes me love this real quick, the dark green background does a great job at making the glass and silver stand out. awesome!', '2005-04-29 01:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340738, 168575, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice broach or pin I believe.   With this piece of jewelry I might have gone with a plain black background.  The piece itself has a lot going on with all it''s festive colors there is no need to add anything that could distract the viewer.  <br/> <br/>If I had to go with the bug/flower theme that you are trying to achieve here, I might have done it in the shade to avoid the hot spots that seem to pull my eye to the left.   It is a colorful broach but the bright light on the petals is overbearing and draws me in that direction.  Cool concept.</td>', 'Very nice broach or pin I believe.   With this piece of jewelry I might have gone with a plain black background.  The piece itself has a lot going on with all it''s festive colors there is no need to add anything that could distract the viewer.   If I had to go with the bug/flower theme that you are trying to achieve here, I might have done it in the shade to avoid the hot spots that seem to pull my eye to the left.   It is a colorful broach but the bright light on the petals is overbearing and draws me in that direction.  Cool concept.', '2005-04-29 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340739, 170361, 36469, '<td valign="top">Very good and very professional. Colours, angle, text, everything. Only thing I''d suggest is to make the woman and background a little darker so the jewelry sticks out more.</td>', 'Very good and very professional. Colours, angle, text, everything. Only thing I''d suggest is to make the woman and background a little darker so the jewelry sticks out more.', '2005-04-29 01:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340743, 169563, 36469, '<td valign="top">Light effect is really cool, text should be smaller, takes up too much of my attention.</td>', 'Light effect is really cool, text should be smaller, takes up too much of my attention.', '2005-04-29 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340746, 169758, 36469, '<td valign="top">Definitely suited for a magazine, only problem is how blurry the watches look. Great layout!</td>', 'Definitely suited for a magazine, only problem is how blurry the watches look. Great layout!', '2005-04-29 01:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340749, 169302, 23772, '<td valign="top">The ring is a bit too small in the pic.</td>', 'The ring is a bit too small in the pic.', '2005-04-29 01:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340750, 170323, 36469, '<td valign="top">colours look great, angle doesn''t though... I''d get the whole watch in the picture on this one, at more of a diagonal angle.</td>', 'colours look great, angle doesn''t though... I''d get the whole watch in the picture on this one, at more of a diagonal angle.', '2005-04-29 01:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340751, 169741, 23772, '<td valign="top">Might be a tid better if the jewelry were more of the focus of the picture.</td>', 'Might be a tid better if the jewelry were more of the focus of the picture.', '2005-04-29 01:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
