(1341326, 169734, 15032, '<td valign="top">Very nice background and positioning, well done! 8</td>', 'Very nice background and positioning, well done! 8', '2005-04-29 04:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341328, 169467, 15032, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the blurred shells in the background add to the image<br/></td>', 'I''m not sure that the blurred shells in the background add to the image', '2005-04-29 04:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341329, 170149, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like the amethyst, it works well with this photo</td>', 'I like the amethyst, it works well with this photo', '2005-04-29 04:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341331, 170158, 15032, '<td valign="top">Good use of text placement on the black background,  good color for the subject as well</td>', 'Good use of text placement on the black background,  good color for the subject as well', '2005-04-29 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341334, 169963, 15032, '<td valign="top">I think that this photo would be more effective if the white card were removed from the box</td>', 'I think that this photo would be more effective if the white card were removed from the box', '2005-04-29 04:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341335, 170184, 15032, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop', '2005-04-29 04:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341344, 170309, 24128, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that my 10 year old daughter would be tempted by this :)<br/> <br/>For me I think that the image would better with the bottom 25% cropped - but I''m not a kid :)</td>', 'I''m sure that my 10 year old daughter would be tempted by this :) For me I think that the image would better with the bottom 25% cropped - but I''m not a kid :)', '2005-04-29 04:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341368, 169898, 12578, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light and DOF here, can''t suggest any improvements. Good shot</td>', 'Excellent use of light and DOF here, can''t suggest any improvements. Good shot', '2005-04-29 04:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341369, 169579, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great advert and good use of light just a shame I cannot see a little sparkle in the diamonds.</td>', 'Great advert and good use of light just a shame I cannot see a little sparkle in the diamonds.', '2005-04-29 04:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341371, 168965, 12578, '<td valign="top">Nice composition yet I feel your text is blending in at the top too much where this could have worked better at the bottom of the image.</td>', 'Nice composition yet I feel your text is blending in at the top too much where this could have worked better at the bottom of the image.', '2005-04-29 04:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341373, 170046, 12578, '<td valign="top">Nice skin tones, good light and crisp iamge, the only one improvement I can suggest here is that your models hand is a little on the rigid side and looks uncomfortable. Picky I know but the photography is brilliant. This should do very well.</td>', 'Nice skin tones, good light and crisp iamge, the only one improvement I can suggest here is that your models hand is a little on the rigid side and looks uncomfortable. Picky I know but the photography is brilliant. This should do very well.', '2005-04-29 04:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341374, 169840, 12578, '<td valign="top">I think that the desaturation here is not helping out at all as the effect of the jewellery has kind of camoflaged into the material, seems to look better rotated 90 degrees to the right strangely...</td>', 'I think that the desaturation here is not helping out at all as the effect of the jewellery has kind of camoflaged into the material, seems to look better rotated 90 degrees to the right strangely...', '2005-04-29 04:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341378, 169754, 19708, '<td valign="top">While not really looking like a jewelry advertisement, your composition is nicely laid out in that it was offset slightly, tipped back and not a dead straight static shot which capld have easily been done. The small stones do compliment the shot and the total white out of the background keeps the eyes where they belong. Some of the foreground stones being out of focus in some ways distracts me, but then again, lead my eyes inwards, where they should be going anyway.  (6)</td>', 'While not really looking like a jewelry advertisement, your composition is nicely laid out in that it was offset slightly, tipped back and not a dead straight static shot which capld have easily been done. The small stones do compliment the shot and the total white out of the background keeps the eyes where they belong. Some of the foreground stones being out of focus in some ways distracts me, but then again, lead my eyes inwards, where they should be going anyway.  (6)', '2005-04-29 04:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341383, 169714, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beauty &amp; the Beast approach!<br/>Nice composition, with the rose taking a bit too much of the focal point in my opinion.<br/>Lighting overall is good, with only a small area blown out on the forehead of the skull. (5)</td>', 'Beauty & the Beast approach!Nice composition, with the rose taking a bit too much of the focal point in my opinion.Lighting overall is good, with only a small area blown out on the forehead of the skull. (5)', '2005-04-29 05:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
