(1341788, 170320, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very unique approach with the color circles.  How''d you do that?  Looks like bokah but I know it isn''t.  Is it the background itself?  Hmmm...  Af for the actual jewelry image, it''s ok.  The top of the stone and gold band area are lit ok, maybe a bit hot, while the black ring blends into the background a little too much.  If you had lined the ring part up with one of the color circles it might have been more identifiable.  Anyway, good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Very unique approach with the color circles.  How''d you do that?  Looks like bokah but I know it isn''t.  Is it the background itself?  Hmmm...  Af for the actual jewelry image, it''s ok.  The top of the stone and gold band area are lit ok, maybe a bit hot, while the black ring blends into the background a little too much.  If you had lined the ring part up with one of the color circles it might have been more identifiable.  Anyway, good luck on the challenge.', '2005-04-29 08:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
