(1341917, 170081, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting.  The text works well with the ad as well.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting.  The text works well with the ad as well.', '2005-04-29 09:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341921, 169719, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but an unfortunate choice of text color...It''s difficult to read in places and takes the focus away from the beauty of the turquise in the ring.</td>', 'Nice composition but an unfortunate choice of text color...It''s difficult to read in places and takes the focus away from the beauty of the turquise in the ring.', '2005-04-29 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341923, 169563, 7466, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and lighting.  The starburst works quite well except where it is carried onto the gold of the ring.</td>', 'Very nice composition and lighting.  The starburst works quite well except where it is carried onto the gold of the ring.', '2005-04-29 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341924, 168816, 7466, '<td valign="top">Interesting bead, but the soft focus and harsh lighting make this photo unappealing.</td>', 'Interesting bead, but the soft focus and harsh lighting make this photo unappealing.', '2005-04-29 09:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341925, 169757, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much, but the color case is unappealing.</td>', 'I like the composition very much, but the color case is unappealing.', '2005-04-29 09:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341927, 169714, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  I just wonder what the brown is under the rose because my eye is being drawn to it.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  I just wonder what the brown is under the rose because my eye is being drawn to it.', '2005-04-29 09:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341929, 169694, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice high tone shot.  Interesting composition which definitely highlights the jewelry as an ad should.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice high tone shot.  Interesting composition which definitely highlights the jewelry as an ad should.  Great job.', '2005-04-29 09:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341932, 169954, 7466, '<td valign="top">You had the right idea for composition, but the lighting is a bit harsh and the focus too soft.</td>', 'You had the right idea for composition, but the lighting is a bit harsh and the focus too soft.', '2005-04-29 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341935, 169965, 7466, '<td valign="top">Excellently done.  Beautiful lighting, interesting composition and just the right amount of text too (lol).</td>', 'Excellently done.  Beautiful lighting, interesting composition and just the right amount of text too (lol).', '2005-04-29 09:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341937, 170323, 7466, '<td valign="top">Interesting floating affect.  I would only wish for the face of the watch to be tilted up a bit (but I''m betting you didn''t do that because of the scratches...sign of a well-loved, well-worn time piece :-D).</td>', 'Interesting floating affect.  I would only wish for the face of the watch to be tilted up a bit (but I''m betting you didn''t do that because of the scratches...sign of a well-loved, well-worn time piece :-D).', '2005-04-29 09:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341939, 169302, 7466, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, but the ring is not only so small it is nearly in visible, it isn''t the focal point of the photo.</td>', 'Cute concept, but the ring is not only so small it is nearly in visible, it isn''t the focal point of the photo.', '2005-04-29 09:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341940, 170358, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good use of DOF as well.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good use of DOF as well.', '2005-04-29 09:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341943, 169836, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good lighting.  The text is a perfect fit for the ad.</td>', 'Nice composition and good lighting.  The text is a perfect fit for the ad.', '2005-04-29 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341945, 169539, 20577, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very nice photo, but I think it could have been nicer if the focus was more in the necklace rather than the flower.</td>', 'I think this is a very nice photo, but I think it could have been nicer if the focus was more in the necklace rather than the flower.', '2005-04-29 09:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341946, 169970, 7466, '<td valign="top">The would have been a beautiful ad if I couldn''t see you and what looks like maybe a house or vehicle in the ring.</td>', 'The would have been a beautiful ad if I couldn''t see you and what looks like maybe a house or vehicle in the ring.', '2005-04-29 09:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341947, 169286, 7466, '<td valign="top">Beautifully constructed advertizement.  Nice composition and great lighting.</td>', 'Beautifully constructed advertizement.  Nice composition and great lighting.', '2005-04-29 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341949, 169609, 7466, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but there''s something missing...something to really make the photo scream "Wow!"</td>', 'Interesting idea, but there''s something missing...something to really make the photo scream "Wow!"', '2005-04-29 09:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341950, 169563, 20577, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I really like the lighting you used.</td>', 'Very nice... I really like the lighting you used.', '2005-04-29 09:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341952, 170051, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  I''d love a little more "wow" power on the stones.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  I''d love a little more "wow" power on the stones.', '2005-04-29 09:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341954, 169295, 7466, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea!  The only thing I find distracting is that big shadow from the ring.</td>', 'Interesting idea!  The only thing I find distracting is that big shadow from the ring.', '2005-04-29 09:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341957, 169873, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but uninteresting composition.  The soft focus doesn''t work well either.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but uninteresting composition.  The soft focus doesn''t work well either.', '2005-04-29 09:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341961, 170194, 7466, '<td valign="top">Good composition and concept.  I wonder if there was a way to better highlight the Tiffany stamp as I went looking for it because I understood the reference.  It''s sad to say that because of the decline in cultural literacy, many folks might not "get" the Breakfast part.</td>', 'Good composition and concept.  I wonder if there was a way to better highlight the Tiffany stamp as I went looking for it because I understood the reference.  It''s sad to say that because of the decline in cultural literacy, many folks might not "get" the Breakfast part.', '2005-04-29 09:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341963, 170153, 20577, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is just me, but it just seems a little blurry to me. I also think that a solid background may have put more of the focus on the pendant rather than trying to figure out what the background is.</td>', 'Maybe it is just me, but it just seems a little blurry to me. I also think that a solid background may have put more of the focus on the pendant rather than trying to figure out what the background is.', '2005-04-29 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341967, 170318, 7466, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition and conept.  Was there a way to brighten the bracelet any more within the rules?</td>', 'I really like this composition and conept.  Was there a way to brighten the bracelet any more within the rules?', '2005-04-29 09:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341968, 168595, 7466, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept.  However, the flower nearly overpowers the beautiful jewelry.</td>', 'Very interesting concept.  However, the flower nearly overpowers the beautiful jewelry.', '2005-04-29 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341971, 170363, 7466, '<td valign="top">Why the stones on the hand?  The lighting is a little low and the hand position is not appealing.</td>', 'Why the stones on the hand?  The lighting is a little low and the hand position is not appealing.', '2005-04-29 10:00:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1341975, 170201, 20577, '<td valign="top">This is the first one I have voted on that could actually be an a magazine.</td>', 'This is the first one I have voted on that could actually be an a magazine.', '2005-04-29 10:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341981, 170182, 20577, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark to me. If I was an advertiser I would want the actual jewelry to be visible to my customer. I do really like how they are set in the photo and the reflection. 6</td>', 'Seems a little dark to me. If I was an advertiser I would want the actual jewelry to be visible to my customer. I do really like how they are set in the photo and the reflection. 6', '2005-04-29 10:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341982, 168463, 7466, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful piece, but the soft focus and harsh lighting detracts from it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful piece, but the soft focus and harsh lighting detracts from it.', '2005-04-29 10:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341986, 169806, 7466, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  A little more sparkle from the diamond would have greatly improved this ad.</td>', 'Cute idea.  A little more sparkle from the diamond would have greatly improved this ad.', '2005-04-29 10:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341988, 170230, 7466, '<td valign="top">Pretty composition and nice lighting.  A very emotive advertizement.</td>', 'Pretty composition and nice lighting.  A very emotive advertizement.', '2005-04-29 10:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341993, 170361, 7466, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, though the rings might be better left out to showcase the lovely braclet, earring and necklace set.</td>', 'Very nice composition, though the rings might be better left out to showcase the lovely braclet, earring and necklace set.', '2005-04-29 10:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341996, 170364, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice ad.  Nostalgia is a great selling tool.</td>', 'Nice ad.  Nostalgia is a great selling tool.', '2005-04-29 10:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341999, 169821, 7466, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and lighting. Very nice looking ad.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and lighting. Very nice looking ad.', '2005-04-29 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342000, 170094, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great focus and wonderful light.  Excellent advertizement.</td>', 'Nice composition, great focus and wonderful light.  Excellent advertizement.', '2005-04-29 10:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342003, 169769, 7466, '<td valign="top">While the concept is nice, the "ball chain" clasp takes away from the idea of diamonds...the two are not usually associated with each other in a consumer''s mind.</td>', 'While the concept is nice, the "ball chain" clasp takes away from the idea of diamonds...the two are not usually associated with each other in a consumer''s mind.', '2005-04-29 10:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342007, 170046, 7466, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but maybe a closer crop to put the jewelry in more prominence in the shot would improve the ad.</td>', 'Nice concept, but maybe a closer crop to put the jewelry in more prominence in the shot would improve the ad.', '2005-04-29 10:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342009, 170343, 7466, '<td valign="top">Too cutsie for my taste, but a nice photograph.</td>', 'Too cutsie for my taste, but a nice photograph.', '2005-04-29 10:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342011, 169579, 7466, '<td valign="top">Excellent ad.  The composition and lighting are wonderful and the text quite catchy.</td>', 'Excellent ad.  The composition and lighting are wonderful and the text quite catchy.', '2005-04-29 10:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342018, 168769, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and ther lighting is great.  There is just something unappealing about seeing the posts and backs of the earrings in an ad.</td>', 'I like the composition and ther lighting is great.  There is just something unappealing about seeing the posts and backs of the earrings in an ad.', '2005-04-29 10:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342021, 170148, 7466, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but not an appealing ad.  Jewelry should be a "fun" purchase, not a battle.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but not an appealing ad.  Jewelry should be a "fun" purchase, not a battle.', '2005-04-29 10:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342084, 169754, 21851, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I enjoy the DOF on this one</td>', 'Very nice, I enjoy the DOF on this one', '2005-04-29 10:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342087, 170065, 21851, '<td valign="top">very nice, especially with the greenish reflection on the left of the watch</td>', 'very nice, especially with the greenish reflection on the left of the watch', '2005-04-29 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342088, 169873, 21851, '<td valign="top">good shot, great lighting</td>', 'good shot, great lighting', '2005-04-29 10:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342089, 169950, 21851, '<td valign="top">very well done</td>', 'very well done', '2005-04-29 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342090, 168965, 21851, '<td valign="top">a little bit dark but a great shot</td>', 'a little bit dark but a great shot', '2005-04-29 10:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342091, 170265, 21851, '<td valign="top">NICE...</td>', 'NICE...', '2005-04-29 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342093, 170079, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice composition.  It seems that the highlights on the gold area  bit harsh.  Still, this is quite magazine ad-esque.</td>', 'Great idea and nice composition.  It seems that the highlights on the gold area  bit harsh.  Still, this is quite magazine ad-esque.', '2005-04-29 10:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342095, 169563, 21851, '<td valign="top">great shot.... very nice detail and lighting</td>', 'great shot.... very nice detail and lighting', '2005-04-29 10:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342097, 168679, 21851, '<td valign="top">a little too close</td>', 'a little too close', '2005-04-29 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342102, 169734, 21851, '<td valign="top">great job, nice colors here</td>', 'great job, nice colors here', '2005-04-29 10:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342108, 169822, 21851, '<td valign="top">great colors, needed a bit more DOF</td>', 'great colors, needed a bit more DOF', '2005-04-29 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342117, 169861, 23053, '<td valign="top">Good job managing the reflections, and it looks like you even desaturated the reflections in the watch (either that or you colorized the fabric), or your watch is so expensive that it only reflects in that nice silvery color.  As far as the photo, it is very sharp, but the composition is a little stagnant with the watch being centered.  I''ll be utterly nit-picky and say that I wish the hands of the watch had a different orientation.  By the way, how many years did you have to go to school to learn how to fully utilize this watch?</td>', 'Good job managing the reflections, and it looks like you even desaturated the reflections in the watch (either that or you colorized the fabric), or your watch is so expensive that it only reflects in that nice silvery color.  As far as the photo, it is very sharp, but the composition is a little stagnant with the watch being centered.  I''ll be utterly nit-picky and say that I wish the hands of the watch had a different orientation.  By the way, how many years did you have to go to school to learn how to fully utilize this watch?', '2005-04-29 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342133, 167997, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo, but I wish the rings stood out more.  I like the way the photo is aranged, though.</td>', 'This is a cute photo, but I wish the rings stood out more.  I like the way the photo is aranged, though.', '2005-04-29 10:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342144, 169898, 23053, '<td valign="top">The overall photo is a bit dark for my tastes.  If the background were pure white, I think it could add even greater emphasis to the ring.  The color in the topaz is very beautiful, though.</td>', 'The overall photo is a bit dark for my tastes.  If the background were pure white, I think it could add even greater emphasis to the ring.  The color in the topaz is very beautiful, though.', '2005-04-29 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342151, 168507, 23053, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully professional.  Great depth of field.  Nice color choice for the font - mirrors the stone and doesn''t distract the eye.  This should do well.</td>', 'Wonderfully professional.  Great depth of field.  Nice color choice for the font - mirrors the stone and doesn''t distract the eye.  This should do well.', '2005-04-29 11:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342159, 170345, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The ring around the ''I'' is a bit murky, but overall, I think this is a good idea and set-up.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The ring around the ''I'' is a bit murky, but overall, I think this is a good idea and set-up.', '2005-04-29 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342166, 170051, 23053, '<td valign="top">For me, the rotation of the ring is not fitting for the ring itself.  Something about this piece of jewelry, in my eyes, calls for a basic horizontal orientation.  Other than that, I would like to see the sapphires a bit lighter.  I like your choice of background surface, though.</td>', 'For me, the rotation of the ring is not fitting for the ring itself.  Something about this piece of jewelry, in my eyes, calls for a basic horizontal orientation.  Other than that, I would like to see the sapphires a bit lighter.  I like your choice of background surface, though.', '2005-04-29 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342177, 169814, 23053, '<td valign="top">The fold in the fabric is distracting to me, as it seems as though it is hiding something.  Perhaps if this necklace were photographed around someone''s neck, it would have been more pleasing.  The amber looks a bit washed out to me, but overall, it has a nice color.  Also, it appears to be glowing - nice touch.</td>', 'The fold in the fabric is distracting to me, as it seems as though it is hiding something.  Perhaps if this necklace were photographed around someone''s neck, it would have been more pleasing.  The amber looks a bit washed out to me, but overall, it has a nice color.  Also, it appears to be glowing - nice touch.', '2005-04-29 11:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342187, 170316, 23053, '<td valign="top">While I like the overall set up here, I don''t like the bit of chain being out of focus in the foreground.  I like the lighting, despite the occasional hot spots, and, again, the composition is very interesting.</td>', 'While I like the overall set up here, I don''t like the bit of chain being out of focus in the foreground.  I like the lighting, despite the occasional hot spots, and, again, the composition is very interesting.', '2005-04-29 11:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342213, 170156, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the blur in this image to help accentuate the necklace, even though its almost too soft.  I do wonder why you chose to desaturate the gold as well as the model.  Something tells me this entry is getting a lot of views.</td>', 'I like the blur in this image to help accentuate the necklace, even though its almost too soft.  I do wonder why you chose to desaturate the gold as well as the model.  Something tells me this entry is getting a lot of views.', '2005-04-29 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342219, 168595, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the backdrop for the jewelry, and a very fitting one, at that.</td>', 'Interesting take on the backdrop for the jewelry, and a very fitting one, at that.', '2005-04-29 11:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342238, 170355, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the range of colors in the shot from red to white and most everything in between, but I would like to see more of the jewelry in focus (honstly, I am not sure what these are, but I am a man so that can be explained via stereotypes).</td>', 'I like the range of colors in the shot from red to white and most everything in between, but I would like to see more of the jewelry in focus (honstly, I am not sure what these are, but I am a man so that can be explained via stereotypes).', '2005-04-29 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342259, 169361, 33379, '<td valign="top">great pearls</td>', 'great pearls', '2005-04-29 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342261, 170361, 33379, '<td valign="top">great job</td>', 'great job', '2005-04-29 11:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342284, 170037, 23053, '<td valign="top">...and so are styrofoam peanuts?  Interesting, to say the least!</td>', '...and so are styrofoam peanuts?  Interesting, to say the least!', '2005-04-29 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342314, 169361, 23053, '<td valign="top">As something that I have fallen victim to myself, I have to wonder about your background color.  In the Wacky Foods challenge, my shot had a bright green background that was probably a mistake.  I think the background has a false look to it, and could have been better in a different, less dominate color.  I like the wood, but I think a different set up of the pearls could have been more pleasing, say if they were more spread out like vines on a log.</td>', 'As something that I have fallen victim to myself, I have to wonder about your background color.  In the Wacky Foods challenge, my shot had a bright green background that was probably a mistake.  I think the background has a false look to it, and could have been better in a different, less dominate color.  I like the wood, but I think a different set up of the pearls could have been more pleasing, say if they were more spread out like vines on a log.', '2005-04-29 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342471, 170184, 12573, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I wonder if a little more light coming from the left wouldn''t have helped the image though.  It''s a bit dark.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I wonder if a little more light coming from the left wouldn''t have helped the image though.  It''s a bit dark.  Good luck!', '2005-04-29 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342476, 169719, 6668, '<td valign="top">The text seems a little hard to read on this background, maybe a darker color would show more?</td>', 'The text seems a little hard to read on this background, maybe a darker color would show more?', '2005-04-29 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342484, 170357, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent stock photo.  Ring seems scratched a bit to my eye.  A well-worn friend, a piece of jewelry from someones hand, not off the shelf.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Excellent stock photo.  Ring seems scratched a bit to my eye.  A well-worn friend, a piece of jewelry from someones hand, not off the shelf.  Beautiful!', '2005-04-29 12:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342488, 169543, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice, I like the centered composition on the black background, the text works nicely too.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is quite nice, I like the centered composition on the black background, the text works nicely too.  Nicely done.', '2005-04-29 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342502, 169956, 20168, '<td valign="top">Tender and a key aspect of the wedding vow.  Good focus on the ring. Blessings.</td>', 'Tender and a key aspect of the wedding vow.  Good focus on the ring. Blessings.', '2005-04-29 12:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342508, 169714, 20168, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of this symbol of death next to a symbol of life/love.  IMO Light is too hot on the skull of the skull.  All the best.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of this symbol of death next to a symbol of life/love.  IMO Light is too hot on the skull of the skull.  All the best.', '2005-04-29 12:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342515, 170316, 20168, '<td valign="top">Focus issues here and background would work better in black or another complimentary color like purple.  Beautiful piece of jewelry and nice composition.</td>', 'Focus issues here and background would work better in black or another complimentary color like purple.  Beautiful piece of jewelry and nice composition.', '2005-04-29 12:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342519, 168569, 20168, '<td valign="top">Classy stock photo.  Text font doesn''t fit the photo IMO.  Good still life on the pieces.</td>', 'Classy stock photo.  Text font doesn''t fit the photo IMO.  Good still life on the pieces.', '2005-04-29 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342528, 169958, 20168, '<td valign="top">Quality stock photo.  Good focus, coloration, comp. Best of luck.</td>', 'Quality stock photo.  Good focus, coloration, comp. Best of luck.', '2005-04-29 12:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342537, 169254, 20168, '<td valign="top">Clever and appealing way to display.  Rings seem overwhelmed here imo.  Good lighting.  Creative.</td>', 'Clever and appealing way to display.  Rings seem overwhelmed here imo.  Good lighting.  Creative.', '2005-04-29 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342544, 170065, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lighting problems.  Location of light doesn''t highlight in a natural way the glory of this timepiece.  Timeless lighting is a bugger I''ll admit.  Great setting.  I love the contrast of rock and watch.</td>', 'Lighting problems.  Location of light doesn''t highlight in a natural way the glory of this timepiece.  Timeless lighting is a bugger I''ll admit.  Great setting.  I love the contrast of rock and watch.', '2005-04-29 12:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342552, 170156, 6668, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting idea, though I would have liked to seen the neclace in color with the rest in black and white, I think it would have more impact that way.</td>', 'I think this is an interesting idea, though I would have liked to seen the neclace in color with the rest in black and white, I think it would have more impact that way.', '2005-04-29 12:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342556, 170094, 6668, '<td valign="top">My eye keeps getting drawn to the red car in the background.<br/> <br/>Coming back after challenge, This is a comment I left on another photo, actually in the minimalism challenge, I was voting on both and my browser started going crazy lol, I apoligize for this.  I''m sure you were confused at my comment! LOL<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-02 00:09:50.</i></td>', 'My eye keeps getting drawn to the red car in the background. Coming back after challenge, This is a comment I left on another photo, actually in the minimalism challenge, I was voting on both and my browser started going crazy lol, I apoligize for this.  I''m sure you were confused at my comment! LOL', '2005-04-29 12:15:39.000000', '2005-05-02 01:09:50.000000', 1),
(1342557, 168507, 20168, '<td valign="top">Classy composition and colors.  Great layout.</td>', 'Classy composition and colors.  Great layout.', '2005-04-29 12:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342567, 170343, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is a cute picture though I don''t think it would work very well as an advertisement.</td>', 'This is a cute picture though I don''t think it would work very well as an advertisement.', '2005-04-29 12:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
