(1343381, 168355, 34868, '<td valign="top">SPOT ON well done one of the best i have seen (10) is all I can give</td>', 'SPOT ON well done one of the best i have seen (10) is all I can give', '2005-04-29 15:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343425, 169694, 17033, '<td valign="top">This is a very professional affair in terms of the composition, toning and text. This could so easily appear on the back of a magazine. Some may complain about the string lighting on the fingers but I think it really adds structure to the image. My only criticism is that, rightly or wrongly ,most jewellery ads tend to err on the side of ''glittery opulence'' whereas the ring here is quite flat.  High scorer nevertheless.</td>', 'This is a very professional affair in terms of the composition, toning and text. This could so easily appear on the back of a magazine. Some may complain about the string lighting on the fingers but I think it really adds structure to the image. My only criticism is that, rightly or wrongly ,most jewellery ads tend to err on the side of ''glittery opulence'' whereas the ring here is quite flat.  High scorer nevertheless.', '2005-04-29 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343431, 170201, 17033, '<td valign="top">Brillantly simple brilliance.</td>', 'Brillantly simple brilliance.', '2005-04-29 15:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343447, 169970, 8970, '<td valign="top">This would be much better if I didn''t see the reflection of the photographer in the ring.</td>', 'This would be much better if I didn''t see the reflection of the photographer in the ring.', '2005-04-29 15:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343466, 169694, 28299, '<td valign="top">Very professionally created. Nice clarity, easy to read and the simplicity of it is captivating. 9</td>', 'Very professionally created. Nice clarity, easy to read and the simplicity of it is captivating. 9', '2005-04-29 15:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343467, 170320, 17033, '<td valign="top">Bumping you up! Bet Only Keen Eyes Have spotted the visual pun.</td>', 'Bumping you up! Bet Only Keen Eyes Have spotted the visual pun.', '2005-04-29 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343471, 169822, 17033, '<td valign="top">Potentially very good but some mind-bending focusing going on.</td>', 'Potentially very good but some mind-bending focusing going on.', '2005-04-29 15:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343472, 169719, 8970, '<td valign="top">Really bad choice of word color, really difficult to read half of the words.</td>', 'Really bad choice of word color, really difficult to read half of the words.', '2005-04-29 15:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343476, 169444, 28299, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - Looks like something SNL would use on their show! 9 for uniqueness, clarity and tonal value.</td>', 'Wonderful - Looks like something SNL would use on their show! 9 for uniqueness, clarity and tonal value.', '2005-04-29 16:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343482, 169873, 17033, '<td valign="top">Bumping up......like the geometry and the red pastel shades</td>', 'Bumping up......like the geometry and the red pastel shades', '2005-04-29 16:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343484, 170118, 8970, '<td valign="top">Wish that there was a bit more space on the top of this picture.  Really good use of the reflection.  The background could have been a little bit lighter in color to help bring out the dark watch band.</td>', 'Wish that there was a bit more space on the top of this picture.  Really good use of the reflection.  The background could have been a little bit lighter in color to help bring out the dark watch band.', '2005-04-29 16:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343486, 169349, 28299, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection, but it might have been more captivating on pure white (I think it just is giving off a greyish cast). Also a little closer in to the watch might have added to clarity.</td>', 'I like the reflection, but it might have been more captivating on pure white (I think it just is giving off a greyish cast). Also a little closer in to the watch might have added to clarity.', '2005-04-29 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343490, 168475, 28299, '<td valign="top">Different idea, but a little crisper might have added to it. Not sure about the connotation of the text (it gives off some negativity).</td>', 'Different idea, but a little crisper might have added to it. Not sure about the connotation of the text (it gives off some negativity).', '2005-04-29 16:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343494, 170287, 28299, '<td valign="top">Great idea and layout. Maybe a little oversharpened, and the text maybe could be a slightly darker gray just to stand out but not to overshadow the jewelry. 8</td>', 'Great idea and layout. Maybe a little oversharpened, and the text maybe could be a slightly darker gray just to stand out but not to overshadow the jewelry. 8', '2005-04-29 16:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343497, 169227, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of colors. It''s delicate and stands out well. 8</td>', 'Nice choice of colors. It''s delicate and stands out well. 8', '2005-04-29 16:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343514, 170360, 8970, '<td valign="top">This would be so much nicer if everything was in focus.  You needed to use a greater depth of field.  The colors are great, the layout is great.  The lighting could be a little stonger in the bottom right hand corner.</td>', 'This would be so much nicer if everything was in focus.  You needed to use a greater depth of field.  The colors are great, the layout is great.  The lighting could be a little stonger in the bottom right hand corner.', '2005-04-29 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343520, 170358, 8970, '<td valign="top">The entire image is out of focus except for the bottom right hand corner.  Need to figure a better way to take a macro shot.</td>', 'The entire image is out of focus except for the bottom right hand corner.  Need to figure a better way to take a macro shot.', '2005-04-29 16:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343533, 170359, 8970, '<td valign="top">That red line is very distracting.  The bracelet is out of focus.  Not sure what suggestions to make to fix this....</td>', 'That red line is very distracting.  The bracelet is out of focus.  Not sure what suggestions to make to fix this....', '2005-04-29 16:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343539, 169579, 8970, '<td valign="top">Wish the cufflinks were a little lower in the picture and were not blocking the items in the background.</td>', 'Wish the cufflinks were a little lower in the picture and were not blocking the items in the background.', '2005-04-29 16:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343543, 168945, 8970, '<td valign="top">This was great on top until i scrolled down and saw the jewel.  I love the wispiness of the chain, but the jewel is lost too much in the black of the background.</td>', 'This was great on top until i scrolled down and saw the jewel.  I love the wispiness of the chain, but the jewel is lost too much in the black of the background.', '2005-04-29 16:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343561, 169256, 8970, '<td valign="top">A different darker background color would have helps this out a bunch</td>', 'A different darker background color would have helps this out a bunch', '2005-04-29 16:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343564, 170361, 34396, '<td valign="top">The focus on the jewelry is very nice.  I don''t know that I care for the "tonality"? of the rest of the photo.  The pinkish glow and cropping distracted me.  My first thought on seeing this photo was "The model looks bald"  It should have been "What great jewelry"  I''m giving this a "6"  The jewelry does stand out, has good lighting and focus.</td>', 'The focus on the jewelry is very nice.  I don''t know that I care for the "tonality"? of the rest of the photo.  The pinkish glow and cropping distracted me.  My first thought on seeing this photo was "The model looks bald"  It should have been "What great jewelry"  I''m giving this a "6"  The jewelry does stand out, has good lighting and focus.', '2005-04-29 16:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343568, 170326, 34396, '<td valign="top">I think this might have done better with a dark background.  The white gold and diamonds get lost on the white background.</td>', 'I think this might have done better with a dark background.  The white gold and diamonds get lost on the white background.', '2005-04-29 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343569, 169541, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and arrangement of this photo.  Nice crisp image!</td>', 'I like the contrast and arrangement of this photo.  Nice crisp image!', '2005-04-29 16:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343577, 168945, 19035, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the challenge - great job.</td>', 'My favorite for the challenge - great job.', '2005-04-29 16:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343578, 170361, 19035, '<td valign="top">Very professional - wonderful 9.</td>', 'Very professional - wonderful 9.', '2005-04-29 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1);
