(1343697, 170165, 33435, '<td valign="top">fossil when accuracy matters.  This photo -  when getting a lot of 10''s matter!  I can''t see this not placing in the top three.  Good luck.  This my favorite image in the challenge.</td>', 'fossil when accuracy matters.  This photo -  when getting a lot of 10''s matter!  I can''t see this not placing in the top three.  Good luck.  This my favorite image in the challenge.', '2005-04-29 17:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343704, 169954, 33435, '<td valign="top">I can tell you had a difficult time with this subject, in comparison to the difficulty I had with mine.  This could have used a longer exposure, of course with the proper aperature adjustments.  It would have cleaned up the lighting a bit and there is a very harsh reflection of the lighting used in the gem.</td>', 'I can tell you had a difficult time with this subject, in comparison to the difficulty I had with mine.  This could have used a longer exposure, of course with the proper aperature adjustments.  It would have cleaned up the lighting a bit and there is a very harsh reflection of the lighting used in the gem.', '2005-04-29 17:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343706, 169919, 33435, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Definitely one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Very well done!  Definitely one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-04-29 17:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343710, 169950, 33435, '<td valign="top">If you found those in grandma''s attic, I''m coming over.  Seriously, this would make a great advertisement.</td>', 'If you found those in grandma''s attic, I''m coming over.  Seriously, this would make a great advertisement.', '2005-04-29 17:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343718, 170156, 33435, '<td valign="top">this would have been better if you could have selectively desaturated, so that the necklace remained gold.  The title is drawing me into gold, and I don''t see any.  Normally I don''t include title critiques as part of my voting, but this challenge was for an advertisement.</td>', 'this would have been better if you could have selectively desaturated, so that the necklace remained gold.  The title is drawing me into gold, and I don''t see any.  Normally I don''t include title critiques as part of my voting, but this challenge was for an advertisement.', '2005-04-29 17:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
