(1344529, 170037, 20679, '<td valign="top">the styrofoam/polystyreme peanuts seem a little incongruous in this context and the bowl is rather centered which to me at least breaks the natural flow of the pearls. A lower POV might have rendered some interesting reflections in the bowl and you would have had a shot with an original message. For me I don''t think this quite achieves the effect you are looking for in an ad.</td>', 'the styrofoam/polystyreme peanuts seem a little incongruous in this context and the bowl is rather centered which to me at least breaks the natural flow of the pearls. A lower POV might have rendered some interesting reflections in the bowl and you would have had a shot with an original message. For me I don''t think this quite achieves the effect you are looking for in an ad.', '2005-04-29 21:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
