(1344748, 168507, 8891, '<td valign="top">The graphic and look of the add are quite good. Like the placement of the ring in the frame for an ad. Think the ring image itself it good compositionally, but I would have liked to have seen more of it in focus. Good job handling the lighting, no blowouts and you minimized the reflections.</td>', 'The graphic and look of the add are quite good. Like the placement of the ring in the frame for an ad. Think the ring image itself it good compositionally, but I would have liked to have seen more of it in focus. Good job handling the lighting, no blowouts and you minimized the reflections.', '2005-04-29 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
