(1345039, 169694, 25464, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well.  Some people may pick on the blown highlights and the extreme lightness of the hand but this, to me, looks like an ad from a very high end store.  I hope others see the art in it.  This like an example of knowing what the rules are and then breaking them on purpose to achieve the desired effect. 10 from me.</td>', 'I hope this does well.  Some people may pick on the blown highlights and the extreme lightness of the hand but this, to me, looks like an ad from a very high end store.  I hope others see the art in it.  This like an example of knowing what the rules are and then breaking them on purpose to achieve the desired effect. 10 from me.', '2005-04-30 00:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345047, 170079, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail on the subject.  The background is a little overwhelming, but I do not think that would have been the case with text added to fill some of the space.  Great work. 9.</td>', 'Great lighting and detail on the subject.  The background is a little overwhelming, but I do not think that would have been the case with text added to fill some of the space.  Great work. 9.', '2005-04-30 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
