(1345094, 169286, 36231, '<td valign="top">I can almost see this in a magazine! :)  Nothing really flashy about it, but it does the trick.</td>', 'I can almost see this in a magazine! :)  Nothing really flashy about it, but it does the trick.', '2005-04-30 00:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345100, 169541, 36231, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it would have been nicer were the jewels closer together.  It took a minute for my eyes to focus on the jewelry, they kept straying to the shells.</td>', 'I like the concept, but it would have been nicer were the jewels closer together.  It took a minute for my eyes to focus on the jewelry, they kept straying to the shells.', '2005-04-30 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345103, 169963, 36231, '<td valign="top">A closer crop would have been nicer, with different lighting to make the jewels shine.</td>', 'A closer crop would have been nicer, with different lighting to make the jewels shine.', '2005-04-30 00:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345105, 169958, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely lighting. one of a small few where I feel like I can say this.</td>', 'lovely lighting. one of a small few where I feel like I can say this.', '2005-04-30 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345107, 170079, 36231, '<td valign="top">I like the jewel frog on the bark.  Good lighting, but if only the jewels were shining! :)</td>', 'I like the jewel frog on the bark.  Good lighting, but if only the jewels were shining! :)', '2005-04-30 00:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345109, 170156, 17507, '<td valign="top">if it''s gold... then why is this b/w?</td>', 'if it''s gold... then why is this b/w?', '2005-04-30 00:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345113, 170094, 31628, '<td valign="top">Text needs different font and shouldn''t be pixellated.  Photo is nice.</td>', 'Text needs different font and shouldn''t be pixellated.  Photo is nice.', '2005-04-30 00:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345116, 170148, 36231, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  It would do better with a closer crop, better lighting to reduce the shadows, and the gold should shine.</td>', 'Nice concept.  It would do better with a closer crop, better lighting to reduce the shadows, and the gold should shine.', '2005-04-30 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345118, 170153, 36231, '<td valign="top">I wish the picture was clearer.  You almost got the shine, but the pendant is slightly out of focus.  Nice concept, tho.</td>', 'I wish the picture was clearer.  You almost got the shine, but the pendant is slightly out of focus.  Nice concept, tho.', '2005-04-30 00:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345121, 170290, 31628, '<td valign="top">Good photo, needs text.  Background color works well.</td>', 'Good photo, needs text.  Background color works well.', '2005-04-30 00:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345124, 169719, 36231, '<td valign="top">The font is very hard to read.  Should have used black.  The lighting is very good, ring is clear.  The font really hurts this.</td>', 'The font is very hard to read.  Should have used black.  The lighting is very good, ring is clear.  The font really hurts this.', '2005-04-30 00:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345126, 168769, 36231, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Simple, elegant, nice.  Good work!</td>', 'I like this.  Simple, elegant, nice.  Good work!', '2005-04-30 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345129, 170358, 36231, '<td valign="top">The background (skin?) is giving the diamonds an orange color.  I wish the lighting was better to give the jewels a shine.</td>', 'The background (skin?) is giving the diamonds an orange color.  I wish the lighting was better to give the jewels a shine.', '2005-04-30 00:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345131, 170046, 17507, '<td valign="top">hi, arnit. *wink*<br/>great job matching the font used in cartier''s logo. though the placement looks rather arbitrary to me.</td>', 'hi, arnit. *wink*great job matching the font used in cartier''s logo. though the placement looks rather arbitrary to me.', '2005-04-30 00:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345133, 169958, 36231, '<td valign="top">Clear photo ...  The off center crop is distracting, and it would have done better right side up.  I keep wanting to turn my head.</td>', 'Clear photo ...  The off center crop is distracting, and it would have done better right side up.  I keep wanting to turn my head.', '2005-04-30 00:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345136, 170156, 36231, '<td valign="top">You say all you need is gold, but it''s in black and white.  And the cleavage does nothing for the jewelry.</td>', 'You say all you need is gold, but it''s in black and white.  And the cleavage does nothing for the jewelry.', '2005-04-30 00:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345138, 170361, 17507, '<td valign="top">great color treatment - the jewelry really stands out. the typography is good too, though perhaps just a wee bit small, and I think the text in the upper right ("The fine art . . .") should have been vertically aligned with the script at the edge. (7)</td>', 'great color treatment - the jewelry really stands out. the typography is good too, though perhaps just a wee bit small, and I think the text in the upper right ("The fine art . . .") should have been vertically aligned with the script at the edge. (7)', '2005-04-30 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345139, 170361, 36231, '<td valign="top">Awesome concept!  Lighting is great, hue and sat is great ... I''m buying these! :)</td>', 'Awesome concept!  Lighting is great, hue and sat is great ... I''m buying these! :)', '2005-04-30 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345142, 169903, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting it stes the period. BTW the hands should be set at 10 to it is more aethetically pleasing. 8</td>', 'I like the lighting it stes the period. BTW the hands should be set at 10 to it is more aethetically pleasing. 8', '2005-04-30 00:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345144, 170331, 36231, '<td valign="top">Nice concept ... too much seems out of focus, tho.  And my eyes keep going to the shell trying to figure out what''s inside it.</td>', 'Nice concept ... too much seems out of focus, tho.  And my eyes keep going to the shell trying to figure out what''s inside it.', '2005-04-30 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345147, 169578, 36231, '<td valign="top">Simple and basic ... good job.</td>', 'Simple and basic ... good job.', '2005-04-30 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345149, 170174, 17507, '<td valign="top">some things to think about-<br/>1. seems like "Will you marry me?" should have been enclosed in quotation marks.<br/>2. the next line is "Say it with flowers," but there''s only one flower...<br/>3. if we''re supposed to say it with flowers, what is the ring doing there?<br/>4. if this is a jewelry advertisement, why should we say it with flowers?<br/> <br/>(4)</td>', 'some things to think about-1. seems like "Will you marry me?" should have been enclosed in quotation marks.2. the next line is "Say it with flowers," but there''s only one flower...3. if we''re supposed to say it with flowers, what is the ring doing there?4. if this is a jewelry advertisement, why should we say it with flowers? (4)', '2005-04-30 00:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345150, 169227, 24983, '<td valign="top">well pur together I like it but I think the pink rose is a little to powerful  7</td>', 'well pur together I like it but I think the pink rose is a little to powerful  7', '2005-04-30 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345151, 169877, 36231, '<td valign="top">Good job ... I just wish those diamonds were shining!</td>', 'Good job ... I just wish those diamonds were shining!', '2005-04-30 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345153, 170343, 17507, '<td valign="top">the challenge is to make a jewelry <i>advertisement</i>, and while there is jewelry in this photo, it does not look like an advertisement. I do not think this meets the challenge</td>', 'the challenge is to make a jewelry advertisement, and while there is jewelry in this photo, it does not look like an advertisement. I do not think this meets the challenge', '2005-04-30 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345155, 169148, 31628, '<td valign="top">That''s funny!  Interesting texture too.</td>', 'That''s funny!  Interesting texture too.', '2005-04-30 00:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345156, 168595, 36231, '<td valign="top">The flower is too distracting.  The colors blend, and the jewel doesn''t jump right out at me.   A less exotic flower may have done better.  It was a good concept, tho. :)</td>', 'The flower is too distracting.  The colors blend, and the jewel doesn''t jump right out at me.   A less exotic flower may have done better.  It was a good concept, tho. :)', '2005-04-30 00:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345159, 170080, 17507, '<td valign="top">is the text at the bottom all in the same font size? it looks very strange and chunky. 6 - would have been 7 but the text is really throwing me off.</td>', 'is the text at the bottom all in the same font size? it looks very strange and chunky. 6 - would have been 7 but the text is really throwing me off.', '2005-04-30 00:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345161, 169741, 24983, '<td valign="top">good Idea but falls down slightly in that the watch seems to take a back seat  and the face is ovwexposed  5</td>', 'good Idea but falls down slightly in that the watch seems to take a back seat  and the face is ovwexposed  5', '2005-04-30 00:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345163, 170252, 24983, '<td valign="top">Good Idea but to much ear IMO  8</td>', 'Good Idea but to much ear IMO  8', '2005-04-30 00:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345164, 169821, 36231, '<td valign="top">Others tried to do the sea theme with pearls ... you did it right.  This is great.  The lighting gives just the right shine to the pearls.  I''ll run right out and buy em! :)</td>', 'Others tried to do the sea theme with pearls ... you did it right.  This is great.  The lighting gives just the right shine to the pearls.  I''ll run right out and buy em! :)', '2005-04-30 00:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345166, 170166, 17507, '<td valign="top">killer lighting and background. I like the subtlety. while this image is not in-your-face in the way many advertisements are, it is still direct and its product is clear. I can easily imagine this being in a magazine. the one thing I might want to change would be that I''d try burning in the hand a bit, to put more emphasis on the wrist and watch. (8)</td>', 'killer lighting and background. I like the subtlety. while this image is not in-your-face in the way many advertisements are, it is still direct and its product is clear. I can easily imagine this being in a magazine. the one thing I might want to change would be that I''d try burning in the hand a bit, to put more emphasis on the wrist and watch. (8)', '2005-04-30 00:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345172, 170149, 17507, '<td valign="top">I find myself more drawn to the amethyst ring than the pendant. i wish it were more prominent in this picture.</td>', 'I find myself more drawn to the amethyst ring than the pendant. i wish it were more prominent in this picture.', '2005-04-30 00:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345175, 169840, 17507, '<td valign="top">great texture, lovely lighting, impressive jewelry collection - but it doesn''t really look like an advertising image to me. the rings here are <i>part</i> of the composition and not the sole focus.</td>', 'great texture, lovely lighting, impressive jewelry collection - but it doesn''t really look like an advertising image to me. the rings here are part of the composition and not the sole focus.', '2005-04-30 00:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345181, 169286, 18748, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of perfect advertisement for me. Silver looks absolutely real,nothing extra is on the picture. Wish you to win with this, 10</td>', 'This is a great example of perfect advertisement for me. Silver looks absolutely real,nothing extra is on the picture. Wish you to win with this, 10', '2005-04-30 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345210, 168679, 714, '<td valign="top">Very pretty gems.  Nice colors and composition.  The only thing I see wrong is the focus is a bit off.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very pretty gems.  Nice colors and composition.  The only thing I see wrong is the focus is a bit off.  Good luck!', '2005-04-30 00:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345211, 169714, 18748, '<td valign="top">Like it,but the only thing that bothers me its a shines on the ring, 8</td>', 'Like it,but the only thing that bothers me its a shines on the ring, 8', '2005-04-30 00:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345214, 169919, 714, '<td valign="top">Kewl looking ring.  I like the flower with it.  Lighting is good..maybe a light from the back left to prevent the shadow.  Good luck!</td>', 'Kewl looking ring.  I like the flower with it.  Lighting is good..maybe a light from the back left to prevent the shadow.  Good luck!', '2005-04-30 00:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345222, 170224, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the background color. Looks very romantic.  The lighting is good, but maybe a f/11 or more to get more of the jewerly in focus.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the background color. Looks very romantic.  The lighting is good, but maybe a f/11 or more to get more of the jewerly in focus.  Good luck.', '2005-04-30 01:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345224, 170232, 714, '<td valign="top">This would have been a perfect shot if it was in focus.  Good luck.</td>', 'This would have been a perfect shot if it was in focus.  Good luck.', '2005-04-30 01:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345229, 170065, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  I like the rocks and focus.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice set up.  I like the rocks and focus.  Good luck.', '2005-04-30 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345238, 168507, 714, '<td valign="top">Lovely Lovely image!  I like the colors and the white background.  Would have liked more dof but I still like it a lot.  Good luck. 9</td>', 'Lovely Lovely image!  I like the colors and the white background.  Would have liked more dof but I still like it a lot.  Good luck. 9', '2005-04-30 01:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345244, 170364, 714, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  How could you make it better in my oppinion...hmmm.. put a white board infront of the rings so you can''t see the reflections and back up a little so I can see more of the rings.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great lighting.  How could you make it better in my oppinion...hmmm.. put a white board infront of the rings so you can''t see the reflections and back up a little so I can see more of the rings.  Good luck.', '2005-04-30 01:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345246, 168959, 714, '<td valign="top">A little to dark, but I really like the curves and composition you used.  Good luck!</td>', 'A little to dark, but I really like the curves and composition you used.  Good luck!', '2005-04-30 01:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345253, 169444, 714, '<td valign="top">LOL..I love it.  Couldn''t get anymore perfect then this.  10 Good luck.</td>', 'LOL..I love it.  Couldn''t get anymore perfect then this.  10 Good luck.', '2005-04-30 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345255, 170149, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice work here.  Lighting is a bit dull, but not to bad. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice work here.  Lighting is a bit dull, but not to bad. Good luck.', '2005-04-30 01:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345259, 170318, 714, '<td valign="top">I really like what you have going on here. The only thing that bugs me is the bottom arm.  Nice and clean shot.  Good luck. 8</td>', 'I really like what you have going on here. The only thing that bugs me is the bottom arm.  Nice and clean shot.  Good luck. 8', '2005-04-30 01:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
