(1345267, 170080, 714, '<td valign="top">Oh very nice!  I like the masculine feel to it.  I bet this would sell to any guy out there.  Great lighting and focus!  10</td>', 'Oh very nice!  I like the masculine feel to it.  I bet this would sell to any guy out there.  Great lighting and focus!  10', '2005-04-30 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
