(1345281, 170234, 714, '<td valign="top">Very kewl!  I like the desaturation here.  She has a great look too. Good luck. 7</td>', 'Very kewl!  I like the desaturation here.  She has a great look too. Good luck. 7', '2005-04-30 01:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
