(1345289, 170366, 714, '<td valign="top">The pictures is great, but the text reminds me of the midas tire place.  won''t knock your score for it though..good luck. 7</td>', 'The pictures is great, but the text reminds me of the midas tire place.  won''t knock your score for it though..good luck. 7', '2005-04-30 01:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
