(1348016, 168769, 1031, '<td valign="top">Those are nice pieces; good exposure and detail for a relatively long (non-macro) shot.</td>', 'Those are nice pieces; good exposure and detail for a relatively long (non-macro) shot.', '2005-04-30 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348030, 170361, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job bringing out the jewelry, and the type works too --  though I usually make it a little bolder if it''s reversed type for use in a print ad, as that can sometimes plug up on the press and become less-readable.</td>', 'Good job bringing out the jewelry, and the type works too --  though I usually make it a little bolder if it''s reversed type for use in a print ad, as that can sometimes plug up on the press and become less-readable.', '2005-04-30 22:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348036, 170065, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting to leave space for the text.</td>', 'Good use of lighting to leave space for the text.', '2005-04-30 22:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348058, 169774, 36231, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and I like the geometric feel.  And I like the simple black and white.</td>', 'Good composition, and I like the geometric feel.  And I like the simple black and white.', '2005-04-30 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348060, 168507, 36231, '<td valign="top">Good lighting ... simple and elegant.</td>', 'Good lighting ... simple and elegant.', '2005-04-30 22:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348068, 170065, 36231, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but there are too many shadows that are distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, but there are too many shadows that are distracting.', '2005-04-30 22:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348072, 170149, 36231, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it took me a minute to see the amethyst ring.</td>', 'I like the concept, but it took me a minute to see the amethyst ring.', '2005-04-30 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348074, 170080, 36231, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the rocks and water, and it''s a good clear picture of the watch face.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the rocks and water, and it''s a good clear picture of the watch face.', '2005-04-30 22:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348117, 170278, 36231, '<td valign="top">Excellent - of all the reptile and amphibian jewelry, I like this the best! :)  The water adds a distinct touch.  And the gold is shining! :)</td>', 'Excellent - of all the reptile and amphibian jewelry, I like this the best! :)  The water adds a distinct touch.  And the gold is shining! :)', '2005-04-30 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348234, 170309, 28299, '<td valign="top">Clever ad, good font to use for the text, colors blend well.</td>', 'Clever ad, good font to use for the text, colors blend well.', '2005-04-30 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348241, 168939, 28299, '<td valign="top">A little over-sharpened, but nice layout. 7</td>', 'A little over-sharpened, but nice layout. 7', '2005-04-30 23:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348292, 170080, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the rocks as background.</td>', 'I like the look of the rocks as background.', '2005-05-01 00:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348312, 168575, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the veining in the wings, texture in the petals on the right. Lighting looks a little harsher than necessary for my taste.</td>', 'I like the veining in the wings, texture in the petals on the right. Lighting looks a little harsher than necessary for my taste.', '2005-05-01 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348321, 170331, 1031, '<td valign="top">The shell makes for a very interesting presentation; very nice "pearly" color on the pearls.</td>', 'The shell makes for a very interesting presentation; very nice "pearly" color on the pearls.', '2005-05-01 00:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348338, 169354, 1031, '<td valign="top">Something "bothers" me about the crop/composition; maybe crop more off the top?</td>', 'Something "bothers" me about the crop/composition; maybe crop more off the top?', '2005-05-01 00:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348359, 170366, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty gold gold alright; nice detail.</td>', 'That''s pretty gold gold alright; nice detail.', '2005-05-01 00:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348368, 168945, 1031, '<td valign="top">Type is a little too subtle on my monitor -- I''d have made it a bit brighter.</td>', 'Type is a little too subtle on my monitor -- I''d have made it a bit brighter.', '2005-05-01 00:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348443, 170182, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection. Unfortunatly, the fact that the reflection is almost as ''crisp'' as the actual jewel makes it hard to distinguish which is which. Lighting is not strong enought and makes the picture suffer from poor sharpness. a tighter composition or some text would''ve helped. 6</td>', 'Interesting reflection. Unfortunatly, the fact that the reflection is almost as ''crisp'' as the actual jewel makes it hard to distinguish which is which. Lighting is not strong enought and makes the picture suffer from poor sharpness. a tighter composition or some text would''ve helped. 6', '2005-05-01 00:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348445, 168959, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, i like the movement this shot offers. Unfortunatly lighting is poor and sharpness suffers greatly. Colours are a bit stale too. 6</td>', 'Cool idea, i like the movement this shot offers. Unfortunatly lighting is poor and sharpness suffers greatly. Colours are a bit stale too. 6', '2005-05-01 00:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348450, 170318, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I like the way this is presented, unfortunatly, the bottom part is cut and is bugging me quite a bit. Also the text suffered from compression as its uneven. Nice little frame too. 7</td>', 'Cool idea. I like the way this is presented, unfortunatly, the bottom part is cut and is bugging me quite a bit. Also the text suffered from compression as its uneven. Nice little frame too. 7', '2005-05-01 00:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348453, 168939, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to show the ring. Lighting is interesting, especially the way it splits the picture in half. Text is unfortunatly way too much to read and takes too much space, taking lots away from the jewel itself. Not sure on the texturized background tho, kind of takes away from the lustrate and shinny ring. 6</td>', 'Interesting way to show the ring. Lighting is interesting, especially the way it splits the picture in half. Text is unfortunatly way too much to read and takes too much space, taking lots away from the jewel itself. Not sure on the texturized background tho, kind of takes away from the lustrate and shinny ring. 6', '2005-05-01 00:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348459, 168965, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Composition is rather weaks, i feel it cuts away from the mood of the shot by ''cutting'' the bowl the jewels stand on. Lighting is not very effective either, especially on the bracelet on the left. Nice sharpness tho. Keep at it! 6</td>', 'Interesting idea. Composition is rather weaks, i feel it cuts away from the mood of the shot by ''cutting'' the bowl the jewels stand on. Lighting is not very effective either, especially on the bracelet on the left. Nice sharpness tho. Keep at it! 6', '2005-05-01 00:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348467, 169472, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. The look is original and the DOF is nice as well. I''m not sure why you choose not to put the jewels in focus, but it does well in showing the ''size'', but not the ''quality'' of th eproduct. Model is interesting and very glamourous. One thing i don''t like is the right eye with the glasses effect (kind of buggy). Other then that, nice work, just wished i''d see the jewels better. 8</td>', 'Very nice composition. The look is original and the DOF is nice as well. I''m not sure why you choose not to put the jewels in focus, but it does well in showing the ''size'', but not the ''quality'' of th eproduct. Model is interesting and very glamourous. One thing i don''t like is the right eye with the glasses effect (kind of buggy). Other then that, nice work, just wished i''d see the jewels better. 8', '2005-05-01 00:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348472, 170345, 25571, '<td valign="top">NIce effect, not sure how you did it, but its interesting. Unfortunatly i really don''t like the ''low quality'' shadow in the background, i feel it could''ve been a lot better. The I do is original but takes too much away from the already very dark ring. Not enought sharpness and detail on the ring either. 5</td>', 'NIce effect, not sure how you did it, but its interesting. Unfortunatly i really don''t like the ''low quality'' shadow in the background, i feel it could''ve been a lot better. The I do is original but takes too much away from the already very dark ring. Not enought sharpness and detail on the ring either. 5', '2005-05-01 00:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348476, 170331, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Lighting on the pearls is neat, but doesn''t give much to go on. The Shell decoration takes too much place in the picture in my opinion. 6</td>', 'Cute idea. Lighting on the pearls is neat, but doesn''t give much to go on. The Shell decoration takes too much place in the picture in my opinion. 6', '2005-05-01 00:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348480, 169950, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice work! Sharpness of the rings are nice, and the DOF is good as well! (5.6?). Text is a bit wierd, probably suffered too much from the compression, but that''s ok, in a mag, it wouldn''t show like that so its forgivable ;) All i can say is thank god for Macro..(?!). 7</td>', 'Nice work! Sharpness of the rings are nice, and the DOF is good as well! (5.6?). Text is a bit wierd, probably suffered too much from the compression, but that''s ok, in a mag, it wouldn''t show like that so its forgivable ;) All i can say is thank god for Macro..(?!). 7', '2005-05-01 00:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348491, 169734, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very strong and rich lighting on this picture. The gold effect of the watch is very stunning. I''m not very keen on the background colour tho; the monochrome effect seems to take lots away. Text is good if perharps a bit too intrusive for my taste, its colour is a good choice. I have a few hickups about the bracelet tho, there are wierd lighting spots (reflection?) which kind of take away from the nice leather effect. Very good selection of ''time'' (that was my big mistake in this challenge) as it doesn''t obstruct the name or important informations on the watch. Good work! 7</td>', 'Very strong and rich lighting on this picture. The gold effect of the watch is very stunning. I''m not very keen on the background colour tho; the monochrome effect seems to take lots away. Text is good if perharps a bit too intrusive for my taste, its colour is a good choice. I have a few hickups about the bracelet tho, there are wierd lighting spots (reflection?) which kind of take away from the nice leather effect. Very good selection of ''time'' (that was my big mistake in this challenge) as it doesn''t obstruct the name or important informations on the watch. Good work! 7', '2005-05-01 00:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348494, 170349, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, although the rings could''ve used lots more sharpness. Lighting seems too much and the shadow work on the white background is very buggy. 5</td>', 'Interesting idea, although the rings could''ve used lots more sharpness. Lighting seems too much and the shadow work on the white background is very buggy. 5', '2005-05-01 00:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348502, 168475, 25571, '<td valign="top">Wierd but, this shot is rather ''dark'' and ''scary''.. with the eyes in the background. Lighting is quite wrong as there are spots of white, blue and red everywhere. Ring is not sharp enought to make it out properly. text is funny, if a bit non-existant. There''s this beige spot on the lower left that bugs me quite a bit too. 5</td>', 'Wierd but, this shot is rather ''dark'' and ''scary''.. with the eyes in the background. Lighting is quite wrong as there are spots of white, blue and red everywhere. Ring is not sharp enought to make it out properly. text is funny, if a bit non-existant. There''s this beige spot on the lower left that bugs me quite a bit too. 5', '2005-05-01 01:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348507, 170074, 25571, '<td valign="top">That''s quite expensive for a candle...*just kiddin* ;) Lighting is interesting and the reflection gives this shot something interesting, just wished there''d be a little bit more. Too bad we don''t see the jewel that much. Text is too intrusive for my taste and the colour is a bit harsh for the candle''s pinkish look. 6</td>', 'That''s quite expensive for a candle...*just kiddin* ;) Lighting is interesting and the reflection gives this shot something interesting, just wished there''d be a little bit more. Too bad we don''t see the jewel that much. Text is too intrusive for my taste and the colour is a bit harsh for the candle''s pinkish look. 6', '2005-05-01 01:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348509, 169814, 25571, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very harsh and the jewels are not very sharp. Text is simple but not very interesting. (like the little dots). 5</td>', 'Lighting is very harsh and the jewels are not very sharp. Text is simple but not very interesting. (like the little dots). 5', '2005-05-01 01:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348514, 169491, 25571, '<td valign="top">LOL, well another trekker on DPC, cool. Authentic, that i''d have to see! Cool shot, although there really is nothing ''special'' about it unfortunatly. I''d loved to see a very hard ''Klingon Empire'' themed setting with the jewel (metal, rust, red, dirty...). 6</td>', 'LOL, well another trekker on DPC, cool. Authentic, that i''d have to see! Cool shot, although there really is nothing ''special'' about it unfortunatly. I''d loved to see a very hard ''Klingon Empire'' themed setting with the jewel (metal, rust, red, dirty...). 6', '2005-05-01 01:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348516, 170041, 25571, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit too unidirectional. Makes wierd shadows. Composition is ok, althought the upper dark thing gets in the way. 6</td>', 'Lighting is a bit too unidirectional. Makes wierd shadows. Composition is ok, althought the upper dark thing gets in the way. 6', '2005-05-01 01:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348523, 170323, 25571, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been fun to have more light on the face of the watch. Lighting itself ain''t bad, but ain''t special either. Grey background makes the pic quite stale. DOF is good tho. 6</td>', 'Would''ve been fun to have more light on the face of the watch. Lighting itself ain''t bad, but ain''t special either. Grey background makes the pic quite stale. DOF is good tho. 6', '2005-05-01 01:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348527, 169252, 28359, '<td valign="top">This is Great! the Diamonds really pop....over all 10</td>', 'This is Great! the Diamonds really pop....over all 10', '2005-05-01 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348529, 169349, 25571, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh and uncontroled, reflection is quite weak and doesn''t seem planned. Time displayed is not flattering for the watch make. Composition is boring. no background doesn''t help. Keep at it. 4</td>', 'Lighting is harsh and uncontroled, reflection is quite weak and doesn''t seem planned. Time displayed is not flattering for the watch make. Composition is boring. no background doesn''t help. Keep at it. 4', '2005-05-01 01:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348552, 170224, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting curvy composition and presentation. DOF is good and intriguig, colour is sharp and appealing. I''d wish for a little bit more sharpness on the ring, perhaps some more contrast as well. Text is a bit too flashy for my taste, but is non intrusive, which is good. A frame (black or dark) would do very well here. 7</td>', 'Interesting curvy composition and presentation. DOF is good and intriguig, colour is sharp and appealing. I''d wish for a little bit more sharpness on the ring, perhaps some more contrast as well. Text is a bit too flashy for my taste, but is non intrusive, which is good. A frame (black or dark) would do very well here. 7', '2005-05-01 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348581, 167997, 19708, '<td valign="top">Cute shot and put a smile on my face when I saw it.<br/>Not really sure this fits the "classic" Jewelry Advertising look, but this one will probably by far be more meaningful years down the road. (5)</td>', 'Cute shot and put a smile on my face when I saw it.Not really sure this fits the "classic" Jewelry Advertising look, but this one will probably by far be more meaningful years down the road. (5)', '2005-05-01 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348597, 170343, 19708, '<td valign="top">Ahh...kids being kids.<br/>From a Jewerly Advertisement standpoint, this probably wouldn''t work too well with the sepia toning used. Shadows from the flash add a certain element of harshness, but not all of us can have expensive equipment at our disposal.<br/>Thanks for sharing a cute shot, that I''m sure will be far more meaningful in years otcome than just a macro picture of a ring or similar. (5)</td>', 'Ahh...kids being kids.From a Jewerly Advertisement standpoint, this probably wouldn''t work too well with the sepia toning used. Shadows from the flash add a certain element of harshness, but not all of us can have expensive equipment at our disposal.Thanks for sharing a cute shot, that I''m sure will be far more meaningful in years otcome than just a macro picture of a ring or similar. (5)', '2005-05-01 01:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348643, 169968, 10686, '<td valign="top">Reminds me more of Brancusi than Dali, but anyway, a nice clean job of lighting. The double shadows are bit bit distracting.</td>', 'Reminds me more of Brancusi than Dali, but anyway, a nice clean job of lighting. The double shadows are bit bit distracting.', '2005-05-01 01:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
