(1348831, 170265, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unusually bright in a way, and is certainly one to pop off the page.<br/>The Red/Orange is bolder than it really should be for an advertisement. The chice of the blue text to match the color of the stone would normally be good, but is very difficult to read against that color background. (5)</td>', 'Unusually bright in a way, and is certainly one to pop off the page.The Red/Orange is bolder than it really should be for an advertisement. The chice of the blue text to match the color of the stone would normally be good, but is very difficult to read against that color background. (5)', '2005-05-01 05:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348833, 170079, 19708, '<td valign="top">Pleasant shot to look at, with natural colors.<br/>Background is complimentary with a natural feel and the lighting on the jewelry brought out it''s colors. Detail level is good as is composition.<br/>The title may be a bit too "cute" for advertising. (6)</td>', 'Pleasant shot to look at, with natural colors.Background is complimentary with a natural feel and the lighting on the jewelry brought out it''s colors. Detail level is good as is composition.The title may be a bit too "cute" for advertising. (6)', '2005-05-01 05:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348834, 170080, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really excellent setup and composition. This is one of my favorite images in this challenge.</td>', 'Really excellent setup and composition. This is one of my favorite images in this challenge.', '2005-05-01 05:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348835, 169877, 19708, '<td valign="top">As I sat here looking at this shot, I struggled to figure out what it was that was so different about it then it suddenly hit me - the white border/framing.<br/>This is a case of the border/framing actually working for the shot instead of against it. An advertisement would/could look very similar to this kind of lay out.<br/>Composition is decent and the red in the background adds dimension instead of the jewelry floating in space. Overall, a pretty good take on the challenge. (6)<br/></td>', 'As I sat here looking at this shot, I struggled to figure out what it was that was so different about it then it suddenly hit me - the white border/framing.This is a case of the border/framing actually working for the shot instead of against it. An advertisement would/could look very similar to this kind of lay out.Composition is decent and the red in the background adds dimension instead of the jewelry floating in space. Overall, a pretty good take on the challenge. (6)', '2005-05-01 05:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348836, 169861, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous image with outstanding lighting and focus. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous image with outstanding lighting and focus. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-01 05:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348837, 169836, 19708, '<td valign="top">B &amp; W works well here, and I like the offset comosition of this shot.<br/>Your text / font is a style that seems to work with this, as it''s not gawdy, nor too big.<br/>Overall a pretty decent shot with one minor distraction: The black spots on the metal. (6)<br/></td>', 'B & W works well here, and I like the offset comosition of this shot.Your text / font is a style that seems to work with this, as it''s not gawdy, nor too big.Overall a pretty decent shot with one minor distraction: The black spots on the metal. (6)', '2005-05-01 05:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348838, 168960, 19952, '<td valign="top">The detail in this shot is amazing and you did an outstanding job with the setup and lighting. Very nicely done!</td>', 'The detail in this shot is amazing and you did an outstanding job with the setup and lighting. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-01 05:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348839, 168945, 26679, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, I would have prefered slightly greater depth of field to show more of the Neclace, however I appreciate this has been deliberatly chosen my you, for the affect.</td>', 'Clever idea, I would have prefered slightly greater depth of field to show more of the Neclace, however I appreciate this has been deliberatly chosen my you, for the affect.', '2005-05-01 05:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348840, 168355, 26679, '<td valign="top">Well composed and taken shot. A general observation would be that the picture would have soightly more balance of the secoond hand were at about 31 or 32 seconds</td>', 'Well composed and taken shot. A general observation would be that the picture would have soightly more balance of the secoond hand were at about 31 or 32 seconds', '2005-05-01 05:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348901, 170309, 35750, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. I think you could have done better on the lightning though. Did you use backround lighting solely? Maybe you could have gotten a greater depth in the color of the crossing string in the upper part by using some kind of a spotlight or a different colour light, perhaps blue.</td>', 'I like the concept. I think you could have done better on the lightning though. Did you use backround lighting solely? Maybe you could have gotten a greater depth in the color of the crossing string in the upper part by using some kind of a spotlight or a different colour light, perhaps blue.', '2005-05-01 08:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348903, 169539, 35750, '<td valign="top">Did you try many setups for this one? I like the concept, just wandering in you could have made it a little more interesting by movingt the "chain"  to the foreground. (I´m not shure it would make a difference). I find the flower a little soft. Like the picture though.</td>', 'Did you try many setups for this one? I like the concept, just wandering in you could have made it a little more interesting by movingt the "chain"  to the foreground. (I´m not shure it would make a difference). I find the flower a little soft. Like the picture though.', '2005-05-01 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348904, 169630, 35750, '<td valign="top">You seem to have a double reflection from the mirror. The first from the glass itself, and the 2nd. from the aluminium (the mirror itself). Did you try to avoid this by using a different setup of ligths? I find the concept allright, but the double reflection disturbs me.</td>', 'You seem to have a double reflection from the mirror. The first from the glass itself, and the 2nd. from the aluminium (the mirror itself). Did you try to avoid this by using a different setup of ligths? I find the concept allright, but the double reflection disturbs me.', '2005-05-01 08:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348983, 170174, 26679, '<td valign="top">Excellent Idea, and composition, my concern is that the light relected off the ring makes it look a little out of focus...</td>', 'Excellent Idea, and composition, my concern is that the light relected off the ring makes it look a little out of focus...', '2005-05-01 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348986, 169694, 26679, '<td valign="top">The colour selection here complements the whole mood of the image.</td>', 'The colour selection here complements the whole mood of the image.', '2005-05-01 10:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348990, 168679, 26679, '<td valign="top">for me the reflections on the stones and settings gives the impression of being slightly out of focus...</td>', 'for me the reflections on the stones and settings gives the impression of being slightly out of focus...', '2005-05-01 10:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348998, 169970, 26679, '<td valign="top">The idea and composition are very good. I can see you took this outside to gain maximum light, its a shame your reflection together with the background and sky is sheown in the ring. <br/>A light tent would help manage reflections</td>', 'The idea and composition are very good. I can see you took this outside to gain maximum light, its a shame your reflection together with the background and sky is sheown in the ring. A light tent would help manage reflections', '2005-05-01 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349012, 169252, 37217, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this advertisment, it looks very clean yet appropriate!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this advertisment, it looks very clean yet appropriate!', '2005-05-01 11:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349021, 169754, 37217, '<td valign="top">thats a really neat idea, i love the way the colors play off of each other.</td>', 'thats a really neat idea, i love the way the colors play off of each other.', '2005-05-01 11:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349031, 169256, 26679, '<td valign="top">great refracted colours and and a wonderful capture</td>', 'great refracted colours and and a wonderful capture', '2005-05-01 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349035, 170318, 332, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Top 3 without a doubt. The lighting is just perfect. Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea. Top 3 without a doubt. The lighting is just perfect. Good luck.', '2005-05-01 11:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349055, 170041, 20679, '<td valign="top">Highlight on the ring is a bit distracting. I like how you have left space for text in the right hand corner creating a balanced composition</td>', 'Highlight on the ring is a bit distracting. I like how you have left space for text in the right hand corner creating a balanced composition', '2005-05-01 11:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349057, 170166, 23053, '<td valign="top">One of the more inventive uses of text in this challenge and a wonderfully professional shot, at that.  It looks ripped from the pages of some overly glossy magazine.  Good luck and nice hair.</td>', 'One of the more inventive uses of text in this challenge and a wonderfully professional shot, at that.  It looks ripped from the pages of some overly glossy magazine.  Good luck and nice hair.', '2005-05-01 11:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349058, 169714, 19978, '<td valign="top">While I don''t care for the ring, you''ve created a tremendously appealing photo advertisement. Use of lighting, vignetting, shadows is just excellent. Very well done!</td>', 'While I don''t care for the ring, you''ve created a tremendously appealing photo advertisement. Use of lighting, vignetting, shadows is just excellent. Very well done!', '2005-05-01 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349059, 169252, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice set-up and composition.  I don''t think the company name is necessary, but I do like the text and font in the main message.  The green ribbon is a nice choice as it stands out well, but is not too overpowering.</td>', 'Nice set-up and composition.  I don''t think the company name is necessary, but I do like the text and font in the main message.  The green ribbon is a nice choice as it stands out well, but is not too overpowering.', '2005-05-01 11:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349060, 169919, 20679, '<td valign="top">nice comp and use of negative space. Shadow is well controlled</td>', 'nice comp and use of negative space. Shadow is well controlled', '2005-05-01 11:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349061, 170278, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the set-up but am slightly turned off by the flash.  Parts of the lizard look at bit over exposed, but all in all, I think this is a good entry.</td>', 'I like the set-up but am slightly turned off by the flash.  Parts of the lizard look at bit over exposed, but all in all, I think this is a good entry.', '2005-05-01 11:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349062, 170166, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! I feel like I''m reading SI or US News. Definitely advertisement material and belies a very talented photographer behind the lens.</td>', 'Outstanding! I feel like I''m reading SI or US News. Definitely advertisement material and belies a very talented photographer behind the lens.', '2005-05-01 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349064, 170263, 23053, '<td valign="top">The saturation and contrast in this shot are interesting and bold, but they do make it a bit difficult to tell the true color of the jewelry.  I am sure it is blue, but how blue?</td>', 'The saturation and contrast in this shot are interesting and bold, but they do make it a bit difficult to tell the true color of the jewelry.  I am sure it is blue, but how blue?', '2005-05-01 11:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349065, 169898, 20679, '<td valign="top">excellent detail and control of reflections. Shadow is a bit harsh</td>', 'excellent detail and control of reflections. Shadow is a bit harsh', '2005-05-01 11:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349066, 169734, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very well done ad, but I think with that copy, you''d have wanted to show off that curve.</td>', 'Very well done ad, but I think with that copy, you''d have wanted to show off that curve.', '2005-05-01 11:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349070, 170051, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding job. Good dof with such close-up detail!</td>', 'Outstanding job. Good dof with such close-up detail!', '2005-05-01 11:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349072, 170195, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel of your shot, but I do have to comment on the placement of your model''s hand...at first glance I thought she was picking her nose.  Granted, it could just be me...it probably is just me.</td>', 'I like the overall feel of your shot, but I do have to comment on the placement of your model''s hand...at first glance I thought she was picking her nose.  Granted, it could just be me...it probably is just me.', '2005-05-01 11:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349074, 169970, 20679, '<td valign="top">Can see you in the ring''s reflection! That would not be a good thing for an advertisment.Background is nice but lighting is very flat</td>', 'Can see you in the ring''s reflection! That would not be a good thing for an advertisment.Background is nice but lighting is very flat', '2005-05-01 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349076, 169968, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. Great sense for how to compose and crop. Photo gets a 9 from me. Wish you had added some "ad copy."</td>', 'Simply beautiful. Great sense for how to compose and crop. Photo gets a 9 from me. Wish you had added some "ad copy."', '2005-05-01 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349081, 169354, 20679, '<td valign="top">cutting themodel''s head off is not usually a good plan....and I''m afraid the shadow reduces the impact a lot. Focus is good</td>', 'cutting themodel''s head off is not usually a good plan....and I''m afraid the shadow reduces the impact a lot. Focus is good', '2005-05-01 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349082, 170194, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like your slogan...quite clever, but I think the jewelry could have been a bit brighter, or maybe have a different exposure.  In my eyes, it''s hard to get a good impression of what the jewelry is.</td>', 'I like your slogan...quite clever, but I think the jewelry could have been a bit brighter, or maybe have a different exposure.  In my eyes, it''s hard to get a good impression of what the jewelry is.', '2005-05-01 11:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349084, 169774, 19978, '<td valign="top">My hat is off. This is a superb photo of publication quality. Great vision and imagination went in to the making of this photo.</td>', 'My hat is off. This is a superb photo of publication quality. Great vision and imagination went in to the making of this photo.', '2005-05-01 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349086, 168355, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great control over reflections and light.  You even took the shot at 10:10...seems to be the most accepted time to photograph a watch.  Also, thanks for using a short exposure time to keep the second hand from blurring.</td>', 'Great control over reflections and light.  You even took the shot at 10:10...seems to be the most accepted time to photograph a watch.  Also, thanks for using a short exposure time to keep the second hand from blurring.', '2005-05-01 11:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349090, 169295, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the long shadows in this shot...helps with the mood.  Also, I like how the reflection and shadow inside the ring looks like a dividing cell, also a fitting relationship to the shot.</td>', 'I like the long shadows in this shot...helps with the mood.  Also, I like how the reflection and shadow inside the ring looks like a dividing cell, also a fitting relationship to the shot.', '2005-05-01 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349093, 169903, 23053, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your choice of font or font color here.  I think your shot of the watches is nice, despite what looks like a slight yellow cast, but the cast does add a feeling of nostalgia of some sort, so perhaps that is fitting.</td>', 'I don''t like your choice of font or font color here.  I think your shot of the watches is nice, despite what looks like a slight yellow cast, but the cast does add a feeling of nostalgia of some sort, so perhaps that is fitting.', '2005-05-01 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349094, 168960, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great close up shot and wonderful lighting.  This should fair quite well, so good luck.</td>', 'Great close up shot and wonderful lighting.  This should fair quite well, so good luck.', '2005-05-01 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349095, 170153, 23053, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to be suffering from some digital artifacting...those jagged edges.  Also, the lighting is harsh, making it difficult to sort out the fine detail of the shot.</td>', 'This shot seems to be suffering from some digital artifacting...those jagged edges.  Also, the lighting is harsh, making it difficult to sort out the fine detail of the shot.', '2005-05-01 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349101, 169256, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I like the abstract feel of all of the refracted light.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I like the abstract feel of all of the refracted light.', '2005-05-01 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349104, 170081, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but the text is distracting.  Either a different choice of font or no text at all could have improved the entry.</td>', 'This is a great shot but the text is distracting.  Either a different choice of font or no text at all could have improved the entry.', '2005-05-01 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349110, 169954, 33182, '<td valign="top">I only have two problems with this picture....<br/>1. the red is a little overpowering<br/>2. the DOF could have been a little deeper to get more of the ring in focus.</td>', 'I only have two problems with this picture....1. the red is a little overpowering2. the DOF could have been a little deeper to get more of the ring in focus.', '2005-05-01 12:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349113, 170360, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like the background (the part under the earings) but the left side distracts from the overall picture. Would have been nice to have seen more of the sparkly background instead.</td>', 'I like the background (the part under the earings) but the left side distracts from the overall picture. Would have been nice to have seen more of the sparkly background instead.', '2005-05-01 12:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349115, 169354, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting here is too harsh, as it casts some odd shadows and makes many hot spots of the jewelry.  Granted, it also casts some interesting reflections on your model''s skin.</td>', 'I think the lighting here is too harsh, as it casts some odd shadows and makes many hot spots of the jewelry.  Granted, it also casts some interesting reflections on your model''s skin.', '2005-05-01 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349118, 169822, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting depth of feild.  I can''t quite figure out what I''m looking at, or how it is shaped, but all in all it is an intriguing shot.  Nice color, as well.</td>', 'Interesting depth of feild.  I can''t quite figure out what I''m looking at, or how it is shaped, but all in all it is an intriguing shot.  Nice color, as well.', '2005-05-01 12:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349124, 170183, 23053, '<td valign="top">Möglicherweise eine schnellere Blendenverschlußgeschwindigkeit, zum der dritten Hand von verwischt werden zu halten. Ich mag Inszenierung und Aufbau Ihrer Fotographie.<br/> <br/>If this didn''t make sense, I''m sorry.  I tried to translate using dictionary.com.</td>', 'Möglicherweise eine schnellere Blendenverschlußgeschwindigkeit, zum der dritten Hand von verwischt werden zu halten. Ich mag Inszenierung und Aufbau Ihrer Fotographie. If this didn''t make sense, I''m sorry.  I tried to translate using dictionary.com.', '2005-05-01 12:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349128, 170340, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like the simplisticness of this. The only thing I''d change would be to get a little bit more light on the head of the ring (but only the head).</td>', 'I like the simplisticness of this. The only thing I''d change would be to get a little bit more light on the head of the ring (but only the head).', '2005-05-01 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349129, 170172, 33182, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. The model isn''t too distracting, however she is slightly distracting. Would have worked better with a bigger earing.</td>', 'I love this picture. The model isn''t too distracting, however she is slightly distracting. Would have worked better with a bigger earing.', '2005-05-01 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349131, 170149, 33182, '<td valign="top">I really like the set-up for this. Only thing I''d change is get rid of the shadow under the jewel.</td>', 'I really like the set-up for this. Only thing I''d change is get rid of the shadow under the jewel.', '2005-05-01 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349133, 170366, 33182, '<td valign="top">Love this. The font works great too. Only thing I''d like is to have a little more negative space UNDER the rings.</td>', 'Love this. The font works great too. Only thing I''d like is to have a little more negative space UNDER the rings.', '2005-05-01 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349136, 169757, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring on the font with the background. Nice tight DOF too, but maybe move it to the head of the jewel instead of the back.</td>', 'Nice coloring on the font with the background. Nice tight DOF too, but maybe move it to the head of the jewel instead of the back.', '2005-05-01 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349137, 167997, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice picture overall, only problem I have is it appears that my eyes are conflicted. They want to look at the girls eyes, but at the same time the rings. It''s distracting. Other than that it''s a really nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture overall, only problem I have is it appears that my eyes are conflicted. They want to look at the girls eyes, but at the same time the rings. It''s distracting. Other than that it''s a really nice picture.', '2005-05-01 12:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349138, 168507, 33182, '<td valign="top">Only comment I have is the DOF could have been a tad deeper (to encompass the whole leading edge of the ring and the stone). I really like this though.</td>', 'Only comment I have is the DOF could have been a tad deeper (to encompass the whole leading edge of the ring and the stone). I really like this though.', '2005-05-01 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349139, 169563, 23053, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the finer examples of using and controling reflections to make an interesting shot.  While parts of the ring are a bit dull, the overall shot is one of the best, in my eyes.</td>', 'Probably one of the finer examples of using and controling reflections to make an interesting shot.  While parts of the ring are a bit dull, the overall shot is one of the best, in my eyes.', '2005-05-01 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349140, 169968, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like your use of the background, the only problem is the double shadow is distracting.</td>', 'I like your use of the background, the only problem is the double shadow is distracting.', '2005-05-01 12:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349143, 170290, 33182, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but your background is distracting. Sorry.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but your background is distracting. Sorry.', '2005-05-01 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349145, 169396, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light is caught on the right edge of the ring. However, I''m distracted by the reflection on your foreground. It would also be helpful if the leading edge of the ring had some more light on it. You can''t really see the band.</td>', 'I like the way the light is caught on the right edge of the ring. However, I''m distracted by the reflection on your foreground. It would also be helpful if the leading edge of the ring had some more light on it. You can''t really see the band.', '2005-05-01 12:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349147, 170359, 33182, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the red line is part of it or not, but it''s distracting. Also the DOF seems off. Could just be my eyes though.</td>', 'I don''t know if the red line is part of it or not, but it''s distracting. Also the DOF seems off. Could just be my eyes though.', '2005-05-01 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349148, 168945, 23053, '<td valign="top">Astounding depth of field with great color.  The layout to match the curves of a snake is just subtle enough not to be overpowering but without going unnoticed.  This looks consumately professional.  Have fun winning the challenge!</td>', 'Astounding depth of field with great color.  The layout to match the curves of a snake is just subtle enough not to be overpowering but without going unnoticed.  This looks consumately professional.  Have fun winning the challenge!', '2005-05-01 12:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349149, 169714, 33182, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the skull and the rose. Nice work.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the skull and the rose. Nice work.', '2005-05-01 12:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349150, 170158, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this picture. Nice job.', '2005-05-01 12:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349152, 170086, 33182, '<td valign="top">LOL, I like the color of the ape for the background, but the ape head is distracting.</td>', 'LOL, I like the color of the ape for the background, but the ape head is distracting.', '2005-05-01 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349153, 170361, 33182, '<td valign="top">I''m torn here....At one point I like the way she''s all dark, but at another I don''t like it. I just can''t make up my mind. However, I love the way it augments the brighter jewelry.</td>', 'I''m torn here....At one point I like the way she''s all dark, but at another I don''t like it. I just can''t make up my mind. However, I love the way it augments the brighter jewelry.', '2005-05-01 12:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349155, 170305, 33182, '<td valign="top">Only two problems I have with this photo are that the lower words are out of focus while the upper words are very crisp, along with the glare on the top of the ring. Nice shot though. I love the light blue background.</td>', 'Only two problems I have with this photo are that the lower words are out of focus while the upper words are very crisp, along with the glare on the top of the ring. Nice shot though. I love the light blue background.', '2005-05-01 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349156, 169968, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but most of all I like the reflections in the glass that add even greater depth to the shot.</td>', 'I like the composition, but most of all I like the reflections in the glass that add even greater depth to the shot.', '2005-05-01 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1349157, 170278, 33182, '<td valign="top">Love the setting, think it might have worked a little better with lighter colored rocks.</td>', 'Love the setting, think it might have worked a little better with lighter colored rocks.', '2005-05-01 12:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349159, 170230, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. The rocks are nice and clearly in focus, however for some reason the rings don''t appear to be in focus even though they are inside the DOF. &lt;shrug&gt; I''m not sure, I''m guessing it''s just an optical illusion on my part.</td>', 'I like this shot. The rocks are nice and clearly in focus, however for some reason the rings don''t appear to be in focus even though they are inside the DOF. <shrug> I''m not sure, I''m guessing it''s just an optical illusion on my part.', '2005-05-01 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349162, 169467, 23053, '<td valign="top">Considering the number of shells in the background, I think a slighty deeper depth of feild would have been more appealing.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have yeilded the same effect, though.</td>', 'Considering the number of shells in the background, I think a slighty deeper depth of feild would have been more appealing.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have yeilded the same effect, though.', '2005-05-01 12:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349163, 169630, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like this ring, the black background is nice, I just don''t like the reflection. Could have been a tad lighter.</td>', 'I like this ring, the black background is nice, I just don''t like the reflection. Could have been a tad lighter.', '2005-05-01 12:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349164, 169821, 33182, '<td valign="top">GREAT!!!!! I just love this one!!! ***10*** I''d give you an 13 if I could.</td>', 'GREAT!!!!! I just love this one!!! ***10*** I''d give you an 13 if I could.', '2005-05-01 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349166, 169467, 33182, '<td valign="top">WOW, I like the black jewel.</td>', 'WOW, I like the black jewel.', '2005-05-01 12:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
