(1349557, 170172, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m drawn more to her eyes than to the earring...need to find a way to make it pop more.</td>', 'I''m drawn more to her eyes than to the earring...need to find a way to make it pop more.', '2005-05-01 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349562, 169694, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot, but for advertising a piece of jewelry, I''m not sure sepia is a good choice.  A good shot like this will grab a consumers attention, but to get them interested in buying the piece, they''re going to want to see what color it is.</td>', 'I like the image a lot, but for advertising a piece of jewelry, I''m not sure sepia is a good choice.  A good shot like this will grab a consumers attention, but to get them interested in buying the piece, they''re going to want to see what color it is.', '2005-05-01 15:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349565, 170345, 28141, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept and the shadow effect is great, but I think the ring by the text needs to be in full focus color and brigtness (i.e. use the shadow part of the ad to set the mood, use the part by the text to display the piece in full detail).</td>', 'I really like the concept and the shadow effect is great, but I think the ring by the text needs to be in full focus color and brigtness (i.e. use the shadow part of the ad to set the mood, use the part by the text to display the piece in full detail).', '2005-05-01 15:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349567, 170355, 28141, '<td valign="top">I think to advertise a piece of jewelry you need to be able to see most if not all of it.  Needs more depth of field.</td>', 'I think to advertise a piece of jewelry you need to be able to see most if not all of it.  Needs more depth of field.', '2005-05-01 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349569, 168569, 28141, '<td valign="top">Are you advertising jewelry or Arizona?  Needs to be clear to be effective.</td>', 'Are you advertising jewelry or Arizona?  Needs to be clear to be effective.', '2005-05-01 15:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
