(1350601, 170172, 5705, '<td valign="top">great Portrait, I think that my eye doesnt naturally go to the ear though, its super high quality, but not a WOW, I like it and give it an 8.<br/></td>', 'great Portrait, I think that my eye doesnt naturally go to the ear though, its super high quality, but not a WOW, I like it and give it an 8.', '2005-05-02 00:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350602, 170271, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very well done...excellent lighting and contrasts.  Has to be in the top ten.</td>', 'Very well done...excellent lighting and contrasts.  Has to be in the top ten.', '2005-05-02 00:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350604, 169227, 8637, '<td valign="top">Wow..what a great set up and excellent lighting.  Bounces right off the screen.  Greta colors.</td>', 'Wow..what a great set up and excellent lighting.  Bounces right off the screen.  Greta colors.', '2005-05-02 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350605, 168939, 3524, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking image and layout. I like the use of the strong light/dark division to emphasize the two-tone silver and gold. You''ve captured great detail in the gems and settings. Excellent. (9)</td>', 'This is a very striking image and layout. I like the use of the strong light/dark division to emphasize the two-tone silver and gold. You''ve captured great detail in the gems and settings. Excellent. (9)', '2005-05-02 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350606, 169919, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great Idea!  Harshe shadows on the left of the shot, but still--- 8</td>', 'Great Idea!  Harshe shadows on the left of the shot, but still--- 8', '2005-05-02 00:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350611, 170363, 34396, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the angle on this shot.  I think it makes the models fingers look bigger than they really are.</td>', 'I don''t care for the angle on this shot.  I think it makes the models fingers look bigger than they really are.', '2005-05-02 00:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350615, 169252, 3524, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and typography. You''ve done a great job capturing sparkle in the diamonds without going nuts with diffraction spikes. Having the ring face the camera so perpendicularly seems to flatten it though. This is an awesome layout. (8)</td>', 'Very nice composition and typography. You''ve done a great job capturing sparkle in the diamonds without going nuts with diffraction spikes. Having the ring face the camera so perpendicularly seems to flatten it though. This is an awesome layout. (8)', '2005-05-02 00:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350616, 170278, 5705, '<td valign="top">ypu have some great sparkle on this shot,, I woulda cropped the bottom off a little more, nice job though ...</td>', 'ypu have some great sparkle on this shot,, I woulda cropped the bottom off a little more, nice job though ...', '2005-05-02 00:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350618, 170331, 9581, '<td valign="top">The seashell is a bit much, maybe the other side of it instead of the opening would make this better.. I like the pearls on the black though..</td>', 'The seashell is a bit much, maybe the other side of it instead of the opening would make this better.. I like the pearls on the black though..', '2005-05-02 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350619, 170230, 34396, '<td valign="top">The reflection off of the water is a bit too strong.  It overpowers the rings.</td>', 'The reflection off of the water is a bit too strong.  It overpowers the rings.', '2005-05-02 00:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350620, 169349, 8637, '<td valign="top">The reflections take away from what otherwise might be a good shot.  Also, watch ads are almost always shot with the hands at 10 and 2.</td>', 'The reflections take away from what otherwise might be a good shot.  Also, watch ads are almost always shot with the hands at 10 and 2.', '2005-05-02 00:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
