(1350637, 170349, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The rings are well focused and lighting is good.  The small speck in the center top of frame is distracting and could have been cropped out.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The rings are well focused and lighting is good.  The small speck in the center top of frame is distracting and could have been cropped out.', '2005-05-02 00:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350638, 169741, 8637, '<td valign="top">Subtle and very well presented ad..I will give this one of my highest ratings...9...but bet it will not do that well.  Pity!  Excellent work.</td>', 'Subtle and very well presented ad..I will give this one of my highest ratings...9...but bet it will not do that well.  Pity!  Excellent work.', '2005-05-02 00:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350640, 170183, 5705, '<td valign="top">Umm, Well I only speak english, so I dont know what the text means..<br/>But I love your shot-- gl-- 9</td>', 'Umm, Well I only speak english, so I dont know what the text means..But I love your shot-- gl-- 9', '2005-05-02 00:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350641, 169970, 3524, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the ring and backround beautifully. It looks like you ran into one of the challenges I noticed when shooting jewely--the reflected background. As I look at the reflection, I''m curious, did you shoot this in a window display? If so, I''m impressed. If there were some way you could shoot it without getting your own reflection in the ring, that would probably make that part of the reflection less distracting and more ambient. I also like your font choice and position, although the lightness of the chosen color makes it hide somewhat. (7)</td>', 'You''ve captured the ring and backround beautifully. It looks like you ran into one of the challenges I noticed when shooting jewely--the reflected background. As I look at the reflection, I''m curious, did you shoot this in a window display? If so, I''m impressed. If there were some way you could shoot it without getting your own reflection in the ring, that would probably make that part of the reflection less distracting and more ambient. I also like your font choice and position, although the lightness of the chosen color makes it hide somewhat. (7)', '2005-05-02 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350647, 170325, 34396, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast between the flower and the jewelry.  It gets lost there.</td>', 'Not enough contrast between the flower and the jewelry.  It gets lost there.', '2005-05-02 00:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350648, 170051, 8637, '<td valign="top">Excellent presentation...lighting is superb.</td>', 'Excellent presentation...lighting is superb.', '2005-05-02 00:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350649, 169302, 5705, '<td valign="top">Nice original concept, little Cheesy, but effective,, I like it</td>', 'Nice original concept, little Cheesy, but effective,, I like it', '2005-05-02 00:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
