(1350664, 168595, 3524, '<td valign="top">You''ve got nice light, focus and reflections in the gold and pearl. It''s really a beautiful work of art, and I''m pretty sure you were trying to reinforce its exotic nature, but the complexity of the flower you''ve set it on is really distracting to me. It camoflauges the interesting contours of the piece.</td>', 'You''ve got nice light, focus and reflections in the gold and pearl. It''s really a beautiful work of art, and I''m pretty sure you were trying to reinforce its exotic nature, but the complexity of the flower you''ve set it on is really distracting to me. It camoflauges the interesting contours of the piece.', '2005-05-02 00:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1350665, 170230, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but I dont like the reflection as much from the water..</td>', 'I like the composition but I dont like the reflection as much from the water..', '2005-05-02 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
