(1350764, 169025, 35538, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted and left me the great comments. This is the first time I have scored in the top 100 and so far is my highest scoring picture.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted and left me the great comments. This is the first time I have scored in the top 100 and so far is my highest scoring picture.', '2005-05-02 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
