(1362414, 169694, 25655, '<td valign="top">I keep getting "WOW"-ed by your pp work. It is extraordinary!<br/>The photo looks so glamorous, made of gold.<br/>Funny, the ring itself is so contrasted, that it has wild hot-spots against too dark parts. Yet, it attracts the eye so beautifully, I would go look for this ring in the near store!<br/>As an add - it works wonderfuly. As a photograph - it''s even better!<br/>As a photographer, you definately are in the right place :-)</td>', 'I keep getting "WOW"-ed by your pp work. It is extraordinary!The photo looks so glamorous, made of gold.Funny, the ring itself is so contrasted, that it has wild hot-spots against too dark parts. Yet, it attracts the eye so beautifully, I would go look for this ring in the near store!As an add - it works wonderfuly. As a photograph - it''s even better!As a photographer, you definately are in the right place :-)', '2005-05-05 05:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
